// chargé à la demande (ikLoad("exdb")) : tutos pas à pas FR/EN/AR + programmes de rééducation
window.EXD_STEPS={"Dead_Bug":[["Allongé sur le dos, bras tendus vers le plafond, genoux fléchis à 90°, lombaires plaquées au sol.","Étends lentement un bras vers l'arrière et la jambe opposée vers l'avant sans décoller le bas du dos.","Reviens au centre, change de côté. Expire en étendant."],["Begin lying on your back with your hands extended above you toward the ceiling.","Bring your feet, knees, and hips up to 90 degrees.","Exhale hard to bring your ribcage down and flatten your back onto the floor, rotating your pelvis up and squeezing your glutes. Hold this position throughout the movement. This will be your starting position.","Initiate the exercise by extending one leg, straightening the knee and hip to bring the leg just above the ground.","Maintain the position of your lumbar and pelvis as you perform the movement, as your back is going to want to arch."],["استلقِ على ظهرك مع رفع الذراعين نحو السقف وثني الركبتين 90° وإلصاق أسفل الظهر بالأرض.","مدّ ذراعاً للخلف والساق المعاكسة للأمام ببطء دون رفع أسفل الظهر.","ارجع إلى الوسط وبدّل الجهة. أخرج الزفير أثناء المدّ."]],"Pallof_Press":[["Debout de profil à la poulie, poignée contre la poitrine, pieds largeur d'épaules, ventre gainé.","Tends les bras devant toi en résistant à la rotation du buste, tiens 2 s.","Ramène la poignée à la poitrine sans bouger les hanches. Fais les deux côtés."],["Connect a standard handle to a tower, and—if possible—position the cable to shoulder height. If not, a low pulley will suffice.","With your side to the cable, grab the handle with both hands and step away from the tower. You should be approximately arm's length away from the pulley, with the tension of the weight on the cable.","With your feet positioned hip-width apart and knees slightly bent, hold the cable to the middle of your chest. This will be your starting position.","Press the cable away from your chest, fully extending both arms. You core should be tight and engaged.","Hold the repetition for several seconds before returning to the starting position."],["قف جانبياً أمام البكرة والمقبض عند الصدر والقدمان بعرض الكتفين.","مدّ ذراعيك للأمام مع مقاومة دوران الجذع وثبّت ثانيتين.","أعد المقبض إلى الصدر دون تحريك الوركين، وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Reverse_Crunch":[["Allongé sur le dos, jambes fléchies en l'air, mains au sol ou sous les fesses.","Enroule le bassin pour monter les genoux vers la poitrine en décollant légèrement les fesses.","Redescends lentement sans lâcher la tension du ventre."],["Lie down on the floor with your legs fully extended and arms to the side of your torso with the palms on the floor. Your arms should be stationary for the entire exercise.","Move your legs up so that your thighs are perpendicular to the floor and feet are together and parallel to the floor. This is the starting position.","While inhaling, move your legs towards the torso as you roll your pelvis backwards and you raise your hips off the floor. At the end of this movement your knees will be touching your chest.","Hold the contraction for a second and move your legs back to the starting position while exhaling.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["استلقِ على الظهر مع ثني الساقين في الهواء ويداك على الأرض.","لفّ الحوض لرفع الركبتين نحو الصدر مع رفع الأرداف قليلاً.","انزل ببطء مع الحفاظ على شدّ البطن."]],"Bent-Knee_Hip_Raise":[["Allongé sur le dos, bras le long du corps, genoux fléchis au-dessus des hanches.","Pousse les pieds vers le plafond pour décoller le bassin du sol, par contraction du ventre.","Redescends en contrôle, sans élan."],["Lay flat on the floor with your arms next to your sides.","Now bend your knees at around a 75 degree angle and lift your feet off the floor by around 2 inches.","Using your lower abs, bring your knees in towards you as you maintain the 75 degree angle bend in your legs. Continue this movement until you raise your hips off of the floor by rolling your pelvis backward. Breathe out as you perform this portion of the movement. Tip: At the end of the movement your knees will be over your chest.","Squeeze your abs at the top of the movement for a second and then return to the starting position slowly as you breathe in. Tip: Maintain a controlled motion at all times.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["استلقِ على الظهر والذراعان بجانب الجسم والركبتان مثنيتان فوق الوركين.","ادفع القدمين نحو السقف لرفع الحوض عن الأرض بقوة البطن.","انزل بتحكم دون اندفاع."]],"Standing_Cable_Wood_Chop":[["Debout de côté à la poulie haute, les deux mains sur la poignée, pieds écartés.","Tire en diagonale vers la hanche opposée en pivotant le buste et les pieds, bras presque tendus.","Reviens en contrôle. Garde le bassin stable. Fais les deux côtés."],["Connect a standard handle to a tower, and move the cable to the highest pulley position.","With your side to the cable, grab the handle with one hand and step away from the tower. You should be approximately arm's length away from the pulley, with the tension of the weight on the cable. Your outstretched arm should be aligned with the cable.","With your feet positioned shoulder width apart, reach upward with your other hand and grab the handle with both hands. Your arms should still be fully extended.","In one motion, pull the handle down and across your body to your front knee while rotating your torso.","Keep your back and arms straight and core tight while you pivot your back foot and bend your knees to get a full range of motion."],["قف جانبياً أمام البكرة العالية وكلتا اليدين على المقبض والقدمان متباعدتان.","اسحب قطرياً نحو الورك المعاكس مع تدوير الجذع والقدمين والذراعان شبه ممدودتين.","ارجع بتحكم مع ثبات الحوض وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Air_Bike":[["Allongé sur le dos, mains légèrement derrière la tête, jambes décollées.","Amène le coude vers le genou opposé en tendant l'autre jambe, comme un pédalage.","Alterne à rythme contrôlé sans tirer sur la nuque."],["Lie flat on the floor with your lower back pressed to the ground. For this exercise, you will need to put your hands beside your head. Be careful however to not strain with the neck as you perform it. Now lift your shoulders into the crunch position.","Bring knees up to where they are perpendicular to the floor, with your lower legs parallel to the floor. This will be your starting position.","Now simultaneously, slowly go through a cycle pedal motion kicking forward with the right leg and bringing in the knee of the left leg. Bring your right elbow close to your left knee by crunching to the side, as you breathe out.","Go back to the initial position as you breathe in.","Crunch to the opposite side as you cycle your legs and bring closer your left elbow to your right knee and exhale."],["استلقِ على الظهر واليدان خلف الرأس برفق والساقان مرفوعتان.","قرّب المرفق من الركبة المعاكسة مع مدّ الساق الأخرى كالدواسة.","بدّل بإيقاع متحكَّم دون شدّ الرقبة."]],"Cross-Body_Crunch":[["Allongé sur le dos, mains derrière la tête, jambes fléchies.","Monte une épaule vers le genou opposé en gardant l'autre coude ouvert.","Redescends sans poser complètement la tête et change de côté."],["Lie flat on your back and bend your knees about 60 degrees.","Keep your feet flat on the floor and place your hands loosely behind your head. This will be your starting position.","Now curl up and bring your right elbow and shoulder across your body while bring your left knee in toward your left shoulder at the same time. Reach with your elbow and try to touch your knee. Exhale as you perform this movement. Tip: Try to bring your shoulder up towards your knee rather than just your elbow and remember that the key is to contract the abs as you perform the movement; not just to move the elbow.","Now go back down to the starting position as you inhale and repeat with the left elbow and the right knee.","Continue alternating in this manner until all prescribed repetitions are done."],["استلقِ على الظهر واليدان خلف الرأس والساقان مثنيتان.","ارفع كتفاً نحو الركبة المعاكسة مع إبقاء المرفق الآخر مفتوحاً.","انزل دون إسناد الرأس كلياً وبدّل الجهة."]],"Flat_Bench_Leg_Pull-In":[["Assis au bord du banc, mains de chaque côté, jambes tendues devant, buste légèrement incliné.","Ramène les genoux vers la poitrine en rapprochant le buste.","Étends les jambes sans poser les pieds, en contrôle."],["Lie on an exercise mat or a flat bench with your legs off the end.","Place your hands either under your glutes with your palms down or by the sides holding on to the bench (or with palms down by the side on an exercise mat). Also extend your legs straight out. This will be your starting position.","Bend your knees and pull your upper thighs into your midsection as you breathe out. Continue this movement until your knees are near your chest. Hold the contracted position for a second.","As you breathe in, slowly return to the starting position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اجلس على حافة المقعد ويداك على الجانبين والساقان ممدودتان والجذع مائل قليلاً.","اسحب الركبتين نحو الصدر مع تقريب الجذع.","مدّ الساقين دون وضع القدمين على الأرض وبتحكم."]],"Oblique_Crunches_-_On_The_Floor":[["Allongé sur le dos, genoux fléchis tombés sur le côté, main derrière la tête.","Décolle l'épaule en contractant les obliques, sans tirer sur la nuque.","Redescends sans te relâcher complètement. Reprends puis change de côté."],["Start out by lying on your right side with your legs lying on top of each other. Make sure your knees are bent a little bit.","Place your left hand behind your head.","Once you are in this set position, begin by moving your left elbow up as you would perform a normal crunch except this time the main emphasis is on your obliques.","Crunch as high as you can, hold the contraction for a second and then slowly drop back down into the starting position.","Remember to breathe in during the eccentric (lowering) part of the exercise and to breathe out during the concentric (elevation) part of the exercise."],["استلقِ على الظهر مع إمالة الركبتين المثنيتين إلى جانب ويد خلف الرأس.","ارفع الكتف بتقلص المائلة دون شدّ الرقبة.","انزل دون ارتخاء كامل وكرّر ثم بدّل الجهة."]],"Sit-Up":[["Allongé sur le dos, pieds ancrés ou tenus, genoux fléchis, bras croisés sur la poitrine.","Enroule le buste jusqu'à la position assise en gardant le menton légèrement rentré.","Redescends en contrôle sans te laisser tomber."],["Lie down on the floor placing your feet either under something that will not move or by having a partner hold them. Your legs should be bent at the knees.","Place your hands behind your head and lock them together by clasping your fingers. This is the starting position.","Elevate your upper body so that it creates an imaginary V-shape with your thighs. Breathe out when performing this part of the exercise.","Once you feel the contraction for a second, lower your upper body back down to the starting position while inhaling.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["استلقِ على الظهر مع تثبيت القدمين وثني الركبتين وعقد الذراعين على الصدر.","لفّ الجذع حتى الجلوس مع إبقاء الذقن مائلاً قليلاً.","انزل بتحكم دون سقوط."]],"Spider_Crawl":[["En position de pompe, mains sous les épaules, corps aligné.","Avance une jambe en amenant le genou vers le coude du même côté, bassin stable.","Alterne en marchant lentement, ventre gainé, sans cambrer."],["Begin in a prone position on the floor. Support your weight on your hands and toes, with your feet together and your body straight. Your arms should be bent to 90 degrees. This will be your starting position.","Initiate the movement by raising one foot off of the ground. Externally rotate the leg and bring the knee toward your elbow, as far forward as possible.","Return this leg to the starting position and repeat on the opposite side."],["اتخذ وضع الضغط واليدان تحت الكتفين والجسم مستقيم.","قدّم ساقاً بإحضار الركبة نحو المرفق من نفس الجهة مع ثبات الحوض.","بدّل بالمشي ببطء مع شدّ البطن دون تقوّس الظهر."]],"Ab_Crunch_Machine":[["Assieds-toi, règle le siège, saisis les poignées près de la poitrine.","Enroule le buste vers l'avant en contractant les abdos, sans tirer avec les bras.","Reviens lentement en gardant la tension."],["Select a light resistance and sit down on the ab machine placing your feet under the pads provided and grabbing the top handles. Your arms should be bent at a 90 degree angle as you rest the triceps on the pads provided. This will be your starting position.","At the same time, begin to lift the legs up as you crunch your upper torso. Breathe out as you perform this movement. Tip: Be sure to use a slow and controlled motion. Concentrate on using your abs to move the weight while relaxing your legs and feet.","After a second pause, slowly return to the starting position as you breathe in.","Repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions."],["اجلس واضبط المقعد وأمسك المقابض قرب الصدر.","لفّ الجذع للأمام بتقلص البطن دون السحب بالذراعين.","ارجع ببطء مع الحفاظ على الشدّ."]],"Kettlebell_Windmill":[["Debout, kettlebell tenu bras tendu au-dessus de la tête, regard sur la charge, pieds écartés.","Pousse la hanche du côté de la charge et descends l'autre main le long de la jambe en gardant le bras vertical.","Remonte en contrôle. Exercice de mobilité : commence très léger."],["Place a kettlebell in front of your lead foot and clean and press it overhead with your opposite arm. Clean the kettlebell to your shoulder by extending through the legs and hips as you pull the kettlebell towards your shoulders. Rotate your wrist as you do so, so that the palm faces forward. Press it overhead by extending the elbow.","Keeping the kettlebell locked out at all times, push your butt out in the direction of the locked out kettlebell. Turn your feet out at a forty-five degree angle from the arm with the locked out kettlebell. Bending at the hip to one side, sticking your butt out, slowly lean until you can touch the floor with your free hand. Keep your eyes on the kettlebell that you hold over your head at all times.","Pause for a second after reaching the ground and reverse the motion back to the starting position."],["قف وحمل الكيتل بل بذراع ممدودة فوق الرأس والنظر إليه والقدمان متباعدتان.","ادفع الورك نحو جهة الثقل وأنزل اليد الأخرى على الساق مع بقاء الذراع عمودية.","اصعد بتحكم. تمرين مرونة: ابدأ بوزن خفيف جداً."]],"Decline_Crunch":[["Installe-toi sur le banc décliné, pieds calés, mains croisées sur la poitrine.","Monte le buste en enroulant la colonne, sans tirer sur la nuque.","Redescends lentement sans toucher le banc avec les épaules."],["Secure your legs at the end of the decline bench and lie down.","Now place your hands lightly on either side of your head keeping your elbows in. Tip: Don't lock your fingers behind your head.","While pushing the small of your back down in the bench to better isolate your abdominal muscles, begin to roll your shoulders off it.","Continue to push down as hard as you can with your lower back as you contract your abdominals and exhale. Your shoulders should come up off the bench only about four inches, and your lower back should remain on the bench. At the top of the movement, contract your abdominals hard and keep the contraction for a second. Tip: Focus on slow, controlled movement - don't cheat yourself by using momentum.","After the one second contraction, begin to come down slowly again to the starting position as you inhale."],["اجلس على المقعد المائل مع تثبيت القدمين واليدان متقاطعتان على الصدر.","ارفع الجذع بلفّ العمود الفقري دون شدّ الرقبة.","انزل ببطء دون ملامسة الكتفين للمقعد."]],"Cable_Seated_Crunch":[["Assis face à la poulie, corde tenue contre le front, genoux légèrement fléchis.","Enroule la colonne en rapprochant les côtes du bassin, sans bouger les hanches.","Reviens lentement en gardant les abdos contractés."],["Seat on a flat bench with your back facing a high pulley.","Grasp the cable rope attachment with both hands (with the palms of the hands facing each other) and place your hands securely over both shoulders. Tip: Allow the weight to hyperextend the lower back slightly. This will be your starting position.","With the hips stationary, flex the waist so the elbows travel toward the hips. Breathe out as you perform this step.","As you inhale, go back to the initial position slowly.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اجلس أمام البكرة والحبل عند الجبهة والركبتان مثنيتان قليلاً.","لفّ العمود الفقري بتقريب الأضلاع من الحوض دون تحريك الوركين.","ارجع ببطء مع بقاء البطن مشدوداً."]],"Monster_Walk":[["Place un élastique autour des cuisses ou chevilles, pieds largeur d'épaules, genoux légèrement fléchis.","Fais des pas latéraux en gardant la tension de l'élastique et les genoux alignés sur les pieds.","Alterne gauche et droite sans faire descendre le bassin."],["Place a band around both ankles and another around both knees. There should be enough tension that they are tight when your feet are shoulder width apart.","To begin, take short steps forward alternating your left and right foot.","After several steps, do just the opposite and walk backward to where you started."],["ضع شريطاً مطاطياً حول الفخذين أو الكاحلين والقدمان بعرض الكتفين والركبتان مثنيتان قليلاً.","خذ خطوات جانبية مع الحفاظ على شدّ الشريط ومحاذاة الركبتين للقدمين.","بدّل اليمين واليسار دون هبوط الحوض."]],"Band_Hip_Adductions":[["Fixe l'élastique à un point bas, passe-le autour de la cheville, tiens-toi à un appui.","Ramène la jambe vers l'autre en la croisant devant, sans pencher le buste.","Reviens lentement. Fais tous les essais d'un côté puis l'autre."],["Anchor a band around a solid post or other object.","Stand with your left side to the post, and put your right foot through the band, getting it around the ankle.","Stand up straight and hold onto the post if needed. This will be your starting position.","Keeping the knee straight, raise your right legs out to the side as far as you can.","Return to the starting position and repeat for the desired rep count."],["ثبّت الشريط في نقطة منخفضة ولفّه حول الكاحل وتمسّك بدعامة.","اضمم الساق نحو الأخرى عابراً أمامها دون إمالة الجذع.","ارجع ببطء وأتمّ التكرارات على جهة ثم الأخرى."]],"Alternate_Hammer_Curl":[["Debout, haltères en prise neutre le long du corps, coudes collés.","Fléchis un coude pour monter l'haltère vers l'épaule sans balancer le buste.","Redescends en contrôle et alterne."],["Stand up with your torso upright and a dumbbell in each hand being held at arms length. The elbows should be close to the torso.","The palms of the hands should be facing your torso. This will be your starting position.","While holding the upper arm stationary, curl the right weight forward while contracting the biceps as you breathe out. Continue the movement until your biceps is fully contracted and the dumbbells are at shoulder level. Hold the contracted position for a second as you squeeze the biceps. Tip: Only the forearms should move.","Slowly begin to bring the dumbbells back to starting position as your breathe in.","Repeat the movement with the left hand. This equals one repetition."],["قف والدمبلز بقبضة محايدة بجانب الجسم والمرفقان ملتصقان.","ثنِ مرفقاً لرفع الدمبل نحو الكتف دون تأرجح الجذع.","انزل بتحكم وبدّل."]],"Dumbbell_Alternate_Bicep_Curl":[["Debout, haltères paumes vers l'avant, coudes près du buste.","Monte un haltère en tournant légèrement le poignet, sans bouger le coude.","Redescends lentement avant de monter l'autre."],["Stand (torso upright) with a dumbbell in each hand held at arms length. The elbows should be close to the torso and the palms of your hand should be facing your thighs.","While holding the upper arm stationary, curl the right weight as you rotate the palm of the hands until they are facing forward. At this point continue contracting the biceps as you breathe out until your biceps is fully contracted and the dumbbells are at shoulder level. Hold the contracted position for a second as you squeeze the biceps. Tip: Only the forearms should move.","Slowly begin to bring the dumbbell back to the starting position as your breathe in. Tip: Remember to twist the palms back to the starting position (facing your thighs) as you come down.","Repeat the movement with the left hand. This equals one repetition.","Continue alternating in this manner for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف والدمبلز وراحتاك للأمام والمرفقان قرب الجذع.","ارفع دمبلاً مع تدوير المعصم قليلاً دون تحريك المرفق.","انزل ببطء قبل رفع الآخر."]],"Cable_Preacher_Curl":[["Installe-toi au pupitre, bras posés, barre de poulie basse en prise supination.","Fléchis les coudes sans les décoller du support.","Redescends lentement jusqu'à l'extension presque complète."],["Place a preacher bench about 2 feet in front of a pulley machine.","Attach a straight bar to the low pulley.","Sit at the preacher bench with your elbow and upper arms firmly on top of the bench pad and have someone hand you the bar from the low pulley.","Grab the bar and fully extend your arms on top of the preacher bench pad. This will be your starting position.","Now start pilling the weight up towards your shoulders and squeeze the biceps hard at the top of the movement. Exhale as you perform this motion. Also, hold for a second at the top."],["اجلس على مقعد القسيس وذراعاك مسنودتان والعقلة السفلية بقبضة سفلية.","ثنِ المرفقين دون رفعهما عن الدعامة.","انزل ببطء حتى شبه المدّ الكامل."]],"Machine_Bicep_Curl":[["Règle le siège pour que les coudes soient alignés avec l'axe de la machine.","Fléchis les bras en contractant les biceps, épaules basses.","Reviens en contrôle sans verrouiller brutalement."],["Adjust the seat to the appropriate height and make your weight selection. Place your upper arms against the pads and grasp the handles. This will be your starting position.","Perform the movement by flexing the elbow, pulling your lower arm towards your upper arm.","Pause at the top of the movement, and then slowly return the weight to the starting position.","Avoid returning the weight all the way to the stops until the set is complete to keep tension on the muscles being worked."],["اضبط المقعد ليصطف المرفقان مع محور الجهاز.","ثنِ الذراعين بتقلص العضلة ذات الرأسين والكتفان منخفضان.","ارجع بتحكم دون قفل عنيف."]],"Standing_Biceps_Cable_Curl":[["Debout face à la poulie basse, barre en prise supination, coudes au corps.","Monte la barre vers les épaules sans avancer les coudes.","Redescends lentement en gardant la tension du câble."],["Stand up with your torso upright while holding a cable curl bar that is attached to a low pulley. Grab the cable bar at shoulder width and keep the elbows close to the torso. The palm of your hands should be facing up (supinated grip). This will be your starting position.","While holding the upper arms stationary, curl the weights while contracting the biceps as you breathe out. Only the forearms should move. Continue the movement until your biceps are fully contracted and the bar is at shoulder level. Hold the contracted position for a second as you squeeze the muscle.","Slowly begin to bring the curl bar back to starting position as your breathe in.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف أمام البكرة السفلية والعقلة بقبضة سفلية والمرفقان بجانب الجسم.","ارفع العقلة نحو الكتفين دون تقديم المرفقين.","انزل ببطء مع بقاء شدّ الكابل."]],"Zottman_Curl":[["Debout, haltères paumes vers l'avant, coudes fixes.","Monte les haltères en supination jusqu'aux épaules.","Au sommet, tourne les poignets (paumes vers le bas) et redescends lentement."],["Stand up with your torso upright and a dumbbell in each hand being held at arms length. The elbows should be close to the torso.","Make sure the palms of the hands are facing each other. This will be your starting position.","While holding the upper arm stationary, curl the weights while contracting the biceps as you breathe out. Only the forearms should move. Your wrist should rotate so that you have a supinated (palms up) grip. Continue the movement until your biceps are fully contracted and the dumbbells are at shoulder level.","Hold the contracted position for a second as you squeeze the biceps.","Now during the contracted position, rotate your wrist until you now have a pronated (palms facing down) grip with the thumb at a higher position than the pinky."],["قف والدمبلز والراحتان للأمام والمرفقان ثابتان.","ارفع الدمبلز بقبضة سفلية حتى الكتفين.","في القمة أدر المعصمين (الراحتان للأسفل) وانزل ببطء."]],"Reverse_Barbell_Curl":[["Debout, barre en prise pronation (paumes vers le bas), mains largeur d'épaules.","Monte la barre en gardant les poignets neutres et les coudes fixes.","Redescends lentement. Charge légère : travaille avant-bras et brachial."],["Stand up with your torso upright while holding a barbell at shoulder width with the elbows close to the torso. The palm of your hands should be facing down (pronated grip). This will be your starting position.","While holding the upper arms stationary, curl the weights while contracting the biceps as you breathe out. Only the forearms should move. Continue the movement until your biceps are fully contracted and the bar is at shoulder level. Hold the contracted position for a second as you squeeze the muscle.","Slowly begin to bring the bar back to starting position as your breathe in.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف والعقلة بقبضة علوية (الراحتان للأسفل) بعرض الكتفين.","ارفع العقلة مع ثبات المعصمين والمرفقين.","انزل ببطء. وزن خفيف: يعمل الساعد والعضلة العضدية."]],"Seated_Dumbbell_Curl":[["Assis sur un banc, dos droit, haltères paumes vers l'avant.","Fléchis les coudes pour monter les haltères sans balancer.","Redescends en contrôle jusqu'à l'extension."],["Sit on a flat bench with a dumbbell on each hand being held at arms length. The elbows should be close to the torso.","Rotate the palms of the hands so that they are facing your torso. This will be your starting position.","While holding the upper arm stationary, curl the weights and start twisting the wrists once the dumbbells pass your thighs so that the palms of your hands face forward at the end of the movement. Make sure that you contract the biceps as you breathe out and make sure that only the forearms move. Continue the movement until your biceps are fully contracted and the dumbbells are at shoulder level. Hold the contracted position for a second as you squeeze the biceps.","Slowly begin to bring the dumbbells back to the starting position as your breathe in and as you rotate the wrists back to a neutral grip.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اجلس على المقعد والظهر مستقيم والدمبلز والراحتان للأمام.","ثنِ المرفقين لرفع الدمبلز دون تأرجح.","انزل بتحكم حتى المدّ."]],"Standing_Dumbbell_Calf_Raise":[["Debout, haltères le long du corps, pointes de pieds sur une marche si possible.","Monte sur la pointe des pieds aussi haut que possible, 1 s en haut.","Redescends lentement, talons sous le niveau de la marche."],["Stand with your torso upright holding two dumbbells in your hands by your sides. Place the ball of the foot on a sturdy and stable wooden board (that is around 2-3 inches tall) while your heels extend off and touch the floor. This will be your starting position.","With the toes pointing either straight (to hit all parts equally), inwards (for emphasis on the outer head) or outwards (for emphasis on the inner head), raise the heels off the floor as you exhale by contracting the calves. Hold the top contraction for a second.","As you inhale, go back to the starting position by slowly lowering the heels.","Repeat for the recommended amount of times."],["قف والدمبلز بجانبك ومقدمة القدمين على درجة إن أمكن.","ارتفع على أصابع القدمين لأقصى حد وثبّت ثانية.","انزل ببطء حتى ما دون مستوى الدرجة."]],"Calf_Raises_-_With_Bands":[["Assis, jambes tendues, élastique passé sous l'avant du pied et tenu en main.","Pousse la pointe du pied vers l'avant contre la résistance.","Reviens lentement. Idéal à la maison ou en rééducation."],["Grab an exercise band and stand on it with your toes making sure that the length of the band between the foot and the arms is the same for both sides.","While holding the handles of the band, raise the arms to the side of your head as if you were getting ready to perform a shoulder press. The palms should be facing forward with the elbows bent and to the sides. This movement will create tension on the band. This will be your starting position.","Keeping the hands by your shoulder, stand up on your toes as you exhale and contract the calves hard at the top of the movement.","After a one second contraction, slowly go back down to the starting position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اجلس والساقان ممدودتان والشريط تحت مقدمة القدم وبيدك.","ادفع مقدمة القدم للأمام ضد المقاومة.","ارجع ببطء. مناسب للمنزل وإعادة التأهيل."]],"Dumbbell_Seated_One-Leg_Calf_Raise":[["Assis, un haltère posé sur le genou, pointe du pied sur une cale.","Monte le talon en contractant le mollet.","Redescends lentement. Travaille le soléaire."],["Place a block on the floor about 12 inches from a flat bench.","Sit on a flat bench and place a dumbbell on your upper left thigh about 3 inches above your knee.","Now place the ball of your left foot on the block. This will be your starting position.","Raise your toes up as high as possible as you exhale and you contract your calf muscle. Hold the contraction for a second.","Slowly return to the starting position, stretching as far down as possible."],["اجلس ودمبل على الركبة ومقدمة القدم على دعامة.","ارفع الكعب بتقلص السمانة.","انزل ببطء. يعمل على العضلة النعلية."]],"Smith_Machine_Calf_Raise":[["Place-toi sous la barre de la Smith, pointes de pieds sur une cale.","Monte sur la pointe des pieds en gardant le corps droit.","Redescends lentement jusqu'à l'étirement."],["Place a block or weight plate below the bar on the Smith machine. Set the bar to a position that best matches your height. Once the correct height is chosen and the bar is loaded, step onto the plates with the balls of your feet and place the bar on the back of your shoulders.","Take the bar with both hands facing forward. Rotate the bar to unrack it. This will be your starting position.","Raise your heels as high as possible by pushing off of the balls of your feet, flexing your calf at the top of the contraction. Your knees should remain extended. Hold the contracted position for a second before you start to go back down.","Return slowly to the starting position as you breathe in while lowering your heels.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف تحت عقلة سميث ومقدمة القدمين على دعامة.","ارتفع على الأصابع مع بقاء الجسم مستقيماً.","انزل ببطء حتى التمدد."]],"Standing_Barbell_Calf_Raise":[["Debout, barre sur les trapèzes, pointes de pieds sur une marche.","Monte sur la pointe des pieds, 1 s en haut.","Redescends lentement. Garde le dos droit et les genoux souples."],["This exercise is best performed inside a squat rack for safety purposes. To begin, first set the bar on a rack that best matches your height. Once the correct height is chosen and the bar is loaded, step under the bar and place the bar on the back of your shoulders (slightly below the neck).","Hold on to the bar using both arms at each side and lift it off the rack by first pushing with your legs and at the same time straightening your torso.","Step away from the rack and position your legs using a shoulder width medium stance with the toes slightly pointed out. Keep your head up at all times as looking down will get you off balance and also maintain a straight back. The knees should be kept with a slight bend; never locked. This will be your starting position. Tip: For better range of motion you may also place the ball of your feet on a wooden block but be careful as this option requires more balance and a sturdy block.","Raise your heels as you breathe out by extending your ankles as high as possible and flexing your calf. Ensure that the knee is kept stationary at all times. There should be no bending at any time. Hold the contracted position by a second before you start to go back down.","Go back slowly to the starting position as you breathe in by lowering your heels as you bend the ankles until calves are stretched."],["قف والعقلة على أعلى الظهر ومقدمة القدمين على درجة.","ارتفع على الأصابع وثبّت ثانية.","انزل ببطء مع ظهر مستقيم وركبتين مرنتين."]],"Cable_Chest_Press":[["Debout ou assis entre deux poulies, poignées à hauteur de poitrine, coudes à 90°.","Pousse les poignées vers l'avant jusqu'à l'extension, sans hausser les épaules.","Reviens lentement en ressentant l'étirement des pectoraux."],["Adjust the weight to an appropriate amount and be seated, grasping the handles. Your upper arms should be about 45 degrees to the body, with your head and chest up. The elbows should be bent to about 90 degrees. This will be your starting position.","Begin by extending through the elbow, pressing the handles together straight in front of you. Keep your shoulder blades retracted as you execute the movement.","After pausing at full extension, return to th starting position, keeping tension on the cables.","You can also execute this movement with your back off the pad, at an incline or decline, or alternate hands."],["قف أو اجلس بين بكرتين والمقبضان عند الصدر والمرفقان 90°.","ادفع المقبضين للأمام حتى المدّ دون رفع الكتفين.","ارجع ببطء مع الإحساس بتمدد الصدر."]],"Machine_Bench_Press":[["Règle le siège pour que les poignées soient à hauteur de poitrine, dos plaqué.","Pousse jusqu'à l'extension sans verrouiller les coudes.","Reviens lentement. Parfait pour débuter ou finir une séance."],["Sit down on the Chest Press Machine and select the weight.","Step on the lever provided by the machine since it will help you to bring the handles forward so that you can grab the handles and fully extend the arms.","Grab the handles with a palms-down grip and lift your elbows so that your upper arms are parallel to the floor to the sides of your torso. Tip: Your forearms will be pointing forward since you are grabbing the handles. Once you bring the handles forward and extend the arms you will be at the starting position.","Now bring the handles back towards you as you breathe in.","Push the handles away from you as you flex your pecs and you breathe out. Hold the contraction for a second before going back to the starting position."],["اضبط المقعد ليكون المقبضان عند الصدر والظهر ملتصق.","ادفع حتى المدّ دون قفل المرفقين.","ارجع ببطء. مناسب للمبتدئين أو لنهاية الحصة."]],"Leverage_Incline_Chest_Press":[["Assieds-toi sur la machine inclinée, dos plaqué, poignées au niveau du haut de la poitrine.","Pousse vers le haut et l'avant jusqu'à l'extension.","Reviens en contrôle, omoplates serrées."],["Load an appropriate weight onto the pins and adjust the seat for your height. The handles should be near the top of the pectorals at the beginning of the motion. Your chest and head should be up and your shoulder blades retracted. This will be your starting position.","Press the handles forward by extending through the elbow.","After a brief pause at the top, return the weight just above the start position, keeping tension on the muscles by not returning the weight to the stops until the set is complete."],["اجلس على الجهاز المائل والظهر ملتصق والمقبضان عند أعلى الصدر.","ادفع للأعلى والأمام حتى المدّ.","ارجع بتحكم مع شدّ لوحي الكتف."]],"Incline_Cable_Chest_Press":[["Banc incliné entre deux poulies basses, poignées au niveau des épaules.","Pousse vers le haut et le centre en gardant les poignets neutres.","Reviens lentement jusqu'à l'étirement."],["Adjust the weight to an appropriate amount and be seated, grasping the handles. Your upper arms should be about 45 degrees to the body, with your head and chest up. The elbows should be bent to about 90 degrees. This will be your starting position.","Begin by extending through the elbow, pressing the handles together straight in front of you. Keep your shoulder blades retracted as you execute the movement.","After pausing at full extension, return to the starting position, keeping tension on the cables."],["مقعد مائل بين بكرتين سفليتين والمقبضان عند الكتفين.","ادفع للأعلى والوسط مع معصمين محايدين.","ارجع ببطء حتى التمدد."]],"Decline_Dumbbell_Bench_Press":[["Allongé sur banc décliné, haltères au niveau de la poitrine, pieds calés.","Pousse les haltères au-dessus de la poitrine sans verrouiller.","Redescends en contrôle jusqu'à l'étirement des pectoraux."],["Secure your legs at the end of the decline bench and lie down with a dumbbell on each hand on top of your thighs. The palms of your hand will be facing each other.","Once you are laying down, move the dumbbells in front of you at shoulder width.","Once at shoulder width, rotate your wrists forward so that the palms of your hands are facing away from you. This will be your starting position.","Bring down the weights slowly to your side as you breathe out. Keep full control of the dumbbells at all times. Tip: Throughout the motion, the forearms should always be perpendicular to the floor.","As you breathe out, push the dumbbells up using your pectoral muscles. Lock your arms in the contracted position, squeeze your chest, hold for a second and then start coming down slowly. Tip: It should take at least twice as long to go down than to come up.."],["استلقِ على مقعد منحدر والدمبلز عند الصدر والقدمان مثبتتان.","ادفع الدمبلز فوق الصدر دون قفل.","انزل بتحكم حتى تمدد الصدر."]],"Incline_Push-Up":[["Mains sur un banc ou une marche, corps aligné de la tête aux talons.","Fléchis les coudes pour amener la poitrine vers le support.","Pousse pour remonter sans cambrer. Version facile des pompes."],["Stand facing bench or sturdy elevated platform. Place hands on edge of bench or platform, slightly wider than shoulder width.","Position forefoot back from bench or platform with arms and body straight. Arms should be perpendicular to body. Keeping body straight, lower chest to edge of box or platform by bending arms.","Push body up until arms are extended. Repeat."],["ضع اليدين على مقعد أو درجة والجسم مستقيم من الرأس إلى الكعبين.","ثنِ المرفقين لتقريب الصدر من الدعامة.","ادفع للصعود دون تقوّس الظهر. نسخة أسهل من الضغط."]],"Push-Up_Wide":[["Mains plus larges que les épaules, corps gainé de la tête aux talons.","Descends la poitrine vers le sol en gardant les coudes à 45°–60°.","Pousse pour remonter. Cible davantage les pectoraux."],["With your hands wide apart, support your body on your toes and hands in a plank position. Your elbows should be extended and your body straight. Do not allow your hips to sag. This will be your starting position.","To begin, allow the elbows to flex, lowering your chest to the floor as you inhale.","Using your pectoral muscles, press your upper body back up to the starting position by extending the elbows. Exhale as you perform this step.","After pausing at the contracted position, repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions."],["اليدان أعرض من الكتفين والجسم مشدود من الرأس إلى الكعبين.","انزل بالصدر نحو الأرض مع مرفقين بزاوية 45°–60°.","ادفع للصعود. يركّز أكثر على الصدر."]],"Push-Ups_With_Feet_Elevated":[["Pieds sur un banc, mains au sol sous les épaules, corps aligné.","Descends la poitrine vers le sol en gardant le ventre gainé.","Remonte en poussant. Cible le haut des pectoraux."],["Lie on the floor face down and place your hands about 36 inches apart from each other holding your torso up at arms length.","Place your toes on top of a flat bench. This will allow your body to be elevated. Note: The higher the elevation of the flat bench, the higher the resistance of the exercise is.","Lower yourself until your chest almost touches the floor as you inhale.","Using your pectoral muscles, press your upper body back up to the starting position and squeeze your chest. Breathe out as you perform this step.","After a second pause at the contracted position, repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions."],["القدمان على مقعد واليدان على الأرض تحت الكتفين والجسم مستقيم.","انزل بالصدر نحو الأرض مع شدّ البطن.","اصعد بالدفع. يركّز على أعلى الصدر."]],"Flat_Bench_Cable_Flyes":[["Allongé sur un banc plat entre deux poulies basses, bras tendus au-dessus de la poitrine.","Ouvre les bras en arc, coudes légèrement fléchis, jusqu'à l'étirement.","Referme en contractant les pectoraux."],["Position a flat bench between two low pulleys so that when you are laying on it, your chest will be lined up with the cable pulleys.","Lay flat on the bench and keep your feet on the ground.","Have someone hand you the handles on each hand. You will grab each single handle attachment with a palms up grip.","Extend your arms by your side with a slight bend on your elbows. Tip: You will keep this bend constant through the whole movement. Your arms should be parallel to the floor. This is your starting position.","Now start lifting the arms in a semi-circle motion directly in front of you by pulling the cables together until both hands meet at the top of the movement. Squeeze your chest as you perform this motion and breathe out during this movement. Also, hold the contraction for a second at the top. Tip: When performed correctly, at the top position of this movement, your arms should be perpendicular to your torso and the floor touching above your chest."],["استلقِ على مقعد مسطح بين بكرتين سفليتين والذراعان فوق الصدر.","افتح الذراعين على شكل قوس مع مرفقين مثنيين قليلاً حتى التمدد.","أغلق مع تقلص الصدر."]],"Low_Cable_Crossover":[["Debout entre deux poulies basses, buste légèrement penché, poignées en main.","Monte les bras en arc vers le haut du visage en serrant les pectoraux.","Redescends lentement. Cible le haut des pectoraux."],["To move into the starting position, place the pulleys at the low position, select the resistance to be used and grasp a handle in each hand.","Step forward, gaining tension in the pulleys. Your palms should be facing forward, hands below the waist, and your arms straight. This will be your starting position.","With a slight bend in your arms, draw your hands upward and toward the midline of your body. Your hands should come together in front of your chest, palms facing up.","Return your arms back to the starting position after a brief pause."],["قف بين بكرتين سفليتين والجذع مائل قليلاً والمقبضان بيديك.","ارفع الذراعين في قوس نحو أعلى الوجه مع شدّ الصدر.","انزل ببطء. يركّز على أعلى الصدر."]],"Smith_Machine_Bench_Press":[["Allongé sous la barre de la Smith, mains un peu plus larges que les épaules.","Décroche, descends la barre vers le bas de la poitrine.","Pousse jusqu'à l'extension et raccroche en fin de série."],["Place a flat bench underneath the smith machine. Now place the barbell at a height that you can reach when lying down and your arms are almost fully extended. Once the weight you need is selected, lie down on the flat bench. Using a pronated grip that is wider than shoulder width, unlock the bar from the rack and hold it straight over you with your arms locked. This will be your starting position.","As you breathe in, come down slowly until you feel the bar on your middle chest.","After a second pause, bring the bar back to the starting position as you breathe out and push the bar using your chest muscles. Lock your arms in the contracted position, hold for a second and then start coming down slowly again. Tip: It should take at least twice as long to go down than to come up.","Repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions.","When you are done, lock the bar back in the rack."],["استلقِ تحت عقلة سميث واليدان أعرض قليلاً من الكتفين.","حرّر العقلة وأنزلها نحو أسفل الصدر.","ادفع حتى المدّ وأعدها للتثبيت عند نهاية المجموعة."]],"Wide-Grip_Barbell_Bench_Press":[["Allongé sur le banc, prise large, pieds ancrés, omoplates serrées.","Descends la barre jusqu'à la poitrine, coudes ouverts.","Pousse en contrôle. Utilise un pareur pour les charges lourdes."],["Lie back on a flat bench with feet firm on the floor. Using a wide, pronated (palms forward) grip that is around 3 inches away from shoulder width (for each hand), lift the bar from the rack and hold it straight over you with your arms locked. The bar will be perpendicular to the torso and the floor. This will be your starting position.","As you breathe in, come down slowly until you feel the bar on your middle chest.","After a second pause, bring the bar back to the starting position as you breathe out and push the bar using your chest muscles. Lock your arms and squeeze your chest in the contracted position, hold for a second and then start coming down slowly again. Tip: It should take at least twice as long to go down than to come up.","Repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions."],["استلقِ على المقعد بقبضة واسعة والقدمان ثابتتان ولوحا الكتف مشدودان.","أنزل العقلة إلى الصدر مع مرفقين مفتوحين.","ادفع بتحكم. استعن بمساعد مع الأوزان الثقيلة."]],"Dumbbell_Bench_Press_with_Neutral_Grip":[["Allongé sur le banc, haltères paumes face à face, au niveau de la poitrine.","Pousse en gardant les coudes près du corps.","Redescends lentement. Ménage mieux les épaules."],["Take a dumbbell in each hand and lay back onto a flat bench. Your feet should be flat on the floor and your shoulder blades retracted.","Maintaining a neutral grip, palms facing each other, begin with your arms extended directly above you, perpendicular to the floor. This will be your starting position.","Begin the movement by flexing the elbow, lowering the upper arms to the side. Descend until the dumbbells are to your torso.","Pause, then extend the elbow and return to the starting position."],["استلقِ والدمبلز براحتين متقابلتين عند الصدر.","ادفع مع إبقاء المرفقين قرب الجسم.","انزل ببطء. أرفق بالكتفين."]],"Bench_Press_-_With_Bands":[["Allongé sur le banc ou au sol, élastique passé dans le dos et tenu aux mains.","Pousse les poignées vers le plafond contre la résistance.","Reviens lentement. Pratique à la maison."],["Using a flat bench secure a band under the leg of the bench that is nearest to your head.","Once the band is secure, grab it by both handles and lie down on the bench.","Extend your arms so that you are holding the band handles in front of you at shoulder width.","Once at shoulder width, rotate your wrists forward so that the palms of your hands are facing away from you. This will be your starting position.","Bring down the handles slowly until your elbow forms a 90 degree angle. Keep full control at all times."],["استلقِ على المقعد أو الأرض والشريط خلف الظهر وبين اليدين.","ادفع المقبضين نحو السقف ضد المقاومة.","ارجع ببطء. عملي في المنزل."]],"Straight-Arm_Dumbbell_Pullover":[["Allongé en travers du banc, haltère tenu à deux mains au-dessus de la poitrine.","Descends l'haltère derrière la tête en gardant les bras presque tendus.","Remonte en contractant pectoraux et dorsaux."],["Place a dumbbell standing up on a flat bench.","Ensuring that the dumbbell stays securely placed at the top of the bench, lie perpendicular to the bench (torso across it as in forming a cross) with only your shoulders lying on the surface. Hips should be below the bench and legs bent with feet firmly on the floor. The head will be off the bench as well.","Grasp the dumbbell with both hands and hold it straight over your chest at arms length. Both palms should be pressing against the underside one of the sides of the dumbbell. This will be your starting position.\nCaution: Always ensure that the dumbbell used for this exercise is secure. Using a dumbbell with loose plates can result in the dumbbell falling apart and falling on your face.","While keeping your arms straight, lower the weight slowly in an arc behind your head while breathing in until you feel a stretch on the chest.","At that point, bring the dumbbell back to the starting position using the arc through which the weight was lowered and exhale as you perform this movement."],["استلقِ بالعرض على المقعد والدمبل بين اليدين فوق الصدر.","أنزل الدمبل خلف الرأس مع ذراعين شبه ممدودتين.","ارفع بتقلص الصدر والظهرية."]],"Single-Arm_Cable_Crossover":[["Debout de côté à une poulie haute, poignée en main, pied opposé en avant.","Ramène la poignée vers le centre du corps en arc, coude légèrement fléchi.","Reviens lentement. Fais les deux côtés."],["Begin by moving the pulleys to the high position, select the resistance to be used, and take a handle in each hand.","Step forward in front of both pulleys with your arms extended in front of you, bringing your hands together. Your head and chest should be up as you lean forward, while your feet should be staggered. This will be your starting position.","Keeping your left arm in place, allow your right arm to extend out to the side, maintaining a slight bend at the elbow. The right arm should be perpendicular to the body at approximately shoulder level.","Return your arm back to the starting position by pulling your hand back to the midline of the body.","Hold for a second at the starting position and repeat the movement on the opposite side. Continue alternating back and forth for the prescribed number of repetitions."],["قف جانبياً أمام بكرة عالية والمقبض بيدك والقدم المعاكسة للأمام.","اسحب المقبض نحو وسط الجسم في قوس مع مرفق مثني قليلاً.","ارجع ببطء وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Seated_Dumbbell_Palms-Up_Wrist_Curl":[["Assis, avant-bras posés sur les cuisses, paumes vers le haut, haltères en main.","Monte les poignets en contractant les avant-bras.","Redescends lentement. Charge légère."],["Start out by placing two dumbbells on the floor in front of a flat bench.","Sit down on the edge of the flat bench with your legs at about shoulder width apart. Make sure to keep your feet on the floor.","Use your arms to grab both of the dumbbells and bring them up so that your forearms are resting against your thighs with the palms of the hands facing up. Your wrists should be hanging over the edge of your thighs.","Start out by curling your wrist upwards and exhaling.","Slowly lower your wrists back down to the starting position while inhaling. Make sure to inhale during this part of the exercise. Tip: Your forearms should be stationary as your wrist is the only movement needed to perform this exercise."],["اجلس والساعدان على الفخذين والراحتان للأعلى والدمبلز بيديك.","ارفع المعصمين بتقلص الساعد.","انزل ببطء. وزن خفيف."]],"Seated_Dumbbell_Palms-Down_Wrist_Curl":[["Assis, avant-bras posés sur les cuisses, paumes vers le bas, haltères en main.","Monte le dos des mains vers le plafond sans bouger les avant-bras.","Redescends lentement. Charge légère."],["Start out by placing two dumbbells on the floor in front of a flat bench.","Sit down on the edge of the flat bench with your legs at about shoulder width apart. Make sure to keep your feet on the floor.","Use your arms to grab both of the dumbbells and bring them up so that your forearms are resting against your thighs with the palms of the hands facing down. Your wrists should be hanging over the edge of your thighs.","Start out by curling your wrist upwards and exhaling.","Slowly lower your wrists back down to the starting position while inhaling. Make sure to inhale during this part of the exercise. Tip: Your forearms should be stationary as your wrist is the only movement needed to perform this exercise."],["اجلس والساعدان على الفخذين والراحتان للأسفل والدمبلز بيديك.","ارفع ظهر اليدين نحو السقف دون تحريك الساعدين.","انزل ببطء. وزن خفيف."]],"Single_Leg_Glute_Bridge":[["Allongé sur le dos, un pied au sol, l'autre jambe tendue en l'air.","Pousse sur le talon pour monter le bassin en alignant épaule-hanche-genou.","Redescends sans poser les fesses et change de côté."],["Lay on the floor with your feet flat and knees bent.","Raise one leg off of the ground, pulling the knee to your chest. This will be your starting position.","Execute the movement by driving through the heel, extending your hip upward and raising your glutes off of the ground.","Extend as far as possible, pause and then return to the starting position."],["استلقِ على الظهر وقدم على الأرض والساق الأخرى ممدودة في الهواء.","ادفع بالكعب لرفع الحوض ليصطف الكتف والورك والركبة.","انزل دون ملامسة الأرداف للأرض ثم بدّل."]],"Glute_Kickback":[["À quatre pattes, dos plat, mains sous les épaules.","Tends une jambe vers l'arrière et le haut en contractant le fessier.","Redescends sans cambrer et change de côté."],["Kneel on the floor or an exercise mat and bend at the waist with your arms extended in front of you (perpendicular to the torso) in order to get into a kneeling push-up position but with the arms spaced at shoulder width. Your head should be looking forward and the bend of the knees should create a 90-degree angle between the hamstrings and the calves. This will be your starting position.","As you exhale, lift up your right leg until the hamstrings are in line with the back while maintaining the 90-degree angle bend. Contract the glutes throughout this movement and hold the contraction at the top for a second. Tip: At the end of the movement the upper leg should be parallel to the floor while the calf should be perpendicular to it.","Go back to the initial position as you inhale and now repeat with the left leg.","Continue to alternate legs until all of the recommended repetitions have been performed."],["على أربع واليدان تحت الكتفين والظهر مستوٍ.","مدّ ساقاً للخلف والأعلى بتقلص الأرداف.","انزل دون تقوّس الظهر وبدّل."]],"Hip_Extension_with_Bands":[["Élastique autour des chevilles ou fixé en bas, debout, appui sur un support.","Envoie la jambe vers l'arrière en gardant le buste droit.","Reviens lentement. Contrôle sans balancer."],["Secure one end of the band to the lower portion of a post and attach the other to one ankle.","Facing the attachment point of the band, hold on to the column to stabilize yourself.","Keeping your head and your chest up, move the resisted leg back as far as you can while keeping the knee straight.","Return the leg to the starting position."],["الشريط حول الكاحلين أو مثبت بالأسفل وأنت واقف بدعامة.","مدّ الساق للخلف مع بقاء الجذع مستقيماً.","ارجع ببطء وبتحكم دون تأرجح."]],"One-Legged_Cable_Kickback":[["Sangle la cheville à la poulie basse, tiens-toi au support, buste légèrement penché.","Pousse la jambe vers l'arrière en contractant le fessier.","Reviens lentement sans cambrer."],["Hook a leather ankle cuff to a low cable pulley and then attach the cuff to your ankle.","Face the weight stack from a distance of about two feet, grasping the steel frame for support.","While keeping your knees and hips bent slightly and your abs tight, contract your glutes to slowly \"kick\" the working leg back in a semicircular arc as high as it will comfortably go as you breathe out. Tip: At full extension, squeeze your glutes for a second in order to achieve a peak contraction.","Now slowly bring your working leg forward, resisting the pull of the cable until you reach the starting position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اربط الكاحل بالبكرة السفلية وتمسّك بالدعامة والجذع مائل قليلاً.","ادفع الساق للخلف بتقلص الأرداف.","ارجع ببطء دون تقوّس."]],"Pull_Through":[["Dos à la poulie basse, corde entre les jambes, buste penché hanches en arrière.","Pousse les hanches vers l'avant en te redressant, bras tendus.","Reviens en reculant les hanches. Mouvement de charnière, dos plat."],["Begin standing a few feet in front of a low pulley with a rope or handle attached. Face away from the machine, straddling the cable, with your feet set wide apart.","Begin the movement by reaching through your legs as far as possible, bending at the hips. Keep your knees slightly bent. Keeping your arms straight, extend through the hip to stand straight up. Avoid pulling upward through the shoulders; all of the motion should originate through the hips."],["أعطِ ظهرك للبكرة السفلية والحبل بين الساقين والجذع منحنٍ والورك للخلف.","ادفع الوركين للأمام وأنت تنتصب والذراعان ممدودتان.","ارجع بدفع الوركين للخلف. حركة مفصلية بظهر مستوٍ."]],"Step-up_with_Knee_Raise":[["Face à un banc, un pied posé dessus.","Pousse sur ce pied pour monter, lève l'autre genou devant toi.","Redescends en contrôle et enchaîne, puis change de jambe."],["Stand facing a box or bench of an appropriate height with your feet together. This will be your starting position.","Begin the movement by stepping up, putting your left foot on the top of the bench. Extend through the hip and knee of your front leg to stand up on the box. As you stand on the box with your left leg, flex your right knee and hip, bringing your knee as high as you can.","Reverse this motion to step down off the box, and then repeat the sequence on the opposite leg."],["قف أمام مقعد وقدم عليه.","ادفع بهذه القدم للصعود وارفع الركبة الأخرى أمامك.","انزل بتحكم وكرّر ثم بدّل الساق."]],"Stiff-Legged_Barbell_Deadlift":[["Debout, barre devant les cuisses, jambes presque tendues, dos plat.","Descends la barre le long des jambes en reculant les hanches.","Remonte en poussant les hanches vers l'avant. Étire les ischios."],["Grasp a bar using an overhand grip (palms facing down). You may need some wrist wraps if using a significant amount of weight.","Stand with your torso straight and your legs spaced using a shoulder width or narrower stance. The knees should be slightly bent. This is your starting position.","Keeping the knees stationary, lower the barbell to over the top of your feet by bending at the hips while keeping your back straight. Keep moving forward as if you were going to pick something from the floor until you feel a stretch on the hamstrings. Inhale as you perform this movement.","Start bringing your torso up straight again by extending your hips until you are back at the starting position. Exhale as you perform this movement.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف والعقلة أمام الفخذين والساقان شبه ممدودتين والظهر مستوٍ.","أنزل العقلة على الساقين مع دفع الوركين للخلف.","اصعد بدفع الوركين للأمام. يمدد العضلات الخلفية للفخذ."]],"Smith_Machine_Stiff-Legged_Deadlift":[["Debout devant la Smith, barre devant les cuisses, dos plat.","Descends en reculant les hanches, barre près des jambes.","Remonte en contractant fessiers et ischios."],["To begin, set the bar on the smith machine to a height that is around the middle of your thighs. Once the correct height is chosen and the bar is loaded, grasp the bar using a pronated (palms forward) grip that is shoulder width apart. You may need some wrist wraps if using a significant amount of weight.","Lift the bar up by fully extending your arms while keeping your back straight. Stand with your torso straight and your legs spaced using a shoulder width or narrower stance. The knees should be slightly bent. This is your starting position.","Keeping the knees stationary, lower the barbell to over the top of your feet by bending at the waist while keeping your back straight. Keep moving forward as if you were going to pick something from the floor until you feel a stretch on the hamstrings. Exhale as you perform this movement","Start bringing your torso up straight again as soon as you feel the hamstrings stretch by extending your hips and waist until you are back at the starting position. Inhale as you perform this movement.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف أمام سميث والعقلة أمام الفخذين والظهر مستوٍ.","انزل بدفع الوركين للخلف والعقلة قرب الساقين.","اصعد بتقلص الأرداف والعضلات الخلفية للفخذ."]],"Reverse_Hyperextension":[["Allongé ventre sur la machine, jambes pendantes, mains sur les poignées.","Monte les jambes jusqu'à l'alignement du corps en contractant fessiers et lombaires.","Redescends lentement sans balancer."],["Place your feet between the pads after loading an appropriate weight. Lay on the top pad, allowing your hips to hang off the back, while grasping the handles to hold your position.","To begin the movement, flex the hips, pulling the legs forward.","Reverse the motion by extending the hips, kicking the leg back. It is very important not to over-extend the hip on this movement, stopping short of your full range of motion.","Return by again flexing the hip, pulling the carriage forward as far as you can.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."],["استلقِ على بطنك على الجهاز والساقان متدليتان واليدان على المقبضين.","ارفع الساقين حتى استقامة الجسم بتقلص الأرداف والظهر السفلي.","انزل ببطء دون تأرجح."]],"Natural_Glute_Ham_Raise":[["Genoux calés sur un support, chevilles bloquées, corps droit.","Descends le buste lentement en contrôlant avec les ischios.","Remonte en fléchissant les genoux, avec l'aide des mains si besoin."],["Using the leg pad of a lat pulldown machine or a preacher bench, position yourself so that your ankles are under the pads, knees on the seat, and you are facing away from the machine. You should be upright and maintaining good posture.","This will be your starting position. Lower yourself under control until your knees are almost completely straight.","Remaining in control, raise yourself back up to the starting position.","If you are unable to complete a rep, use a band, a partner, or push off of a box to aid in completing a repetition."],["الركبتان على دعامة والكاحلان مثبتان والجسم مستقيم.","أنزل الجذع ببطء متحكماً بالعضلات الخلفية للفخذ.","اصعد بثني الركبتين مع مساعدة اليدين عند الحاجة."]],"One-Arm_Kettlebell_Swings":[["Pieds largeur d'épaules, kettlebell devant toi, hanches en arrière, dos plat.","Pousse les hanches vers l'avant pour propulser la kettlebell à hauteur de poitrine.","Laisse-la redescendre entre les jambes et enchaîne. Le mouvement vient des hanches."],[],["القدمان بعرض الكتفين والكيتل بل أمامك والوركان للخلف والظهر مستوٍ.","ادفع الوركين للأمام لدفع الكيتل بل إلى مستوى الصدر.","دعه ينزل بين الساقين وكرّر. الحركة من الوركين."]],"Close-Grip_Front_Lat_Pulldown":[["Assis, cuisses calées, barre en prise serrée (paumes vers l'avant), buste légèrement incliné.","Tire la barre vers le haut de la poitrine en descendant les coudes.","Remonte lentement en laissant les omoplates s'écarter."],["Sit down on a pull-down machine with a wide bar attached to the top pulley. Make sure that you adjust the knee pad of the machine to fit your height. These pads will prevent your body from being raised by the resistance attached to the bar.","Grab the bar with the palms facing forward using the prescribed grip. Note on grips: For a wide grip, your hands need to be spaced out at a distance wider than your shoulder width. For a medium grip, your hands need to be spaced out at a distance equal to your shoulder width and for a close grip at a distance smaller than your shoulder width.","As you have both arms extended in front of you - while holding the bar at the chosen grip width - bring your torso back around 30 degrees or so while creating a curvature on your lower back and sticking your chest out. This is your starting position.","As you breathe out, bring the bar down until it touches your upper chest by drawing the shoulders and the upper arms down and back. Tip: Concentrate on squeezing the back muscles once you reach the full contracted position. The upper torso should remain stationary (only the arms should move). The forearms should do no other work except for holding the bar; therefore do not try to pull the bar down using the forearms.","After a second in the contracted position, while squeezing your shoulder blades together, slowly raise the bar back to the starting position when your arms are fully extended and the lats are fully stretched. Inhale during this portion of the movement."],["اجلس والفخذان مثبتتان والعقلة بقبضة ضيقة والجذع مائل قليلاً.","اسحب العقلة نحو أعلى الصدر مع إنزال المرفقين.","ارجع ببطء مع السماح للوحي الكتف بالانفراج."]],"Underhand_Cable_Pulldowns":[["Assis, barre en prise supination largeur d'épaules, buste légèrement en arrière.","Tire la barre vers le haut de la poitrine en serrant les omoplates.","Remonte en contrôle. Sollicite davantage les biceps."],["Sit down on a pull-down machine with a wide bar attached to the top pulley. Adjust the knee pad of the machine to fit your height. These pads will prevent your body from being raised by the resistance attached to the bar.","Grab the pull-down bar with the palms facing your torso (a supinated grip). Make sure that the hands are placed closer than the shoulder width.","As you have both arms extended in front of you holding the bar at the chosen grip width, bring your torso back around 30 degrees or so while creating a curvature on your lower back and sticking your chest out. This is your starting position.","As you breathe out, pull the bar down until it touches your upper chest by drawing the shoulders and the upper arms down and back. Tip: Concentrate on squeezing the back muscles once you reach the fully contracted position and keep the elbows close to your body. The upper torso should remain stationary as your bring the bar to you and only the arms should move. The forearms should do no other work other than hold the bar.","After a second on the contracted position, while breathing in, slowly bring the bar back to the starting position when your arms are fully extended and the lats are fully stretched."],["اجلس والعقلة بقبضة سفلية بعرض الكتفين والجذع للخلف قليلاً.","اسحب العقلة نحو أعلى الصدر مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","ارجع بتحكم. يشرك العضلة ذات الرأسين أكثر."]],"V-Bar_Pulldown":[["Assis, poignée en V, buste légèrement incliné en arrière.","Tire jusqu'à la poitrine en gardant les coudes près du corps.","Remonte lentement jusqu'à l'étirement des dorsaux."],["Sit down on a pull-down machine with a V-Bar attached to the top pulley.","Adjust the knee pad of the machine to fit your height. These pads will prevent your body from being raised by the resistance attached to the bar.","Grab the V-bar with the palms facing each other (a neutral grip). Stick your chest out and lean yourself back slightly (around 30-degrees) in order to better engage the lats. This will be your starting position.","Using your lats, pull the bar down as you squeeze your shoulder blades. Continue until your chest nearly touches the V-bar. Exhale as you execute this motion. Tip: Keep the torso stationary throughout the movement.","After a second hold on the contracted position, slowly bring the bar back to the starting position as you breathe in."],["اجلس بمقبض V والجذع مائل للخلف قليلاً.","اسحب حتى الصدر مع إبقاء المرفقين قرب الجسم.","ارجع ببطء حتى تمدد الظهرية."]],"One_Arm_Lat_Pulldown":[["Assis face à la poulie haute, une poignée en main, épaule basse.","Tire le coude vers la hanche en serrant le dos.","Remonte en contrôle sans te pencher. Fais les deux côtés."],["Select an appropriate weight and adjust the knee pad to help keep you down. Grasp the handle with a pronated grip. This will be your starting position.","Pull the handle down, squeezing your elbow to your side as you flex the elbow.","Pause at the bottom of the motion, and then slowly return the handle to the starting position.","For multiple repetitions, avoid completely returning the weight to keep tension on the muscles being worked."],["اجلس أمام البكرة العالية بمقبض واحد والكتف منخفض.","اسحب المرفق نحو الورك مع شدّ الظهر.","ارجع بتحكم دون الانحناء وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Rope_Straight-Arm_Pulldown":[["Debout face à la poulie haute, corde en main, buste légèrement penché.","Tire la corde vers les cuisses en gardant les bras presque tendus.","Remonte lentement jusqu'à la hauteur du visage."],["Attach a rope to a high pulley and make your weight selection. Stand a couple feet back from the pulley with your feet staggered and take the rope with both hands. Lean forward from the hip, keeping your back straight, with your arms extended up in front of you. This will be your starting position.","Keeping your arms straight, extend the shoulder to pull the rope down to your thighs.","Pause at the bottom of the motion, squeezing your lats.","Return to the starting position without allowing the weight to fully rest on the stack."],["قف أمام البكرة العالية والحبل بيديك والجذع مائل قليلاً.","اسحب الحبل نحو الفخذين مع بقاء الذراعين شبه ممدودتين.","ارجع ببطء حتى مستوى الوجه."]],"Kneeling_High_Pulley_Row":[["À genoux face à la poulie haute, corde ou poignées en main.","Tire vers la poitrine en serrant les omoplates.","Reviens lentement sans te pencher en avant."],["Select the appropriate weight using a pulley that is above your head. Attach a rope to the cable and kneel a couple of feet away, holding the rope out in front of you with both arms extended. This will be your starting position.","Initiate the movement by flexing the elbows and fully retracting your shoulders, pulling the rope toward your upper chest with your elbows out.","After pausing briefly, slowly return to the starting position."],["اركع أمام البكرة العالية والحبل أو المقبضان بيديك.","اسحب نحو الصدر مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","ارجع ببطء دون الانحناء للأمام."]],"Leverage_Iso_Row":[["Assieds-toi, poitrine contre le support, poignées en main.","Tire les coudes vers l'arrière en serrant les omoplates.","Reviens lentement bras tendus. Dos droit."],["Load an appropriate weight onto the pins and adjust the seat height so that the handles are at chest level. Grasp the handles with either a neutral or pronated grip. This will be your starting position.","Pull the handles towards your torso, retracting your shoulder blades as you flex the elbow.","Pause at the bottom of the motion, and then slowly return the handles to the starting position. For multiple repetitions, avoid completely returning the weight to the stops to keep tension on the muscles being worked."],["اجلس والصدر على الدعامة والمقبضان بيديك.","اسحب المرفقين للخلف مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","ارجع ببطء حتى مدّ الذراعين مع ظهر مستقيم."]],"Elevated_Cable_Rows":[["Assis ou debout face à la poulie, poignée en main, dos droit.","Tire vers le bas de la poitrine en serrant les omoplates.","Reviens lentement sans arrondir le dos."],["Get a platform of some sort (it can be an aerobics or calf raise platform) that is around 4-6 inches in height.","Place it on the seat of the cable row machine.","Sit down on the machine and place your feet on the front platform or crossbar provided making sure that your knees are slightly bent and not locked.","Lean over as you keep the natural alignment of your back and grab the V-bar handles.","With your arms extended pull back until your torso is at a 90-degree angle from your legs. Your back should be slightly arched and your chest should be sticking out. You should be feeling a nice stretch on your lats as you hold the bar in front of you. This is the starting position of the exercise."],["اجلس أو قف أمام البكرة والمقبض بيدك والظهر مستقيم.","اسحب نحو أسفل الصدر مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","ارجع ببطء دون تقويس الظهر."]],"Shotgun_Row":[["Debout face à la poulie basse, une poignée en main, pied opposé en avant.","Tire le coude vers l'arrière en tournant légèrement le buste.","Reviens lentement. Fais les deux côtés."],["Attach a single handle to a low cable.","After selecting the correct weight, stand a couple feet back with a wide-split stance. Your arm should be extended and your shoulder forward. This will be your starting position.","Perform the movement by retracting the shoulder and flexing the elbow. As you pull, supinate the wrist, turning the palm upward as you go.","After a brief pause, return to the starting position."],["قف أمام البكرة السفلية والمقبض بيد واحدة والقدم المعاكسة للأمام.","اسحب المرفق للخلف مع تدوير الجذع قليلاً.","ارجع ببطء وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Inverted_Row":[["Sous une barre à hauteur de hanches, corps tendu, mains largeur d'épaules.","Tire la poitrine vers la barre en gardant le corps aligné.","Redescends lentement. Plus les pieds sont surélevés, plus c'est dur."],["Position a bar in a rack to about waist height. You can also use a smith machine.","Take a wider than shoulder width grip on the bar and position yourself hanging underneath the bar. Your body should be straight with your heels on the ground with your arms fully extended. This will be your starting position.","Begin by flexing the elbow, pulling your chest towards the bar. Retract your shoulder blades as you perform the movement.","Pause at the top of the motion, and return yourself to the start position.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."],["تحت عقلة بمستوى الوركين والجسم مشدود واليدان بعرض الكتفين.","اسحب الصدر نحو العقلة مع بقاء الجسم مستقيماً.","انزل ببطء. كلما ارتفعت القدمان صعب التمرين."]],"Bent_Over_Two-Dumbbell_Row":[["Buste penché à 45°, dos plat, haltères bras tendus.","Tire les haltères vers les hanches en serrant les omoplates.","Redescends lentement sans arrondir le dos."],["With a dumbbell in each hand (palms facing your torso), bend your knees slightly and bring your torso forward by bending at the waist; as you bend make sure to keep your back straight until it is almost parallel to the floor. Tip: Make sure that you keep the head up. The weights should hang directly in front of you as your arms hang perpendicular to the floor and your torso. This is your starting position.","While keeping the torso stationary, lift the dumbbells to your side (as you breathe out), keeping the elbows close to the body (do not exert any force with the forearm other than holding the weights). On the top contracted position, squeeze the back muscles and hold for a second.","Slowly lower the weight again to the starting position as you inhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["الجذع مائل 45° والظهر مستوٍ والدمبلز في ذراعين ممدودتين.","اسحب الدمبلز نحو الوركين مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","انزل ببطء دون تقويس الظهر."]],"Seated_One-arm_Cable_Pulley_Rows":[["Assis face à la poulie basse, une poignée en main, dos droit.","Tire le coude vers l'arrière en serrant l'omoplate.","Reviens lentement bras tendu. Fais les deux côtés."],["To get into the starting position, first sit down on the machine and place your feet on the front platform or crossbar provided making sure that your knees are slightly bent and not locked.","Lean over as you keep the natural alignment of your back and grab the single handle attachment with your left arm using a palms-down grip.","With your arm extended pull back until your torso is at a 90-degree angle from your legs. Your back should be slightly arched and your chest should be sticking out. You should be feeling a nice stretch on your lat as you hold the bar in front of you. The right arm can be kept by the waist. This is the starting position of the exercise.","Keeping the torso stationary, pull the handles back towards your torso while keeping the arms close to it as you rotate the wrist, so that by the time your hand is by your abdominals it is in a neutral position (palms facing the torso). Breathe out as you perform that movement. At that point you should be squeezing your back muscles hard.","Hold that contraction for a second and slowly go back to the original position while breathing in. Tip: Remember to rotate the wrist as you go back to the starting position so that the palms are facing down again."],["اجلس أمام البكرة السفلية والمقبض بيد واحدة والظهر مستقيم.","اسحب المرفق للخلف مع شدّ لوح الكتف.","ارجع ببطء حتى مدّ الذراع وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Leverage_High_Row":[["Assieds-toi, poitrine calée, poignées en haut.","Tire les coudes vers le bas et l'arrière.","Reviens lentement en gardant le buste droit."],["Load an appropriate weight onto the pins and adjust the seat height so that you can just reach the handles above you. Adjust the knee pad to help keep you down. Grasp the handles with a pronated grip. This will be your starting position.","Pull the handles towards your torso, retracting your shoulder blades as you flex the elbow.","Pause at the bottom of the motion, and then slowly return the handles to the starting position.","For multiple repetitions, avoid completely returning the weight to the stops to keep tension on the muscles being worked."],["اجلس والصدر مسنود والمقبضان في الأعلى.","اسحب المرفقين للأسفل والخلف.","ارجع ببطء مع بقاء الجذع مستقيماً."]],"Smith_Machine_Bent_Over_Row":[["Penché à 45°, dos plat, barre de la Smith en prise pronation.","Tire la barre vers le bas du ventre.","Redescends en contrôle. Garde les genoux souples."],["Set the barbell attached to the smith machine to a height that is about 2 inches below your knees.","Bend your knees slightly and bring your torso forward, by bending at the waist, while keeping the back straight until it is almost parallel to the floor. Tip: Make sure that you keep the head up.","Now grasp the barbell using an overhand (pronated) grip and unlock it from the smith machine rack. Then let it hang directly in front of you as your arms hang extended perpendicular to the floor and your torso. This is your starting position.","While keeping the torso stationary, lift the barbell as you breathe out, keeping the elbows close to the body and not doing any force with the forearm other than holding the weights. On the top contracted position, squeeze the back muscles and hold for a second.","Slowly lower the weight again to the starting position as you inhale."],["الجذع مائل 45° والظهر مستوٍ والعقلة بقبضة علوية.","اسحب العقلة نحو أسفل البطن.","انزل بتحكم مع ركبتين مرنتين."]],"One-Arm_Kettlebell_Row":[["Une main sur un banc, dos plat, kettlebell dans l'autre main.","Tire le coude vers la hanche sans pivoter le buste.","Redescends lentement. Fais les deux côtés."],["Place a kettlebell in front of your feet. Bend your knees slightly and then push your butt out as much as possible as you bend over to get in the starting position. Grab the kettlebell and pull it to your stomach, retracting your shoulder blade and flexing the elbow. Keep your back straight. Lower and repeat."],["يد على المقعد والظهر مستوٍ والكيتل بل في اليد الأخرى.","اسحب المرفق نحو الورك دون تدوير الجذع.","انزل ببطء وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Dumbbell_Incline_Row":[["Allongé ventre sur un banc incliné, haltères pendants.","Tire les haltères vers les hanches en serrant les omoplates.","Redescends lentement. Dos soutenu, idéal pour sécuriser les lombaires."],["Using a neutral grip, lean into an incline bench.","Take a dumbbell in each hand with a neutral grip, beginning with the arms straight. This will be your starting position.","Retract the shoulder blades and flex the elbows to row the dumbbells to your side.","Pause at the top of the motion, and then return to the starting position."],["استلقِ على بطنك على مقعد مائل والدمبلز متدليان.","اسحب الدمبلز نحو الوركين مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","انزل ببطء. الظهر مسنود، مناسب لحماية أسفل الظهر."]],"V-Bar_Pullup":[["Saisis la poignée en V, bras tendus, jambes croisées.","Tire jusqu'à ce que le menton passe la poignée.","Redescends lentement bras tendus."],["Start by placing the middle of the V-bar in the middle of the pull-up bar (assuming that the pull-up station you are using does not have neutral grip handles). The V-Bar handles will be facing down so that you can hang from the pull-up bar through the use of the handles.","Once you securely place the V-bar, take a hold of the bar from each side and hang from it. Stick your chest out and lean yourself back slightly in order to better engage the lats. This will be your starting position.","Using your lats, pull your torso up while leaning your head back slightly so that you do not hit yourself with the chin-up bar. Continue until your chest nearly touches the V-bar. Exhale as you execute this motion.","After a second hold on the contracted position, slowly lower your body back to the starting position as you breathe in.","Repeat for the prescribed number of repetitions."],["أمسك مقبض V والذراعان ممدودتان والساقان متقاطعتان.","اسحب حتى يتجاوز الذقن المقبض.","انزل ببطء حتى مدّ الذراعين."]],"Hyperextensions_With_No_Hyperextension_Bench":[["Allongé ventre au sol, bras le long du corps ou derrière la tête.","Soulève le buste en contractant les lombaires et les fessiers.","Redescends lentement. Ne cambre pas excessivement."],["With someone holding down your legs, slide yourself down to the edge a flat bench until your hips hang off the end of the bench. Tip: Your entire upper body should be hanging down towards the floor. Also, you will be in the same position as if you were on a hyperextension bench but the range of motion will be shorter due to the height of the flat bench vs. that of the hyperextension bench.","With your body straight, cross your arms in front of you (my preference) or behind your head. This will be your starting position. Tip: You can also hold a weight plate for extra resistance in front of you under your crossed arms.","Start bending forward slowly at the waist as far as you can while keeping your back flat. Inhale as you perform this movement. Keep moving forward until you almost touch the floor or you feel a nice stretch on the hamstrings (whichever comes first). Tip: Never round the back as you perform this exercise.","Slowly raise your torso back to the initial position as you exhale. Tip: Avoid the temptation to arch your back past a straight line. Also, do not swing the torso at any time in order to protect the back from injury.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["استلقِ على بطنك والذراعان بجانب الجسم أو خلف الرأس.","ارفع الجذع بتقلص أسفل الظهر والأرداف.","انزل ببطء دون إفراط في التقوس."]],"Stiff_Leg_Barbell_Good_Morning":[["Barre sur les trapèzes, pieds largeur de hanches, dos plat.","Penche le buste en reculant les hanches jusqu'à sentir l'étirement des ischios.","Redresse-toi en poussant les hanches. Charge légère, dos jamais arrondi."],["This exercise is best performed inside a squat rack for safety purposes. To begin, first set the bar on a rack that best matches your height. Once the correct height is chosen and the bar is loaded, step under the bar and place the back of your shoulders (slightly below the neck) across it.","Hold on to the bar using both arms at each side and lift it off the rack by first pushing with your legs and at the same time straightening your torso.","Step away from the rack and position your legs using a shoulder width medium stance. Keep your head up at all times as looking down will get you off balance and also maintain a straight back. This will be your starting position.","Keeping your legs stationary, move your torso forward by bending at the hips while inhaling. Lower your torso until it is parallel with the floor.","Begin to raise the bar as you exhale by elevating your torso back to the starting position."],["العقلة على أعلى الظهر والقدمان بعرض الوركين والظهر مستوٍ.","أمِل الجذع مع دفع الوركين للخلف حتى تشعر بتمدد الفخذ الخلفي.","انتصب بدفع الوركين. وزن خفيف وظهر غير مقوّس."]],"Isometric_Neck_Exercise_-_Front_And_Back":[["Assis, dos droit, une main contre le front.","Pousse la tête contre la main sans bouger, 5 à 10 s. Puis main derrière la tête.","Relâche doucement. Effort léger, jamais de douleur."],["With your head and neck in a neutral position (normal position with head erect facing forward), place both of your hands on the front side of your head.","Now gently push forward as you contract the neck muscles but resisting any movement of your head. Start with slow tension and increase slowly. Keep breathing normally as you execute this contraction.","Hold for the recommended number of seconds.","Now release the tension slowly.","Rest for the recommended amount of time and repeat with your hands placed on the back side of your head."],["اجلس بظهر مستقيم ويد على الجبهة.","ادفع الرأس ضد اليد دون حركة 5 إلى 10 ثوانٍ ثم اليد خلف الرأس.","أرخِ بلطف. جهد خفيف دون ألم."]],"Isometric_Neck_Exercise_-_Sides":[["Assis, dos droit, une main contre le côté de la tête.","Pousse la tête contre la main sans bouger, 5 à 10 s.","Relâche, fais l'autre côté. Effort léger, jamais de douleur."],["With your head and neck in a neutral position (normal position with head erect facing forward), place your left hand on the left side of your head.","Now gently push towards the left as you contract the left neck muscles but resisting any movement of your head. Start with slow tension and increase slowly. Keep breathing normally as you execute this contraction.","Hold for the recommended number of seconds.","Now release the tension slowly.","Rest for the recommended amount of time and repeat with your right hand placed on the right side of your head."],["اجلس بظهر مستقيم ويد على جانب الرأس.","ادفع الرأس ضد اليد دون حركة 5 إلى 10 ثوانٍ.","أرخِ ثم الجهة الأخرى. جهد خفيف دون ألم."]],"Dumbbell_Squat":[["Debout, haltères le long du corps ou sur les épaules, pieds largeur d'épaules.","Fléchis hanches et genoux en gardant le dos droit et les genoux dans l'axe des pieds.","Remonte en poussant dans les talons."],["Stand up straight while holding a dumbbell on each hand (palms facing the side of your legs).","Position your legs using a shoulder width medium stance with the toes slightly pointed out. Keep your head up at all times as looking down will get you off balance and also maintain a straight back. This will be your starting position. Note: For the purposes of this discussion we will use the medium stance described above which targets overall development; however you can choose any of the three stances discussed in the foot stances section.","Begin to slowly lower your torso by bending the knees as you maintain a straight posture with the head up. Continue down until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Tip: If you performed the exercise correctly, the front of the knees should make an imaginary straight line with the toes that is perpendicular to the front. If your knees are past that imaginary line (if they are past your toes) then you are placing undue stress on the knee and the exercise has been performed incorrectly.","Begin to raise your torso as you exhale by pushing the floor with the heel of your foot mainly as you straighten the legs again and go back to the starting position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف والدمبلز بجانب الجسم أو على الكتفين والقدمان بعرض الكتفين.","ثنِ الوركين والركبتين مع ظهر مستقيم والركبتان في محور القدمين.","اصعد بالدفع في الكعبين."]],"Chair_Squat":[["Debout devant une chaise, pieds largeur d'épaules, bras devant.","Assieds-toi lentement en reculant les hanches, effleure la chaise.","Remonte en poussant dans les talons. Parfait pour débuter."],["To begin, first set the bar to a position that best matches your height. Once the bar is loaded, step under it and position it across the back of your shoulders.","Take the bar with your hands facing forward, unlock it and lift it off the rack by extending your legs.","Move your feet forward about 18 inches in front of the bar. Position your legs using a shoulder width stance with the toes slightly pointed out. Look forward at all times and maintain a neutral or slightly arched spine. This will be your starting position.","Slowly lower the bar by bending the knees as you maintain a straight posture with the head up. Continue down until the angle between the upper and lower leg breaks 90 degrees.","Begin to raise the bar as you exhale by pushing the floor with the heels of your feet, extending the knees and returning to the starting position."],["قف أمام كرسي والقدمان بعرض الكتفين والذراعان للأمام.","اجلس ببطء بدفع الوركين للخلف وتلامس الكرسي.","اصعد بالدفع في الكعبين. مناسب للمبتدئين."]],"Dumbbell_Step_Ups":[["Face à un banc, haltères en mains, un pied posé dessus.","Pousse sur ce pied pour monter jusqu'à l'extension complète.","Redescends en contrôle, enchaîne puis change de jambe."],["Stand up straight while holding a dumbbell on each hand (palms facing the side of your legs).","Place the right foot on the elevated platform. Step on the platform by extending the hip and the knee of your right leg. Use the heel mainly to lift the rest of your body up and place the foot of the left leg on the platform as well. Breathe out as you execute the force required to come up.","Step down with the left leg by flexing the hip and knee of the right leg as you inhale. Return to the original standing position by placing the right foot of to next to the left foot on the initial position.","Repeat with the right leg for the recommended amount of repetitions and then perform with the left leg."],["قف أمام مقعد والدمبلز بيديك وقدم عليه.","ادفع بهذه القدم للصعود حتى المدّ الكامل.","انزل بتحكم وكرّر ثم بدّل الساق."]],"Barbell_Step_Ups":[["Barre sur les trapèzes, face à un banc, un pied dessus.","Monte en poussant sur la jambe d'appui, sans élan avec l'autre.","Redescends lentement. Change de jambe."],["Stand up straight while holding a barbell placed on the back of your shoulders (slightly below the neck) and stand upright behind an elevated platform (such as the one used for spotting behind a flat bench). This is your starting position.","Place the right foot on the elevated platform. Step on the platform by extending the hip and the knee of your right leg. Use the heel mainly to lift the rest of your body up and place the foot of the left leg on the platform as well. Breathe out as you execute the force required to come up.","Step down with the left leg by flexing the hip and knee of the right leg as you inhale. Return to the original standing position by placing the right foot of to next to the left foot on the initial position.","Repeat with the right leg for the recommended amount of repetitions and then perform with the left leg."],["العقلة على أعلى الظهر وأنت أمام مقعد وقدم عليه.","اصعد بالدفع بالساق الداعمة دون اندفاع بالأخرى.","انزل ببطء وبدّل الساق."]],"Dumbbell_Rear_Lunge":[["Debout, haltères le long du corps, pieds largeur de hanches.","Recule d'un grand pas et fléchis les deux genoux à 90°.","Pousse sur le pied avant pour revenir. Alterne les jambes."],["Stand with your torso upright holding two dumbbells in your hands by your sides. This will be your starting position.","Step backward with your right leg around two feet or so from the left foot and lower your upper body down, while keeping the torso upright and maintaining balance. Inhale as you go down. Tip: As in the other exercises, do not allow your knee to go forward beyond your toes as you come down, as this will put undue stress on the knee joint. Make sure that you keep your front shin perpendicular to the ground. Keep the torso upright during the lunge; flexible hip flexors are important. A long lunge emphasizes the Gluteus Maximus; a short lunge emphasizes Quadriceps.","Push up and go back to the starting position as you exhale. Tip: Use the ball of your feet to push in order to accentuate the quadriceps. To focus on the glutes, press with your heels.","Now repeat with the opposite leg."],["قف والدمبلز بجانبك والقدمان بعرض الوركين.","تراجع بخطوة كبيرة وثنِ الركبتين 90°.","ادفع بالقدم الأمامية للعودة وبدّل الساقين."]],"Barbell_Lunge":[["Barre sur les trapèzes, debout, buste droit.","Fais un grand pas en avant et descends jusqu'à 90° aux deux genoux.","Pousse sur le pied avant pour revenir. Alterne."],["This exercise is best performed inside a squat rack for safety purposes. To begin, first set the bar on a rack just below shoulder level. Once the correct height is chosen and the bar is loaded, step under the bar and place the back of your shoulders (slightly below the neck) across it.","Hold on to the bar using both arms at each side and lift it off the rack by first pushing with your legs and at the same time straightening your torso.","Step away from the rack and step forward with your right leg and squat down through your hips, while keeping the torso upright and maintaining balance. Inhale as you go down. Note: Do not allow your knee to go forward beyond your toes as you come down, as this will put undue stress on the knee joint. li>","Using mainly the heel of your foot, push up and go back to the starting position as you exhale.","Repeat the movement for the recommended amount of repetitions and then perform with the left leg."],["العقلة على أعلى الظهر والجذع مستقيم.","خذ خطوة كبيرة للأمام وانزل حتى 90° في الركبتين.","ادفع بالقدم الأمامية للعودة وبدّل."]],"Bodyweight_Walking_Lunge":[["Debout, mains aux hanches ou derrière la tête.","Fais un grand pas et descends le genou arrière vers le sol.","Pousse sur la jambe avant et avance avec l'autre jambe."],["Begin standing with your feet shoulder width apart and your hands on your hips.","Step forward with one leg, flexing the knees to drop your hips. Descend until your rear knee nearly touches the ground. Your posture should remain upright, and your front knee should stay above the front foot.","Drive through the heel of your lead foot and extend both knees to raise yourself back up.","Step forward with your rear foot, repeating the lunge on the opposite leg."],["قف واليدان على الوركين أو خلف الرأس.","خذ خطوة كبيرة وأنزل الركبة الخلفية نحو الأرض.","ادفع بالساق الأمامية وتقدّم بالأخرى."]],"Barbell_Walking_Lunge":[["Barre sur les trapèzes, buste droit.","Avance d'un grand pas, descends le genou arrière près du sol.","Pousse et enchaîne avec l'autre jambe en marchant."],["Begin standing with your feet shoulder width apart and a barbell across your upper back.","Step forward with one leg, flexing the knees to drop your hips. Descend until your rear knee nearly touches the ground. Your posture should remain upright, and your front knee should stay above the front foot.","Drive through the heel of your lead foot and extend both knees to raise yourself back up.","Step forward with your rear foot, repeating the lunge on the opposite leg."],["العقلة على أعلى الظهر والجذع مستقيم.","تقدّم بخطوة كبيرة وأنزل الركبة الخلفية قرب الأرض.","ادفع وتابع بالساق الأخرى مشياً."]],"Split_Squat_with_Dumbbells":[["Position fendue, un pied devant, un pied derrière, haltères en main.","Descends à la verticale jusqu'à 90° aux genoux.","Remonte en poussant sur le pied avant. Fais les deux côtés."],["Position yourself into a staggered stance with the rear foot elevated and front foot forward.","Hold a dumbbell in each hand, letting them hang at the sides. This will be your starting position.","Begin by descending, flexing your knee and hip to lower your body down. Maintain good posture througout the movement. Keep the front knee in line with the foot as you perform the exercise.","At the bottom of the movement, drive through the heel to extend the knee and hip to return to the starting position."],["وضع الاندفاع قدم أمام وقدم خلف والدمبلز بيديك.","انزل عمودياً حتى 90° في الركبتين.","اصعد بالدفع بالقدم الأمامية وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Plie_Dumbbell_Squat":[["Pieds très écartés, pointes vers l'extérieur, haltère tenu entre les jambes.","Descends en gardant le buste droit et les genoux vers l'extérieur.","Remonte en serrant les fessiers."],["Hold a dumbbell at the base with both hands and stand straight up. Move your legs so that they are wider than shoulder width apart from each other with your knees slightly bent.","Your toes should be facing out. Note: Your arms should be stationary while performing the exercise. This is the starting position.","Slowly bend the knees and lower your legs until your thighs are parallel to the floor. Make sure to inhale as this is the eccentric part of the exercise.","Press mainly with the heel of the foot to bring the body back to the starting position while exhaling.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["القدمان متباعدتان جداً والأصابع للخارج والدمبل بين الساقين.","انزل مع جذع مستقيم والركبتان للخارج.","اصعد مع شدّ الأرداف."]],"Squats_-_With_Bands":[["Élastique sous les pieds et sur les épaules, pieds largeur d'épaules.","Descends en gardant le dos droit, genoux dans l'axe.","Remonte contre la résistance de l'élastique."],["To start out, make sure that the exercise band is at an even split between both the left and right side of the body. To do this, use your hands to grab both sides of the band and place both feet in the middle of the band. Your feet should be shoulder width apart from each other.","When holding the bands, they should be the same height on each side. You should be using a pronated grip (palms facing forward) and have the handles of the bands next to your face for this exercise. This is the starting position.","Slowly start to bend the knees and lower the legs so that your thighs are parallel to the floor while exhaling.","Use the heel of your feet to push your body up to the starting position as you exhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["الشريط تحت القدمين وعلى الكتفين والقدمان بعرض الكتفين.","انزل بظهر مستقيم والركبتان في المحور.","اصعد ضد مقاومة الشريط."]],"Single-Leg_Leg_Extension":[["Assieds-toi, dos plaqué, coussin sur le bas du tibia, une jambe active.","Tends la jambe en contractant le quadriceps.","Redescends lentement. Fais les deux côtés."],["Seat yourself in the machine and adjust it so that you are positioned properly. The pad should be against the lower part of the shin but not in contact with the ankle. Adjust the seat so that the pivot point is in line with your knee. Select a weight appropriate for your abilities.","Maintaining good posture, fully extend one leg, pausing at the top of the motion.","Return to the starting position without letting the weight stop, keeping tension on the muscle.","Repeat for the desired number of repetitions."],["اجلس والظهر ملتصق والوسادة أسفل الساق وساق واحدة تعمل.","مدّ الساق بتقلص الرباعية.","انزل ببطء وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Smith_Machine_Leg_Press":[["Allongé sous la barre, pieds contre la barre, dos au sol.","Pousse la barre jusqu'à l'extension sans verrouiller les genoux.","Reviens lentement jusqu'à 90°."],["Position a Smith machine bar a couple feet off of the ground. Ensure that it is resting on the safeties. After loading the bar to an appropriate weight, lie underneath the bar. Place the middle of your feet on the bar, tucking your knees to your chest. This will be your starting position.","Begin the movement by driving through your feet to move the bar upward, extending the hips and knees. Do not lock out your knees.","At the top of the motion, pause briefly before returning to the starting position."],["استلقِ تحت العقلة والقدمان عليها والظهر على الأرض.","ادفع العقلة حتى المدّ دون قفل الركبتين.","ارجع ببطء حتى 90°."]],"Narrow_Stance_Leg_Press":[["Assis à la presse, pieds rapprochés au centre de la plateforme.","Pousse sans verrouiller les genoux.","Reviens lentement jusqu'à 90°. Cible le bas du quadriceps."],["Using a leg press machine, sit down on the machine and place your legs on the platform directly in front of you at a less-than-shoulder-width narrow stance with the toes slightly pointed out. Your feet should be around 3 inches or less apart. Tip: Keep your head up at all times and also maintain the back on the pad at all times.","Lower the safety bars holding the weighted platform in place and press the platform all the way up until your legs are fully extended in front of you. Tip: Make sure that you do not lock your knees. Your torso and the legs should make a perfect 90-degree angle. This will be your starting position.","As you inhale, slowly lower the platform until your upper and lower legs make a 90-degree angle.","Pushing mainly with the heels of your feet and using the quadriceps go back to the starting position as you exhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions and ensure to lock the safety pins properly once you are done. You do not want that platform falling on you fully loaded."],["اجلس على جهاز الضغط والقدمان متقاربتان في وسط المنصة.","ادفع دون قفل الركبتين.","ارجع ببطء حتى 90°. يركّز على أسفل الرباعية."]],"Wide_Stance_Barbell_Squat":[["Barre sur les trapèzes, pieds plus larges que les épaules, pointes légèrement ouvertes.","Descends en gardant le dos droit, genoux vers l'extérieur.","Remonte en poussant dans les talons."],["This exercise is best performed inside a squat rack for safety purposes. To begin, first set the bar on a rack that best matches your height. Once the correct height is chosen and the bar is loaded, step under the bar and place the back of your shoulders (slightly below the neck) across it.","Hold on to the bar using both arms at each side and lift it off the rack by first pushing with your legs and at the same time straightening your torso.","Step away from the rack and position your legs using a wider-than-shoulder-width stance with the toes slightly pointed out. Keep your head up at all times as looking down will get you off balance, and also maintain a straight back. This will be your starting position.","Begin to slowly lower the bar by bending the knees as you maintain a straight posture with the head up. Continue down until the angle between the upper leg and the calves becomes slightly less than 90-degrees (which is the point in which the upper legs are below parallel to the floor). Inhale as you perform this portion of the movement. Tip: If you performed the exercise correctly, the front of the knees should make an imaginary straight line with the toes that is perpendicular to the front. If your knees are past that imaginary line (if they are past your toes) then you are placing undue stress on the knee and the exercise has been performed incorrectly.","Begin to raise the bar as you exhale by pushing the floor with the heel of your foot as you straighten the legs again and go back to the starting position."],["العقلة على أعلى الظهر والقدمان أعرض من الكتفين والأصابع مفتوحة قليلاً.","انزل بظهر مستقيم والركبتان للخارج.","اصعد بالدفع في الكعبين."]],"Barbell_Hack_Squat":[["Barre derrière les jambes, tenue à bout de bras, talons légèrement surélevés.","Descends en gardant le dos droit et la barre près des jambes.","Remonte en poussant dans les pieds."],["Stand up straight while holding a barbell behind you at arms length and your feet at shoulder width. Tip: A shoulder width grip is best with the palms of your hands facing back. You can use wrist wraps for this exercise for a better grip. This will be your starting position.","While keeping your head and eyes up and back straight, squat until your upper thighs are parallel to the floor. Breathe in as you slowly go down.","Pressing mainly with the heel of the foot and squeezing the thighs, go back up as you breathe out.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["العقلة خلف الساقين بذراعين ممدودتين والكعبان مرتفعان قليلاً.","انزل بظهر مستقيم والعقلة قرب الساقين.","اصعد بالدفع بالقدمين."]],"Dumbbell_Squat_To_A_Bench":[["Haltères tenus aux épaules ou le long du corps, banc derrière toi.","Assieds-toi sur le banc en contrôlant, sans t'effondrer.","Remonte en poussant dans les talons. Repère de profondeur sécurisé."],["Stand up straight with a flat bench behind you while holding a dumbbell on each hand (palms facing the side of your legs).","Position your legs using a shoulder width medium stance with the toes slightly pointed out. Keep your head up at all times as looking down will get you off balance and also maintain a straight back. This will be your starting position. Note: For the purposes of this discussion we will use the medium stance described above which targets overall development; however you can choose any of the three stances discussed in the foot stances section.","Begin to slowly lower your torso by bending the knees as you maintain a straight posture with the head up. Continue down until you slightly touch the bench behind you. Inhale as you perform this portion of the movement. Tip: If you performed the exercise correctly, the front of the knees should make an imaginary straight line with the toes that is perpendicular to the front. If your knees are past that imaginary line (if they are past your toes) then you are placing undue stress on the knee and the exercise has been performed incorrectly.","Begin to raise the bar as you exhale by pushing the floor with the heel of your foot mainly as you straighten the legs again and go back to the starting position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["الدمبلز عند الكتفين أو بجانب الجسم والمقعد خلفك.","اجلس على المقعد بتحكم دون السقوط.","اصعد بالدفع في الكعبين. مرجع آمن للعمق."]],"Narrow_Stance_Hack_Squats":[["Dos calé, pieds rapprochés en bas de la plateforme.","Descends jusqu'à 90° en contrôle.","Pousse sans verrouiller. Cible le quadriceps."],["Place the back of your torso against the back pad of the machine and hook your shoulders under the shoulder pads provided.","Position your legs in the platform using a less than shoulder width narrow stance with the toes slightly pointed out. Your feet should be around 3 inches or less apart. Tip: Keep your head up at all times and also maintain the back on the pad at all times.","Place your arms on the side handles of the machine and disengage the safety bars (which on most designs is done by moving the side handles from a facing front position to a diagonal position).","Now straighten your legs without locking the knees. This will be your starting position.","Begin to slowly lower the unit by bending the knees as you maintain a straight posture with the head up (back on the pad at all times). Continue down until the angle between the upper leg and the calves becomes slightly less than 90-degrees (which is the point in which the upper legs are below parallel to the floor). Inhale as you perform this portion of the movement."],["الظهر مسنود والقدمان متقاربتان أسفل المنصة.","انزل حتى 90° بتحكم.","ادفع دون قفل. يركّز على الرباعية."]],"Front_Squats_With_Two_Kettlebells":[["Deux kettlebells aux épaules, coudes bas, pieds largeur d'épaules.","Descends en gardant le buste très droit.","Remonte en poussant dans les talons."],["Clean two kettlebells to your shoulders. Clean the kettlebells to your shoulders by extending through the legs and hips as you pull the kettlebells towards your shoulders. Rotate your wrists as you do so.","Looking straight ahead at all times, squat as low as you can and pause at the bottom. As you squat down, push your knees out. You should squat between your legs, keeping an upright torso, with your head and chest up.","Rise back up by driving through your heels and repeat."],["كيتل بلان عند الكتفين والمرفقان منخفضان والقدمان بعرض الكتفين.","انزل مع جذع مستقيم جداً.","اصعد بالدفع في الكعبين."]],"Standing_Dumbbell_Press":[["Debout, haltères aux épaules, ventre et fessiers gainés.","Pousse au-dessus de la tête jusqu'à l'extension.","Redescends en contrôle sans cambrer le dos."],["Standing with your feet shoulder width apart, take a dumbbell in each hand. Raise the dumbbells to head height, the elbows out and about 90 degrees. This will be your starting position.","Maintaining strict technique with no leg drive or leaning back, extend through the elbow to raise the weights together directly above your head.","Pause, and slowly return the weight to the starting position."],["قف والدمبلز عند الكتفين والبطن والأرداف مشدودة.","ادفع فوق الرأس حتى المدّ.","انزل بتحكم دون تقوّس الظهر."]],"Barbell_Shoulder_Press":[["Barre à hauteur des clavicules, prise un peu plus large que les épaules.","Pousse la barre au-dessus de la tête en avançant légèrement la tête.","Redescends sous contrôle jusqu'aux clavicules."],["Sit on a bench with back support in a squat rack. Position a barbell at a height that is just above your head. Grab the barbell with a pronated grip (palms facing forward).","Once you pick up the barbell with the correct grip width, lift the bar up over your head by locking your arms. Hold at about shoulder level and slightly in front of your head. This is your starting position.","Lower the bar down to the shoulders slowly as you inhale.","Lift the bar back up to the starting position as you exhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["العقلة عند الترقوة بقبضة أعرض قليلاً من الكتفين.","ادفع العقلة فوق الرأس مع تقديم الرأس قليلاً.","انزل بتحكم حتى الترقوة."]],"Machine_Shoulder_Military_Press":[["Règle le siège, poignées à hauteur d'épaules, dos plaqué.","Pousse jusqu'à l'extension sans verrouiller.","Reviens lentement. Guidage idéal pour débuter."],["Sit down on the Shoulder Press Machine and select the weight.","Grab the handles to your sides as you keep the elbows bent and in line with your torso. This will be your starting position.","Now lift the handles as you exhale and you extend the arms fully. At the top of the position make sure that you hold the contraction for a second.","Lower the handles slowly back to the starting position as you inhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اضبط المقعد والمقبضان عند الكتفين والظهر ملتصق.","ادفع حتى المدّ دون قفل.","ارجع ببطء. توجيه مناسب للمبتدئين."]],"Leverage_Shoulder_Press":[["Assieds-toi, poignées à hauteur d'épaules, abdos gainés.","Pousse vers le haut jusqu'à l'extension.","Redescends lentement sans relâcher."],["Load an appropriate weight onto the pins and adjust the seat for your height. The handles should be near the top of the shoulders at the beginning of the motion. Your chest and head should be up and handles held with a pronated grip. This will be your starting position.","Press the handles upward by extending through the elbow.","After a brief pause at the top, return the weight to just above the start position, keeping tension on the muscles by not returning the weight to the stops until the set is complete."],["اجلس والمقبضان عند الكتفين والبطن مشدود.","ادفع للأعلى حتى المدّ.","انزل ببطء دون ارتخاء."]],"Smith_Machine_Overhead_Shoulder_Press":[["Assis sous la barre de la Smith, dos droit, prise un peu plus large que les épaules.","Pousse la barre au-dessus de la tête.","Redescends jusqu'au menton, jamais derrière la nuque."],["To begin, place a flat bench (or preferably one with back support) underneath a smith machine. Position the barbell at a height so that when seated on the flat bench, the arms must be almost fully extended to reach the barbell.","Once you have the correct height, sit slightly in behind the barbell so that there is an imaginary straight line from the tip of your nose to the barbell. Your feet should be stationary. Grab the barbell with the palms facing forward, unlock it and lift it up so that your arms are fully extended. This is the starting position.","Slowly begin to lower the barbell until it is level with your chin while inhaling.","Then lift the barbell back to the starting position using your shoulders while exhaling.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اجلس تحت عقلة سميث بظهر مستقيم وقبضة أعرض قليلاً من الكتفين.","ادفع العقلة فوق الرأس.","انزل حتى الذقن لا خلف الرقبة أبداً."]],"Cable_Shoulder_Press":[["Assis ou debout entre deux poulies basses, poignées aux épaules.","Pousse au-dessus de la tête en gardant la tension constante.","Redescends en contrôle."],["Move the cables to the bottom of the towers and select an appropriate weight.","Stand directly in between the uprights. Grasp the cables and hold them at shoulder height, palms facing forward. This will be your starting position.","Keeping your head and chest up, extend through the elbow to press the handles directly over head.","After pausing at the top, return to the starting position and repeat."],["اجلس أو قف بين بكرتين سفليتين والمقبضان عند الكتفين.","ادفع فوق الرأس مع شدّ ثابت.","انزل بتحكم."]],"Lateral_Raise_-_With_Bands":[["Debout sur l'élastique, poignées de chaque côté.","Monte les bras sur le côté jusqu'à hauteur d'épaules, coudes légèrement fléchis.","Redescends lentement. Pratique à la maison."],["To begin, stand on an exercise band so that tension begins at arm's length. Grasp the handles using a pronated (palms facing your thighs) grip that is slightly less than shoulder width. The handles should be resting on the sides of your thighs. Your arms should be extended with a slight bend at the elbows and your back should be straight. This will be your starting position.","Use your side shoulders to lift the handles to the sides as you exhale. Continue to lift the handles until they are slightly above parallel. Tip: As you lift the handles, slightly tilt the hand as if you were pouring water and keep your arms extended. Also, keep your torso stationary and pause for a second at the top of the movement.","Lower the handles back down slowly to the starting position. Inhale as you perform this portion of the movement.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف على الشريط والمقبضان على الجانبين.","ارفع الذراعين جانباً حتى مستوى الكتفين مع مرفقين مثنيين قليلاً.","انزل ببطء. عملي في المنزل."]],"One-Arm_Side_Laterals":[["Debout, une main tient un support, l'autre un haltère léger.","Monte le bras sur le côté jusqu'à l'épaule, petit penché du buste.","Redescends lentement. Fais les deux côtés."],["Pick a dumbbell and place it in one of your hands. Your non lifting hand should be used to grab something steady such as an incline bench press. Lean towards your lifting arm and away from the hand that is gripping the incline bench as this will allow you to keep your balance.","Stand with a straight torso and have the dumbbell by your side at arm's length with the palm of the hand facing you. This will be your starting position.","While maintaining the torso stationary (no swinging), lift the dumbbell to your side with a slight bend on the elbow and your hand slightly tilted forward as if pouring water in a glass. Continue to go up until you arm is parallel to the floor. Exhale as you execute this movement and pause for a second at the top.","Lower the dumbbell back down slowly to the starting position as you inhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف ويد على دعامة والأخرى بدمبل خفيف.","ارفع الذراع جانباً حتى الكتف مع ميل بسيط للجذع.","انزل ببطء وكرّر على الجهتين."]],"Seated_Side_Lateral_Raise":[["Assis sur un banc, haltères le long du corps, dos droit.","Monte les bras sur le côté jusqu'à hauteur d'épaules.","Redescends lentement. Pas d'élan : le banc supprime les triches."],["Pick a couple of dumbbells and sit at the end of a flat bench with your feet firmly on the floor. Hold the dumbbells with your palms facing in and your arms straight down at your sides at arms' length. This will be your starting position.","While maintaining the torso stationary (no swinging), lift the dumbbells to your side with a slight bend on the elbow and the hands slightly tilted forward as if pouring water in a glass. Continue to go up until you arms are parallel to the floor. Exhale as you execute this movement and pause for a second at the top.","Lower the dumbbells back down slowly to the starting position as you inhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اجلس على المقعد والدمبلز بجانب الجسم والظهر مستقيم.","ارفع الذراعين جانباً حتى مستوى الكتفين.","انزل ببطء دون زخم: المقعد يمنع الغش."]],"Front_Two-Dumbbell_Raise":[["Debout, haltères devant les cuisses, paumes vers le bas.","Monte les bras devant toi jusqu'à hauteur d'épaules.","Redescends lentement sans balancer le buste."],["Pick a couple of dumbbells and stand with a straight torso and the dumbbells on front of your thighs at arms length with the palms of the hand facing your thighs. This will be your starting position.","While maintaining the torso stationary (no swinging), lift the dumbbells to the front with a slight bend on the elbow and the palms of the hands always facing down. Continue to go up until you arms are slightly above parallel to the floor. Exhale as you execute this portion of the movement and pause for a second at the top.","As you inhale, lower the dumbbells back down slowly to the starting position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف والدمبلز أمام الفخذين والراحتان للأسفل.","ارفع الذراعين أمامك حتى مستوى الكتفين.","انزل ببطء دون تأرجح الجذع."]],"Reverse_Flyes":[["Buste penché, dos plat, haltères pendants sous les épaules.","Ouvre les bras sur le côté en serrant les omoplates.","Redescends lentement. Charge légère, bon pour la posture."],["To begin, lie down on an incline bench with the chest and stomach pressing against the incline. Have the dumbbells in each hand with the palms facing each other (neutral grip).","Extend the arms in front of you so that they are perpendicular to the angle of the bench. The legs should be stationary while applying pressure with the ball of your toes. This is the starting position.","Maintaining the slight bend of the elbows, move the weights out and away from each other (to the side) in an arc motion while exhaling. Tip: Try to squeeze your shoulder blades together to get the best results from this exercise.","The arms should be elevated until they are parallel to the floor.","Feel the contraction and slowly lower the weights back down to the starting position while inhaling."],["الجذع منحنٍ والظهر مستوٍ والدمبلز متدليان تحت الكتفين.","افتح الذراعين جانباً مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","انزل ببطء. وزن خفيف ومفيد للوضعية."]],"Cable_Rear_Delt_Fly":[["Debout entre deux poulies hautes, poignées croisées en main.","Ouvre les bras en arc vers l'arrière, coudes légèrement fléchis.","Reviens en contrôle sans lâcher la tension."],["Adjust the pulleys to the appropriate height and adjust the weight. The pulleys should be above your head.","Grab the left pulley with your right hand and the right pulley with your left hand, crossing them in front of you. This will be your starting position.","Initiate the movement by moving your arms back and outward, keeping your arms straight as you execute the movement.","Pause at the end of the motion before returning the handles to the start position."],["قف بين بكرتين عاليتين والمقبضان متقاطعان بيديك.","افتح الذراعين في قوس للخلف مع مرفقين مثنيين قليلاً.","ارجع بتحكم دون فقد الشدّ."]],"Band_Pull_Apart":[["Élastique tenu à deux mains devant toi, bras tendus à hauteur de poitrine.","Écarte les bras en serrant les omoplates jusqu'à étirer l'élastique sur la poitrine.","Reviens lentement. Excellent pour la posture, à faire souvent."],["Begin with your arms extended straight out in front of you, holding the band with both hands.","Initiate the movement by performing a reverse fly motion, moving your hands out laterally to your sides.","Keep your elbows extended as you perform the movement, bringing the band to your chest. Ensure that you keep your shoulders back during the exercise.","Pause as you complete the movement, returning to the starting position under control."],["الشريط بين اليدين أمامك والذراعان ممدودتان عند الصدر.","افتح الذراعين مع شدّ لوحي الكتف حتى يمتدّ الشريط على الصدر.","ارجع ببطء. ممتاز للوضعية ويمكن تكراره."]],"External_Rotation_with_Band":[["Coude collé au flanc plié à 90°, élastique fixé sur le côté, serviette sous le coude.","Tourne l'avant-bras vers l'extérieur sans bouger le coude.","Reviens lentement. Renforce la coiffe des rotateurs."],["Choke the band around a post. The band should be at the same height as your elbow. Stand with your left side to the band a couple of feet away.","Grasp the end of the band with your right hand, and keep your elbow pressed firmly to your side. We recommend you hold a pad or foam roll in place with your elbow to keep it firmly in position.","With your upper arm in position, your elbow should be flexed to 90 degrees with your hand reaching across the front of your torso. This will be your starting position.","Execute the movement by rotating your arm in a backhand motion, keeping your elbow in place.","Continue as far as you are able, pause, and then return to the starting position."],["المرفق ملتصق بالجنب مثني 90° والشريط مثبت جانباً ومنشفة تحت المرفق.","أدر الساعد للخارج دون تحريك المرفق.","ارجع ببطء. يقوّي الكفة المدوّرة."]],"External_Rotation":[["Allongé sur le côté, coude plié à 90° sur le flanc, haltère léger.","Tourne l'avant-bras vers le haut en gardant le coude collé.","Redescends lentement. Charge très légère."],["Lie sideways on a flat bench with one arm holding a dumbbell and the other hand on top of the bench folded so that you can rest your head on it.","Bend the elbows of the arm holding the dumbbell so that it creates a 90-degree angle between the upper arm and the forearm. Tip: Keep the arm parallel to your torso.","Now bend the elbow while keeping the upper arm stationary. In this manner, the forearm will be parallel to the floor and perpendicular to your torso (Tip: So the forearm will be directly in front of you). The upper arm will be stationary by your torso and should be parallel to the floor (aligned with your torso at all times). This will be your starting position.","As you breathe out, externally rotate your forearm so that the dumbbell is lifted up in a semicircle motion as you maintain the 90 degree angle bend between the upper arms and the forearm. You will continue this external rotation until the forearm is perpendicular to the floor and the torso pointing towards the ceiling. At this point you will hold the contraction for a second.","As you breathe in, slowly go back to the starting position."],["استلقِ على جنبك والمرفق مثني 90° على الجنب ودمبل خفيف.","أدر الساعد للأعلى مع بقاء المرفق ملتصقاً.","انزل ببطء. وزن خفيف جداً."]],"Dumbbell_Scaption":[["Debout, haltères légers, pouces vers le haut.","Monte les bras à 30° en avant de l'axe latéral jusqu'à hauteur d'épaules.","Redescends lentement. Protège l'épaule."],["This corrective exercise strengthens the muscles that stabilize your shoulder blade. Hold a light weight in each hand, hanging at your sides. Your thumbs should pointing up.","Begin the movement raising your arms out in front of you, about 30 degrees off center. Your arms should be fully extended as you perform the movement.","Continue until your arms are parallel to the ground, and then return to the starting position."],["قف والدمبلز خفيفان والإبهامان للأعلى.","ارفع الذراعين بزاوية 30° أمام المحور الجانبي حتى مستوى الكتفين.","انزل ببطء. يحمي الكتف."]],"Cuban_Press":[["Debout, haltères légers, coudes à hauteur d'épaules.","Fais pivoter les avant-bras vers le haut, puis pousse au-dessus de la tête.","Reviens en inversant le mouvement. Renforce la coiffe des rotateurs."],["Take a dumbbell in each hand with a pronated grip in a standing position. Raise your upper arms so that they are parallel to the floor, allowing your lower arms to hang in the \"scarecrow\" position. This will be your starting position.","To initiate the movement, externally rotate the shoulders to move the upper arm 180 degrees. Keep the upper arms in place, rotating the upper arms until the wrists are directly above the elbows, the forearms perpendicular to the floor.","Now press the dumbbells by extending at the elbows, straightening your arms overhead.","Return to the starting position as you breathe in by reversing the steps.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف والدمبلز خفيفان والمرفقان عند مستوى الكتفين.","أدر الساعدين للأعلى ثم ادفع فوق الرأس.","ارجع بعكس الحركة. يقوّي الكفة المدوّرة."]],"Back_Flyes_-_With_Bands":[["Élastique fixé devant toi à hauteur de poitrine, bras tendus.","Ouvre les bras vers l'arrière en serrant les omoplates.","Reviens lentement. Pratique à la maison."],["Run a band around a stationary post like that of a squat rack.","Grab the band by the handles and stand back so that the tension in the band rises.","Extend and lift the arms straight in front of you. Tip: Your arms should be straight and parallel to the floor while perpendicular to your torso. Your feet should be firmly planted on the floor spread at shoulder width. This will be your starting position.","As you exhale, move your arms to the sides and back. Keep your arms extended and parallel to the floor. Continue the movement until the arms are extended to your sides.","After a pause, go back to the original position as you inhale."],["الشريط مثبت أمامك عند الصدر والذراعان ممدودتان.","افتح الذراعين للخلف مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","ارجع ببطء. عملي في المنزل."]],"Shoulder_Press_-_With_Bands":[["Debout sur l'élastique, poignées aux épaules.","Pousse au-dessus de la tête jusqu'à l'extension.","Redescends lentement contre la tension."],["To begin, stand on an exercise band so that tension begins at arm's length. Grasp the handles and lift them so that the hands are at shoulder height at each side.","Rotate the wrists so that the palms of your hands are facing forward. Your elbows should be bent, with the upper arms and forearms in line to the torso. This is your starting position.","As you exhale, lift the handles up until your arms are fully extended overhead."],["قف على الشريط والمقبضان عند الكتفين.","ادفع فوق الرأس حتى المدّ.","انزل ببطء ضد الشدّ."]],"Seated_Bent-Over_Rear_Delt_Raise":[["Assis au bord du banc, buste penché sur les cuisses, haltères pendants.","Monte les bras sur les côtés en serrant les omoplates.","Redescends lentement sans élan."],["Place a couple of dumbbells looking forward in front of a flat bench.","Sit on the end of the bench with your legs together and the dumbbells behind your calves.","Bend at the waist while keeping the back straight in order to pick up the dumbbells. The palms of your hands should be facing each other as you pick them. This will be your starting position.","Keeping your torso forward and stationary, and the arms slightly bent at the elbows, lift the dumbbells straight to the side until both arms are parallel to the floor. Exhale as you lift the weights. (Note: avoid swinging the torso or bringing the arms back as opposed to the side.)","After a one second contraction at the top, slowly lower the dumbbells back to the starting position."],["اجلس على حافة المقعد والجذع منحنٍ على الفخذين والدمبلز متدليان.","ارفع الذراعين جانباً مع شدّ لوحي الكتف.","انزل ببطء دون زخم."]],"Kettlebell_Halo":[["Debout, kettlebell tenu à deux mains devant la poitrine.","Fais-le tourner autour de la tête en gardant les coudes près du corps.","Change de sens à chaque série. Mobilise les épaules."],["Stand tall with your feet hip-width apart. Hold a kettlebell upside down by the horns, with the bell above your hands and close to your chest. Brace your abdominals and squeeze your glutes so your ribcage stays down. This is your starting position.","Keeping your elbows close to your head, move the kettlebell up past one ear and around behind your head.","Continue the circle past the opposite ear and back down to the starting position in front of your chest, letting the bell pass close to your body throughout.","Complete the prescribed number of circles in one direction, then repeat the same number in the opposite direction.","Move slowly and keep your head, hips and lower back still. If your lower back arches or the bell drifts far from your head, use a lighter weight."],["قف والكيتل بل بين اليدين أمام الصدر.","أدره حول الرأس مع إبقاء المرفقين قرب الجسم.","بدّل الاتجاه في كل مجموعة. يحرّك الكتفين."]],"Cable_Shrugs":[["Debout face à la poulie basse, barre devant les cuisses, bras tendus.","Hausse les épaules vers les oreilles sans fléchir les coudes.","Redescends lentement. Ne tourne pas les épaules."],["Grasp a cable bar attachment that is attached to a low pulley with a shoulder width or slightly wider overhand (palms facing down) grip.","Stand erect close to the pulley with your arms extended in front of you holding the bar. This will be your starting position.","Lift the bar by elevating the shoulders as high as possible as you exhale. Hold the contraction at the top for a second. Tip: The arms should remain extended at all times. Refrain from using the biceps to help lift the bar. Only the shoulders should be moving up and down.","Lower the bar back to the original position.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف أمام البكرة السفلية والعقلة أمام الفخذين والذراعان ممدودتان.","ارفع الكتفين نحو الأذنين دون ثني المرفقين.","انزل ببطء ولا تدر الكتفين."]],"Leverage_Shrug":[["Place-toi dans la machine, poignées le long du corps.","Hausse les épaules aussi haut que possible, 1 s en haut.","Redescends lentement."],["Load the pins to an appropriate weight. Position yourself directly between the handles.","Grasp the top handles with a comfortable grip, and then lower your hips as you take a breath. Look forward with your head and keep your chest up.","Drive through the floor with your heels, extending your hips and knees as you rise to a standing position. Keep your arms straight throughout the movement, finishing with your shoulders back. This will be your starting position.","Raise the weight by shrugging the shoulders towards your ears, moving straight up and down.","Pause at the top of the motion, and then return the weight to the starting position."],["قف داخل الجهاز والمقبضان بجانب الجسم.","ارفع الكتفين لأعلى حد وثبّت ثانية.","انزل ببطء."]],"Standing_Dumbbell_Upright_Row":[["Debout, haltères devant les cuisses, paumes vers le corps.","Monte les haltères le long du corps jusqu'à la poitrine, coudes hauts.","Redescends lentement. Ne monte pas au-dessus des épaules."],["Grasp a dumbbell in each hand with a pronated (palms forward) grip that is slightly less than shoulder width. The dumbbells should be resting on top of your thighs. Your arms should be extended with a slight bend at the elbows and your back should be straight. This will be your starting position.","Use your side shoulders to lift the dumbbells as you exhale. The dumbbells should be close to the body as you move it up and the elbows should drive the motion. Continue to lift them until they nearly touch your chin. Tip: Your elbows should drive the motion. As you lift the dumbbells, your elbows should always be higher than your forearms. Also, keep your torso stationary and pause for a second at the top of the movement.","Lower the dumbbells back down slowly to the starting position. Inhale as you perform this portion of the movement.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف والدمبلز أمام الفخذين والراحتان نحو الجسم.","ارفع الدمبلز على الجسم حتى الصدر والمرفقان مرتفعان.","انزل ببطء ولا تتجاوز مستوى الكتفين."]],"Triceps_Pushdown_-_V-Bar_Attachment":[["Debout face à la poulie haute, barre en V, coudes collés au corps.","Pousse vers le bas jusqu'à l'extension complète des coudes.","Remonte lentement sans bouger les coudes."],["Attach a V-Bar to a high pulley and grab with an overhand grip (palms facing down) at shoulder width.","Standing upright with the torso straight and a very small inclination forward, bring the upper arms close to your body and perpendicular to the floor. The forearms should be pointing up towards the pulley as they hold the bar. The thumbs should be higher than the small finger. This is your starting position.","Using the triceps, bring the bar down until it touches the front of your thighs and the arms are fully extended perpendicular to the floor. The upper arms should always remain stationary next to your torso and only the forearms should move. Exhale as you perform this movement.","After a second hold at the contracted position, bring the V-Bar slowly up to the starting point. Breathe in as you perform this step.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف أمام البكرة العالية بمقبض V والمرفقان ملتصقان بالجسم.","ادفع للأسفل حتى المدّ الكامل للمرفقين.","ارجع ببطء دون تحريك المرفقين."]],"Reverse_Grip_Triceps_Pushdown":[["Debout face à la poulie haute, barre en prise supination, coudes au corps.","Pousse vers le bas jusqu'à l'extension.","Remonte lentement. Cible la tête médiane du triceps."],["Start by setting a bar attachment (straight or e-z) on a high pulley machine.","Facing the bar attachment, grab it with the palms facing up (supinated grip) at shoulder width. Lower the bar by using your lats until your arms are fully extended by your sides. Tip: Elbows should be in by your sides and your feet should be shoulder width apart from each other. This is the starting position.","Slowly elevate the bar attachment up as you inhale so it is aligned with your chest. Only the forearms should move and the elbows/upper arms should be stationary by your side at all times.","Then begin to lower the cable bar back down to the original staring position while exhaling and contracting the triceps hard.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف أمام البكرة العالية والعقلة بقبضة سفلية والمرفقان بجانب الجسم.","ادفع للأسفل حتى المدّ.","ارجع ببطء. يركّز على الرأس الأوسط للترايسبس."]],"Cable_Rope_Overhead_Triceps_Extension":[["Dos à la poulie, corde derrière la tête, coudes pointés vers l'avant.","Étends les bras vers l'avant et le haut sans bouger les coudes.","Reviens lentement jusqu'à l'étirement."],["Attach a rope to the bottom pulley of the pulley machine.","Grasping the rope with both hands, extend your arms with your hands directly above your head using a neutral grip (palms facing each other). Your elbows should be in close to your head and the arms should be perpendicular to the floor with the knuckles aimed at the ceiling. This will be your starting position.","Slowly lower the rope behind your head as you hold the upper arms stationary. Inhale as you perform this movement and pause when your triceps are fully stretched.","Return to the starting position by flexing your triceps as you breathe out.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["أعطِ ظهرك للبكرة والحبل خلف الرأس والمرفقان للأمام.","مدّ الذراعين للأمام والأعلى دون تحريك المرفقين.","ارجع ببطء حتى التمدد."]],"Close-Grip_Dumbbell_Press":[["Allongé, haltères collés l'un contre l'autre au-dessus de la poitrine.","Descends en gardant les coudes près du corps.","Pousse en serrant les haltères entre eux. Cible les triceps."],["Place a dumbbell standing up on a flat bench.","Ensuring that the dumbbell stays securely placed at the top of the bench, lie perpendicular to the bench with only your shoulders lying on the surface. Hips should be below the bench and your legs bent with your feet firmly on the floor.","Grasp the dumbbell with both hands and hold it straight over your chest at arm's length. Both palms should be pressing against the underside of the sides of the dumbbell. This will be your starting position.","Initiate the movement by lowering the dumbbell to your chest.","Return to the starting position by extending the elbows."],["استلقِ والدمبلز ملتصقان فوق الصدر.","انزل مع إبقاء المرفقين قرب الجسم.","ادفع مع ضغط الدمبلز معاً. يركّز على الترايسبس."]],"Dips_-_Triceps_Version":[["Sur barres parallèles, corps vertical, coudes serrés.","Descends jusqu'à 90° aux coudes, buste droit.","Pousse pour remonter à l'extension complète."],["To get into the starting position, hold your body at arm's length with your arms nearly locked above the bars.","Now, inhale and slowly lower yourself downward. Your torso should remain upright and your elbows should stay close to your body. This helps to better focus on tricep involvement. Lower yourself until there is a 90 degree angle formed between the upper arm and forearm.","Then, exhale and push your torso back up using your triceps to bring your body back to the starting position.","Repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions."],["على متوازيين والجسم عمودي والمرفقان ضيقان.","انزل حتى 90° في المرفقين مع جذع مستقيم.","ادفع للصعود حتى المدّ الكامل."]],"Dip_Machine":[["Assis dans la machine, poignées à hauteur de poitrine.","Pousse vers le bas jusqu'à l'extension des bras.","Reviens lentement. Version guidée des dips."],["Sit securely in a dip machine, select the weight and firmly grasp the handles.","Now keep your elbows in at your sides in order to place emphasis on the triceps. The elbows should be bent at a 90 degree angle.","As you contract the triceps, extend your arms downwards as you exhale. Tip: At the bottom of the movement, focus on keeping a little bend in your arms to keep tension on the triceps muscle.","Now slowly let your arms come back up to the starting position as you inhale.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["اجلس في الجهاز والمقبضان عند الصدر.","ادفع للأسفل حتى مدّ الذراعين.","ارجع ببطء. نسخة موجَّهة من الديبس."]],"EZ-Bar_Skullcrusher":[["Allongé, barre EZ tenue bras tendus au-dessus de la poitrine.","Fléchis les coudes pour amener la barre vers le front.","Étends les bras sans bouger les coudes."],["Using a close grip, lift the EZ bar and hold it with your elbows in as you lie on the bench. Your arms should be perpendicular to the floor. This will be your starting position.","Keeping the upper arms stationary, lower the bar by allowing the elbows to flex. Inhale as you perform this portion of the movement. Pause once the bar is directly above the forehead.","Lift the bar back to the starting position by extending the elbow and exhaling.","Repeat."],["استلقِ وعقلة EZ في ذراعين ممدودتين فوق الصدر.","ثنِ المرفقين لإنزال العقلة نحو الجبهة.","مدّ الذراعين دون تحريك المرفقين."]],"Lying_Dumbbell_Tricep_Extension":[["Allongé, un haltère dans chaque main, bras tendus.","Fléchis les coudes pour descendre les haltères près des oreilles.","Étends sans bouger les coudes."],["Lie on a flat bench while holding two dumbbells directly in front of you. Your arms should be fully extended at a 90-degree angle from your torso and the floor. The palms should be facing in and the elbows should be tucked in. This is the starting position.","As you breathe in and you keep the upper arms stationary with the elbows in, slowly lower the weight until the dumbbells are near your ears.","At that point, while keeping the elbows in and the upper arms stationary, use the triceps to bring the weight back up to the starting position as you breathe out.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["استلقِ ودمبل في كل يد والذراعان ممدودتان.","ثنِ المرفقين لإنزال الدمبلز قرب الأذنين.","مدّ دون تحريك المرفقين."]],"Machine_Triceps_Extension":[["Assieds-toi, coudes sur le support, poignées en main.","Étends les bras jusqu'à l'extension complète.","Reviens lentement en contrôle."],["Adjust the seat to the appropriate height and make your weight selection. Place your upper arms against the pads and grasp the handles. This will be your starting position.","Perform the movement by extending the elbow, pulling your lower arm away from your upper arm.","Pause at the completion of the movement, and then slowly return the weight to the starting position.","Avoid returning the weight all the way to the stops until the set is complete to keep tension on the muscles being worked."],["اجلس والمرفقان على الدعامة والمقبضان بيديك.","مدّ الذراعين حتى المدّ الكامل.","ارجع ببطء وبتحكم."]],"Incline_Push-Up_Close-Grip":[["Mains rapprochées sur un banc, corps aligné.","Fléchis les coudes en les gardant près du corps.","Pousse pour remonter. Version accessible pour le triceps."],["Stand facing a Smith machine bar or sturdy elevated platform at an appropriate height.","Place your hands next to one another on the bar.","Position your feet back from the bar with arms and body straight. This will be your starting position.","Keeping your body straight, lower your chest to the bar by bending the arms.","Return to the starting position by extending the elbows, pressing yourself back up."],["اليدان متقاربتان على مقعد والجسم مستقيم.","ثنِ المرفقين مع إبقائهما قرب الجسم.","ادفع للصعود. نسخة مناسبة للترايسبس."]],"Standing_Bent-Over_Two-Arm_Dumbbell_Triceps_Extension":[["Buste penché, dos plat, haltères coudes pliés près des flancs.","Étends les bras vers l'arrière en gardant les coudes fixes.","Reviens lentement."],["With a dumbbell in each hand and the palms facing your torso, bend your knees slightly and bring your torso forward, by bending at the waist, while keeping the back straight until it is almost parallel to the floor. Make sure that you keep the head up. The upper arms should be close to the torso and parallel to the floor while the forearms are pointing towards the floor as the hands hold the weights. Tip: There should be a 90-degree angle between the forearms and the upper arm. This is your starting position.","Keeping the upper arms stationary, use the triceps to lift the weights as you exhale until the forearms are parallel to the floor and the whole arms are extended. Like many other arm exercises, only the forearm moves.","After a second contraction at the top, slowly lower the dumbbells back to their starting position as you inhale.","Repeat the movement for the prescribed amount of repetitions."],["الجذع منحنٍ والظهر مستوٍ والدمبلز والمرفقان مثنيان قرب الجنبين.","مدّ الذراعين للخلف مع ثبات المرفقين.","ارجع ببطء."]],"Standing_Overhead_Barbell_Triceps_Extension":[["Debout, barre tenue au-dessus de la tête, bras tendus.","Fléchis les coudes pour descendre la barre derrière la tête.","Étends en gardant les coudes serrés."],["To begin, stand up holding a barbell or e-z bar using a pronated grip (palms facing forward) with your hands closer than shoulder width apart from each other. Your feet should be about shoulder width apart.","Now elevate the barbell above your head until your arms are fully extended. Keep your elbows in. This will be your starting position.","Keeping your upper arms close to your head and elbows in, perpendicular to the floor, lower the resistance in a semicircular motion behind your head until your forearms touch your biceps. Tip: The upper arms should remain stationary and only the forearms should move. Breathe in as you perform this step.","Go back to the starting position by using the triceps to raise the barbell. Breathe out as you perform this step.","Repeat for the recommended amount of repetitions."],["قف والعقلة فوق الرأس والذراعان ممدودتان.","ثنِ المرفقين لإنزال العقلة خلف الرأس.","مدّ مع إبقاء المرفقين ضيقين."]],"Kettlebell_Overhead_Triceps_Extension":[["Debout, kettlebell tenu à deux mains au-dessus de la tête.","Fléchis les coudes pour descendre derrière la tête.","Étends sans écarter les coudes."],["Stand with your feet hip-width apart, holding a kettlebell by the horns with both hands. Press it overhead until your arms are extended, with the bell hanging behind your hands.","Brace your abdominals and keep your upper arms vertical and close to your head. This is your starting position.","Bend at the elbows to lower the kettlebell behind your head, going as far as your shoulder mobility allows without your elbows flaring outward.","Extend your elbows to press the kettlebell back to the starting position, keeping your upper arms still throughout.","Keep your ribcage down and avoid arching your lower back as you extend."],["قف والكيتل بل بين اليدين فوق الرأس.","ثنِ المرفقين لإنزاله خلف الرأس.","مدّ دون إبعاد المرفقين."]],"Band_Skull_Crusher":[["Allongé, élastique fixé derrière la tête, mains au-dessus du front.","Fléchis les coudes pour amener les mains vers le front.","Étends contre la résistance. Pratique à la maison."],["Secure a band to the base of a rack or the bench. Lay on the bench so that the band is lined up with your head.","Take hold of the band, raising your elbows so that the upper arm is perpendicular to the floor. With the elbow flexed, the band should be above your head. This will be your starting position.","Extend through the elbow to straighten your arm, keeping your upper arm in place. Pause at the top of the motion, and return to the starting position."],["استلقِ والشريط مثبت خلف الرأس واليدان فوق الجبهة.","ثنِ المرفقين لتقريب اليدين من الجبهة.","مدّ ضد المقاومة. عملي في المنزل."]],"Low_Cable_Triceps_Extension":[["Dos à la poulie basse, corde en main, coude pointé vers le haut.","Étends le bras vers l'avant et le haut.","Reviens lentement sans bouger le coude."],["Select the desired weight and lay down face up on the bench of a seated row machine that has a rope attached to it. Your head should be pointing towards the attachment.","Grab the outside of the rope ends with your palms facing each other (neutral grip).","Position your elbows so that they are bent at a 90 degree angle and your upper arms are perpendicular (90 degree angle) to your torso. Tip: Keep the elbows in and make sure that the upper arms point to the ceiling while your forearms point towards the pulley above your head. This will be your starting position.","As you breathe out, extend your lower arms until they are straight and vertical. The upper arms and elbows remain stationary throughout the movement. Only the forearms should move. Contract the triceps hard for a second.","As you breathe in slowly return to the starting position."],["أعطِ ظهرك للبكرة السفلية والحبل بيدك والمرفق للأعلى.","مدّ الذراع للأمام والأعلى.","ارجع ببطء دون تحريك المرفق."]],"Body_Tricep_Press":[["Mains sur une barre ou un banc, corps incliné, bras tendus.","Fléchis les coudes pour descendre le front vers la barre.","Pousse pour revenir en gardant le corps gainé."],["Position a bar in a rack at chest height.","Standing, take a shoulder width grip on the bar and step a yard or two back, feet together and arms extended so that you are leaning on the bar. This will be your starting position.","Begin by flexing the elbow, lowering yourself towards the bar.","Pause, and then reverse the motion by extending the elbows.","Progress from bodyweight by adding chains over your shoulders."],["اليدان على عقلة أو مقعد والجسم مائل والذراعان ممدودتان.","ثنِ المرفقين لإنزال الجبهة نحو العقلة.","ادفع للعودة مع شدّ الجسم."]],"Standing_Gastrocnemius_Calf_Stretch":[["Face à un mur, une jambe en arrière tendue, talon bien au sol, mains sur le mur.","Avance le bassin vers le mur jusqu'à sentir l'étirement dans le mollet.","Tiens 30 s sans rebondir, puis change de jambe."],["Place your right heel on a step with your knee extended and lean forward to grab your right toe with your right hand. Your left knee should be slightly bent and your back should be straight.","Support your weight on your left leg and place your left hand on your left thigh.","Pull your right toes toward your knee until you feel a stretch in your calf."],["قف أمام الحائط وساق للخلف ممدودة والكعب على الأرض واليدان على الحائط.","قرّب الحوض من الحائط حتى تشعر بتمدد السمانة.","اثبت 30 ثانية دون نطّ ثم بدّل الساق."]],"Standing_Soleus_And_Achilles_Stretch":[["Face à un mur, une jambe en arrière, fléchis légèrement les deux genoux, talon arrière au sol.","Descends le bassin vers le bas jusqu'à sentir l'étirement bas dans le mollet.","Tiens 30 s sans douleur vive, puis change de jambe."],["Stand with your feet hip-distance apart, one foot slightly in front of the other.","Bend both knees, keeping your back heel on the floor. Switch sides."],["قف أمام الحائط وساق للخلف وثنِ الركبتين قليلاً والكعب الخلفي على الأرض.","اخفض الحوض حتى تشعر بتمدد أسفل السمانة.","اثبت 30 ثانية دون ألم حاد ثم بدّل الساق."]],"Calf_Stretch_Hands_Against_Wall":[["Mains contre le mur à hauteur d'épaules, une jambe reculée, talon au sol.","Pousse doucement vers le mur en gardant la jambe arrière tendue.","Tiens 30 s et change de jambe."],["Stand facing a wall from several feet away. Stagger your stance, placing one foot forward.","Lean forward and rest your hands on the wall, keeping your heel, hip and head in a straight line.","Attempt to keep your heel on the ground. Hold for 10-20 seconds and then switch sides."],["اليدان على الحائط بمستوى الكتفين وساق للخلف والكعب على الأرض.","ادفع بلطف نحو الحائط مع بقاء الساق الخلفية ممدودة.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الساق."]],"Hamstring_Stretch":[["Allongé sur le dos, une jambe levée tenue derrière la cuisse ou avec une sangle.","Tends doucement la jambe vers le plafond jusqu'à sentir l'étirement derrière la cuisse.","Tiens 30 s sans rebondir et change de jambe."],["Lie on your back with one leg extended above you, with the hip at ninety degrees. Keep the other leg flat on the floor.","Loop a belt, band, or rope over the ball of your foot. This will be your starting position.","Pull on the belt to create tension in the calves and hamstrings. Hold this stretch for 10-30 seconds, and repeat with the other leg."],["استلقِ على ظهرك وساق مرفوعة ممسوكة خلف الفخذ أو بحزام.","مدّ الساق بلطف نحو السقف حتى تشعر بتمدد خلف الفخذ.","اثبت 30 ثانية دون نطّ وبدّل الساق."]],"Standing_Hamstring_and_Calf_Stretch":[["Debout, un talon posé sur une marche, jambe tendue, orteils vers le haut.","Penche le buste en avant, dos plat, jusqu'à l'étirement.","Tiens 30 s et change de jambe."],["Being by looping a belt, band, or rope around one foot. While standing, place that foot forward.","Bend your back leg, while keeping the front one straight. Now raise the toes of your front foot off of the ground and lean forward.","Using the belt, pull on the top of the foot to increase the stretch in the calf. Hold for 10-20 seconds and repeat with the other foot."],["قف وكعب على درجة والساق ممدودة والأصابع للأعلى.","أمِل الجذع للأمام بظهر مستوٍ حتى التمدد.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الساق."]],"90_90_Hamstring":[["Allongé sur le dos, hanche et genou à 90°, mains derrière la cuisse.","Tends lentement la jambe vers le plafond sans bloquer le genou.","Tiens 30 s, relâche et change de jambe."],["Lie on your back, with one leg extended straight out.","With the other leg, bend the hip and knee to 90 degrees. You may brace your leg with your hands if necessary. This will be your starting position.","Extend your leg straight into the air, pausing briefly at the top. Return the leg to the starting position.","Repeat for 10-20 repetitions, and then switch to the other leg."],["استلقِ على ظهرك والورك والركبة 90° واليدان خلف الفخذ.","مدّ الساق ببطء نحو السقف دون قفل الركبة.","اثبت 30 ثانية ثم أرخِ وبدّل الساق."]],"Lying_Hamstring":[["Allongé sur le dos, une jambe tendue au sol, l'autre levée tenue par une sangle.","Rapproche la jambe levée vers toi, genou presque tendu.","Tiens 30 s sans douleur et change."],["Lie on your back with your legs extended. Your partner should be kneeling beside you. Raise one leg up towards the ceiling and have your partner hold the ankle. Your partner can use their shoulder to brace your leg if necessary. This will be your starting position.","With your partner holding your leg in place, attempt to flex the knee, contracting the hamstrings for 10-20 seconds.","Then relax your leg, allowing your partner to gently push the leg towards your head. Be sure to inform your helper when the stretch is adequate to prevent injury or overstretching. Switch sides once complete."],["استلقِ على ظهرك وساق ممدودة على الأرض والأخرى مرفوعة بحزام.","قرّب الساق المرفوعة منك والركبة شبه ممدودة.","اثبت 30 ثانية دون ألم وبدّل."]],"Quad_Stretch":[["Debout, appui sur un support, attrape le pied derrière toi.","Ramène le talon vers la fesse, genoux proches, bassin sous les épaules.","Tiens 30 s sans cambrer, puis change de jambe."],["Lay on your side. Loop a belt, rope, or band around your top foot. Flex the knee and extend your hip, attempting to touch your glutes with your foot, and holding the belt with your hands. This will be your starting position.","With the belt being held over the shoulder or overhead, gently pull to increase the stretch in the quadriceps. Hold for 10-20 seconds, and then switch sides."],["قف بدعامة وأمسك القدم خلفك.","قرّب الكعب من الأرداف والركبتان متقاربتان والحوض تحت الكتفين.","اثبت 30 ثانية دون تقوّس الظهر ثم بدّل الساق."]],"On-Your-Back_Quad_Stretch":[["Allongé sur le côté ou le ventre, saisis la cheville.","Rapproche le talon de la fesse en poussant légèrement la hanche vers l'avant.","Tiens 30 s, change de côté."],["Lie on a flat bench or step, and hang one leg and arm over the side.","Bend the knee and hold the top of the foot. As you do this, be careful not to arch your lower back.","Pull the belly button to the spine to stay in neutral. Press your foot down and into your hand. To add the hip stretch, lift the hip of the leg you're holding up toward the ceiling.","Switch sides."],["استلقِ على جنبك أو بطنك وأمسك الكاحل.","قرّب الكعب من الأرداف مع دفع الورك للأمام قليلاً.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Kneeling_Hip_Flexor":[["Un genou au sol, l'autre pied devant, buste droit.","Contracte le fessier et avance le bassin sans cambrer les lombaires.","Tiens 30 s, change de côté."],["Kneel on a mat and bring your right knee up so the bottom of your foot is on the floor and extend your left leg out behind you so the top of your foot is on the floor.","Shift your weight forward until you feel a stretch in your hip. Hold for 15 seconds, then repeat for your other side."],["ركبة على الأرض والقدم الأخرى أمامك والجذع مستقيم.","شدّ الأرداف وقدّم الحوض دون تقوّس أسفل الظهر.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Standing_Hip_Flexors":[["Debout en fente, jambe arrière tendue, mains sur la hanche.","Pousse le bassin vers l'avant en contractant le fessier arrière.","Tiens 30 s, change de côté."],["Stand up straight with the spine vertical, the left foot slightly in front of the right.","Bend both knees and lift the back heel off the floor as you press the right hip forward. You can't get a thorough, deep stretch in this position, however, because it's hard to relax the hip flexor and stand on it at the same time. Switch sides."],["قف في وضع الاندفاع والساق الخلفية ممدودة واليدان على الورك.","ادفع الحوض للأمام مع شدّ أرداف الساق الخلفية.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Intermediate_Hip_Flexor_and_Quad_Stretch":[["Genou arrière au sol, pied arrière appuyé contre un mur ou un banc.","Redresse le buste et pousse le bassin vers l'avant.","Tiens 30 s sans douleur au genou, change de côté."],["Lie face down on the floor, with a rope, belt, or band looped around one foot.","Flex the knee and extend the hip of the leg to be stretched, using both hands to pull on the belt. Your knee and your hip should come off of the floor, creating tension in the hip flexors and quadriceps. Hold the stretch for 10-20 seconds, and repeat on the other leg."],["الركبة الخلفية على الأرض والقدم الخلفية على حائط أو مقعد.","انتصب بالجذع وادفع الحوض للأمام.","اثبت 30 ثانية دون ألم في الركبة وبدّل الجهة."]],"Standing_Hip_Circles":[["Debout, appui sur un support, soulève un genou.","Dessine de grands cercles avec le genou, hanche mobile, buste stable.","Fais 10 cercles dans chaque sens, puis change de jambe."],["Begin standing on one leg, holding to a vertical support.","Raise the unsupported knee to 90 degrees. This will be your starting position.","Open the hip as far as possible, attempting to make a big circle with your knee.","Perform this movement slowly for a number of repetitions, and repeat on the other side."],["قف بدعامة وارفع ركبة.","ارسم دوائر كبيرة بالركبة والورك متحرك والجذع ثابت.","10 دوائر في كل اتجاه ثم بدّل الساق."]],"Lying_Glute":[["Allongé sur le dos, croise une cheville sur le genou opposé.","Tire la cuisse du dessous vers la poitrine jusqu'à l'étirement du fessier.","Tiens 30 s, change de côté."],["Lie on your back with your partner kneeling beside you.","Flex the hip of one leg, raising it off of the floor. Rotate the leg so the foot is over the opposite hip, the lower leg perpendicular to your body. Your partner should hold the knee and ankle in place. This will be your starting position.","Attempt to push your leg towards your partner, who should be preventing any actual movement of the leg.","After 10-20 seconds, completely relax as your partner gently pushes the ankle and knee towards your chest. Be sure to inform your helper when the stretch is adequate to prevent injury or overstretching."],["استلقِ على ظهرك واعبر كاحلاً فوق الركبة المعاكسة.","اسحب الفخذ السفلي نحو الصدر حتى تمدد الأرداف.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Seated_Glute":[["Assis sur une chaise, croise une cheville sur le genou opposé.","Penche le buste en avant, dos droit, jusqu'à l'étirement du fessier.","Tiens 30 s, change de côté."],["In a seated position with your knees bent, cross one ankle over the opposite knee. Your partner will stand behind you. Now, lean forward as your partner braces your shoulders with their hands. This will be your starting position.","Attempt to push your torso back for 10-20 seconds, as your partner prevents any actual movement of your torso.","Now relax your muscles as your partner increases the stretch by gently pushing your torso forward for 10-20 seconds."],["اجلس على كرسي واعبر كاحلاً فوق الركبة المعاكسة.","أمِل الجذع للأمام بظهر مستقيم حتى تمدد الأرداف.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"IT_Band_and_Glute_Stretch":[["Assis au sol, une jambe tendue, l'autre croisée par-dessus, pied à côté du genou.","Tourne le buste vers la jambe fléchie en poussant le genou avec le coude.","Tiens 30 s, change de côté."],["Loop a belt, rope, or band around one of your feet, and swing that leg across your body to the opposite side, keeping the leg extended as you lay on the ground. This will be your starting position.","Keeping your foot off of the floor, pull on the belt, using the tension to pull the toes up. Hold for 10-20 seconds, and repeat on the other side."],["اجلس على الأرض وساق ممدودة والأخرى معقوفة فوقها والقدم بجانب الركبة.","أدر الجذع نحو الساق المثنية مع دفع الركبة بالمرفق.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Knee_Across_The_Body":[["Allongé sur le dos, un genou fléchi, ramène-le de l'autre côté avec la main opposée.","Garde les épaules au sol pour étirer le fessier et le bas du dos.","Tiens 30 s, change de côté."],["Lie down on the floor with your right leg straight. Bend your left leg and lower it across your body, holding the knee down toward the floor with your right hand. (The knee doesn't need to touch the floor if you're tight.)","Place your left arm comfortably beside you and turn your head to the left. Imagine you have a weight tied to your tailbone. let your tailbone fall back toward the floor as your chest reaches in the opposite direction to stretch your lower back. Switch sides."],["استلقِ على ظهرك وثنِ ركبة وأحضرها للجهة الأخرى باليد المعاكسة.","أبقِ الكتفين على الأرض لتمديد الأرداف وأسفل الظهر.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Adductor":[["Debout jambes très écartées, une jambe tendue, l'autre fléchie.","Déplace le poids sur la jambe fléchie jusqu'à sentir l'intérieur de la cuisse.","Tiens 30 s, change de côté."],["Lie face down with one leg on a foam roll.","Rotate the leg so that the foam roll contacts against your inner thigh. Shift as much weight onto the foam roll as can be tolerated.","While trying to relax the muscles if the inner thigh, roll over the foam between your hip and knee, holding points of tension for 10-30 seconds. Repeat with the other leg."],["قف والساقان متباعدتان جداً وساق ممدودة والأخرى مثنية.","انقل الوزن إلى الساق المثنية حتى تشعر بداخل الفخذ.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Childs_Pose":[["À genoux, assieds-toi sur les talons, descends le buste vers l'avant.","Étire les bras devant toi, front vers le sol.","Respire profondément 30 à 60 s. Détend le bas du dos."],["Get on your hands and knees, walk your hands in front of you.","Lower your buttocks down to sit on your heels. Let your arms drag along the floor as you sit back to stretch your entire spine.","Once you settle onto your heels, bring your hands next to your feet and relax. \"breathe\" into your back. Rest your forehead on the floor. Avoid this position if you have knee problems."],["اركع واجلس على الكعبين وأنزل الجذع للأمام.","مدّ الذراعين أمامك والجبهة نحو الأرض.","تنفس بعمق 30 إلى 60 ثانية. يريح أسفل الظهر."]],"Cat_Stretch":[["À quatre pattes, mains sous les épaules, genoux sous les hanches.","Arrondis le dos en rentrant le menton, puis creuse doucement en levant la tête.","Alterne lentement 10 fois en respirant."],["Position yourself on the floor on your hands and knees.","Pull your belly in and round your spine, lower back, shoulders, and neck, letting your head drop.","Hold for 15 seconds."],["على أربع واليدان تحت الكتفين والركبتان تحت الوركين.","قوّس الظهر مع إدخال الذقن ثم تقعير لطيف مع رفع الرأس.","بدّل ببطء 10 مرات مع التنفس."]],"Hug_Knees_To_Chest":[["Allongé sur le dos, ramène les deux genoux vers la poitrine.","Entoure les jambes avec les bras et tire doucement.","Tiens 30 s en respirant. Détend les lombaires."],["Lie down on your back and pull both knees up to your chest.","Hold your arms under the knees, not over (that would put to much pressure on your knee joints).","Slowly pull the knees toward your shoulders. This also stretches your buttocks muscles."],["استلقِ على ظهرك وقرّب الركبتين من الصدر.","احتضن الساقين بالذراعين واسحب بلطف.","اثبت 30 ثانية مع التنفس. يريح أسفل الظهر."]],"One_Knee_To_Chest":[["Allongé sur le dos, une jambe tendue au sol.","Ramène l'autre genou vers la poitrine avec les mains.","Tiens 30 s, change de jambe."],["Start off by lying on the floor.","Extend one leg straight and pull the other knee to your chest. Hold under the knee joint to protect the kneecap.","Gently tug that knee toward your nose.","Switch sides. This stretches the buttocks and lower back of the bent leg and the hip flexor of the straight leg."],["استلقِ على ظهرك وساق ممدودة على الأرض.","قرّب الركبة الأخرى من الصدر باليدين.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الساق."]],"Pelvic_Tilt_Into_Bridge":[["Allongé sur le dos, genoux fléchis, pieds à plat.","Aplatis le bas du dos au sol, puis monte le bassin vertèbre par vertèbre.","Redescends lentement. Mobilise le bas du dos en douceur."],["Lie down with your feet on the floor, heels directly under your knees.","Lift only your tailbone to the ceiling to stretch your lower back. (Don't lift the entire spine yet.) Pull in your stomach.","To go into a bridge, lift the entire spine except the neck."],["استلقِ على ظهرك والركبتان مثنيتان والقدمان مسطحتان.","سطّح أسفل الظهر على الأرض ثم ارفع الحوض فقرة فقرة.","انزل ببطء. يحرّك أسفل الظهر بلطف."]],"Standing_Pelvic_Tilt":[["Debout dos au mur, talons légèrement avancés.","Aplatis le bas du dos contre le mur en contractant les abdos.","Tiens 5 s, relâche, répète 10 fois."],["Start off with your feet hip-distance apart.","Bend your knees slightly to keep them soft and springy.","You may want to move your pelvis forward and backward and back few times before holding the tailbone forward in this stretch."],["قف وظهرك للحائط والكعبان للأمام قليلاً.","سطّح أسفل الظهر على الحائط بتقلص البطن.","اثبت 5 ثوانٍ وأرخِ وكرّر 10 مرات."]],"Ankle_Circles":[["Assis ou allongé, soulève un pied du sol.","Dessine de grands cercles avec la pointe du pied, mouvement venant de la cheville.","10 cercles dans chaque sens, puis change de pied. Idéal après une entorse."],["Use a sturdy object like a squat rack to hold yourself.","Lift the right leg in the air (just around 2 inches from the floor) and perform a circular motion with the big toe. Pretend that you are drawing a big circle with it. Tip: One circle equals 1 repetition. Breathe normally as you perform the movement.","When you are done with the right foot, then repeat with the left leg."],["اجلس أو استلقِ وارفع قدماً عن الأرض.","ارسم دوائر كبيرة بمقدمة القدم والحركة من الكاحل.","10 دوائر في كل اتجاه ثم بدّل القدم. مناسب بعد التواء."]],"Peroneals_Stretch":[["Assis, jambe tendue, retourne doucement la plante du pied vers l'intérieur.","Tire la pointe du pied vers toi avec la main pour sentir l'extérieur de la jambe.","Tiens 30 s sans douleur vive, change de côté."],["In a seated position, loop a belt, rope, or band around one foot. This will be your starting position.","With the leg extended and the heel off of the ground, pull on the belt so that the foot is inverted, with the inside of the foot being pulled towards you. Hold for 10-20 seconds, and then switch sides."],["اجلس والساق ممدودة وأمل باطن القدم للداخل بلطف.","اسحب مقدمة القدم نحوك باليد لتشعر بخارج الساق.","اثبت 30 ثانية دون ألم حاد وبدّل الجهة."]],"Posterior_Tibialis_Stretch":[["Mains au mur, jambe arrière tendue, pied tourné légèrement vers l'extérieur.","Avance le bassin en gardant le talon au sol jusqu'à l'étirement profond du mollet interne.","Tiens 30 s, change de jambe."],["In a seated position, loop a belt, rope, or band around one foot. This will be your starting position.","With the leg extended and the heel off of the ground, pull on the belt so that the foot is everted, with the outside of the foot being pulled towards you. Hold for 10-20 seconds, and then switch sides."],["اليدان على الحائط والساق الخلفية ممدودة والقدم مائلة للخارج قليلاً.","قدّم الحوض مع بقاء الكعب على الأرض حتى تمدد باطن السمانة.","اثبت 30 ثانية وبدّل الساق."]],"Calves-SMR":[["Assis, rouleau sous les mollets, mains au sol, jambes tendues.","Soulève légèrement les fesses et fais rouler du genou à la cheville.","Ralentis sur les zones sensibles 20 à 30 s. Évite les articulations."],["Begin seated on the floor. Place a foam roller underneath your lower leg. Your other leg can either be crossed over the opposite or be placed on the floor, supporting some of your weight. This will be your starting position.","Place your hands to your side or just behind you, and press down to raise your hips off of the floor, placing much of your weight against your calf muscle. Roll from below the knee to above the ankle, pausing at points of tension for 10-30 seconds. Repeat for the other leg."],["اجلس والأسطوانة تحت السمانة واليدان على الأرض والساقان ممدودتان.","ارفع الأرداف قليلاً ودحرج من الركبة إلى الكاحل.","أبطئ عند المناطق الحساسة 20 إلى 30 ثانية وتجنب المفاصل."]],"Anterior_Tibialis-SMR":[["À quatre pattes, rouleau sous les tibias (côté externe).","Fais rouler lentement de la cheville vers le genou en t'appuyant sur les mains.","Sans trop de pression ; utile contre les périostites."],["Begin seated on the ground with your legs bent and your feet on the floor.","Using a Muscle Roller or a rolling pin, apply pressure to the muscles on the outside of your shins. Work from just below the knee to above the ankle, pausing at points of tension for 10-30 seconds. Repeat on the other leg."],["على أربع والأسطوانة تحت الساقين (الجهة الخارجية).","دحرج ببطء من الكاحل نحو الركبة مرتكزاً على اليدين.","دون ضغط شديد؛ مفيد للالتهاب الظنبوبي."]],"Foot-SMR":[["Debout ou assis, balle ou rouleau sous la plante du pied.","Fais rouler lentement de l'avant-pied vers le talon.","1 à 2 min par pied, pression modérée. Utile pour la fasciite plantaire."],["This exercise stretches the fascia of the muscles in the feet. Start off seated with your shoes removed. Using a foot roller or a similar object, such as a small section of pvc pipe, place your foot against the roller across the arch of your foot. This will be your starting position.","Press down firmly, rolling across the arch of your foot. Hold for 10-30 seconds, and then switch feet."],["قف أو اجلس وكرة أو أسطوانة تحت باطن القدم.","دحرج ببطء من مقدمة القدم إلى الكعب.","1 إلى 2 دقيقة لكل قدم بضغط معتدل. مفيد لالتهاب اللفافة الأخمصية."]],"Iliotibial_Tract-SMR":[["Allongé sur le côté, rouleau sous la cuisse externe, avant-bras en appui.","Fais rouler lentement de la hanche vers le genou.","Sans insister sur le genou ; 30 à 60 s par côté."],["Lay on your side, with the bottom leg placed onto a foam roller between the hip and the knee. The other leg can be crossed in front of you.","Place as much of your weight as is tolerable onto your bottom leg; there is no need to keep your bottom leg in contact with the ground. Be sure to relax the muscles of the leg you are stretching.","Roll your leg over the foam from you hip to your knee, pausing for 10-30 seconds at points of tension. Repeat with the opposite leg."],["استلقِ على جنبك والأسطوانة تحت الفخذ الخارجي والساعد مسنود.","دحرج ببطء من الورك نحو الركبة.","دون إلحاح على الركبة؛ 30 إلى 60 ثانية لكل جهة."]],"Piriformis-SMR":[["Assis sur le rouleau, une cheville croisée sur le genou opposé.","Penche-toi vers le côté croisé et fais rouler doucement le fessier.","30 à 60 s par côté, sans douleur vive."],["Sit with your buttocks on top of a foam roll. Bend your knees, and then cross one leg so that the ankle is over the knee. This will be your starting position.","Shift your weight to the side of the crossed leg, rolling over the buttocks until you feel tension in your upper glute. You may assist the stretch by using one hand to pull the bent knee towards your chest. Hold this position for 10-30 seconds, and then switch sides."],["اجلس على الأسطوانة وكاحل معقوف على الركبة المعاكسة.","مِل نحو الجهة المعقوفة ودحرج الأرداف بلطف.","30 إلى 60 ثانية لكل جهة دون ألم حاد."]],"Quadriceps-SMR":[["Allongé ventre au sol, rouleau sous les cuisses, appui sur les avant-bras.","Fais rouler de la hanche vers le genou.","30 à 60 s par jambe. Évite d'appuyer directement sur la rotule."],["Lay facedown on the floor with your weight supported by your hands or forearms. Place a foam roll underneath one leg on the quadriceps, and keep the foot off of the ground. Make sure to relax the leg as much as possible. This will be your starting position.","Shifting as much weight onto the leg to be stretched as is tolerable, roll over the foam from above the knee to below the hip, holding points of tension for 10-30 seconds. Switch sides."],["استلقِ على بطنك والأسطوانة تحت الفخذين والساعدان مسنودان.","دحرج من الورك نحو الركبة.","30 إلى 60 ثانية لكل ساق وتجنب الضغط المباشر على الرضفة."]],"Hamstring-SMR":[["Assis, rouleau sous les cuisses (arrière), mains au sol.","Fais rouler de la fesse vers le genou.","30 à 60 s par jambe, pression modérée."],["In a seated position, extend your legs over a foam roll so that it is position on the back of the upper legs. Place your hands to the side or behind you to help support your weight. This will be your starting position.","Using your hands, lift your hips off of the floor and shift your weight on the foam roll to one leg. Relax the hamstrings of the leg you are stretching.","Roll over the foam from below the hip to above the back of the knee, pausing at points of tension for 10-30 seconds. Repeat for the other leg."],["اجلس والأسطوانة تحت الفخذين من الخلف واليدان على الأرض.","دحرج من الأرداف نحو الركبة.","30 إلى 60 ثانية لكل ساق بضغط معتدل."]],"Lower_Back-SMR":[["Allongé sur le dos, rouleau sous le bas du dos, genoux fléchis.","Fais rouler très doucement, sans te cambrer.","30 à 60 s. Stoppe si la douleur est vive."],["In a seated position, place a foam roll under your lower back. Cross your arms in front of you and protract your shoulders. This will be your starting position.","Raise your hips off of the floor and lean back, keeping your weight on your lower back. Now shift your weight slightly to one side, keeping your weight off of the spine and on the muscles to the side of it. Roll over your lower back, holding points of tension for 10-30 seconds. Repeat on the other side."],["استلقِ على ظهرك والأسطوانة تحت أسفل الظهر والركبتان مثنيتان.","دحرج برفق شديد دون تقوّس.","30 إلى 60 ثانية. توقف إن كان الألم حاداً."]],"Peroneals-SMR":[["Allongé sur le côté, rouleau sous l'extérieur de la jambe.","Fais rouler lentement du genou vers la cheville.","30 à 60 s par jambe, sans douleur vive."],["Lay on your side, supporting your weight on your forearm and on a foam roller placed on the outside of your lower leg. Your upper leg can either be on top of your lower leg, or you can cross it in front of you. This will be your starting position.","Raise your hips off of the ground and begin to roll from below the knee to above the ankle on the side of your leg, pausing at points of tension for 10-30 seconds. Repeat on the other leg."],["استلقِ على جنبك والأسطوانة تحت خارج الساق.","دحرج ببطء من الركبة نحو الكاحل.","30 إلى 60 ثانية لكل ساق دون ألم حاد."]],"Chest_And_Front_Of_Shoulder_Stretch":[["Debout, bras tendus derrière le dos, mains jointes.","Lève les bras en ouvrant la poitrine.","Tiens 20 à 30 s, respire."],["Start off by standing with your legs together, holding a bodybar or a broomstick.","Take a slightly wider than shoulder width grip on the pole and hold it in front of you with your palms facing down.","Carefully lift the pole up and behind your head."],["قف والذراعان خلف الظهر واليدان متشابكتان.","ارفع الذراعين مع فتح الصدر.","اثبت 20 إلى 30 ثانية مع التنفس."]],"Shoulder_Stretch":[["Debout, ramène un bras tendu en travers de la poitrine.","Maintiens-le avec l'autre bras contre le corps.","Tiens 20 à 30 s, change de côté."],["Reach your left arm across your body and hold it straight."],["قف وأحضر ذراعاً ممدودة عبر الصدر.","ثبّتها بالذراع الأخرى على الجسم.","اثبت 20 إلى 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Side_Neck_Stretch":[["Assis ou debout, dos droit, incline la tête vers une épaule.","Aide-toi doucement de la main, l'autre épaule reste basse.","Tiens 20 à 30 s, change de côté."],["Start with your shoulders relaxed, gently tilt your head towards your shoulder.","Assist stretch with a gentle pull on the side of the head."],["اجلس أو قف بظهر مستقيم وأمِل الرأس نحو كتف.","ساعد بلطف باليد مع إبقاء الكتف الآخر منخفضاً.","اثبت 20 إلى 30 ثانية وبدّل الجهة."]],"Worlds_Greatest_Stretch":[["En fente basse, mains au sol de chaque côté du pied avant.","Tourne le buste et lève le bras du côté du pied avant vers le plafond.","Redescends, change de côté. Idéal en échauffement."],["This is a three-part stretch. Begin by lunging forward, with your front foot flat on the ground and on the toes of your back foot. With your knees bent, squat down until your knee is almost touching the ground. Keep your torso erect, and hold this position for 10-20 seconds.","Now, place the arm on the same side as your front leg on the ground, with the elbow next to the foot. Your other hand should be placed on the ground, parallel to your lead leg, to help support you during this portion of the stretch.","After 10-20 seconds, place your hands on either side of your front foot. Raise the toes of the front foot off of the ground, and straighten your leg. You may need to reposition your rear leg to do so. Hold for 10-20 seconds, and then repeat the entire sequence for the other side."],["في اندفاع منخفض واليدان على الأرض بجانبي القدم الأمامية.","أدر الجذع وارفع ذراع جهة القدم الأمامية نحو السقف.","انزل وبدّل الجهة. مثالي للإحماء."]],"Runners_Stretch":[["En fente avec les mains au sol, jambe arrière tendue.","Descends le bassin et étire la jambe avant en tendant le genou.","Alterne lentement. Étire hanches et ischios."],["It's easiest to get into this stretch if you start standing up, put one leg behind you, and slowly lower your torso down to the floor.","Keep the front heel on the floor (if it lifts up, scoot your other leg further back).","Place your hands on either side of your front leg. To get more out of this stretch, push your butt up toward the ceiling, and then gradually lower it back toward the floor. You'll Stretch the hip flexor of the back leg and the hamstring and buttocks of the front."],["في اندفاع واليدان على الأرض والساق الخلفية ممدودة.","اخفض الحوض ومدّد الساق الأمامية بمدّ الركبة.","بدّل ببطء. يمدد الوركين والعضلات الخلفية للفخذ."]],"Inchworm":[["Debout, penche-toi et pose les mains au sol devant les pieds.","Avance les mains jusqu'à la position de pompe, puis ramène les pieds vers les mains.","Redresse-toi. Échauffement complet du corps."],["Stand with your feet close together. Keeping your legs straight, stretch down and put your hands on the floor directly in front of you. This will be your starting position.","Begin by walking your hands forward slowly, alternating your left and your right. As you do so, bend only at the hip, keeping your legs straight.","Keep going until your body is parallel to the ground in a pushup position.","Now, keep your hands in place and slowly take short steps with your feet, moving only a few inches at a time.","Continue walking until your feet are by hour hands, keeping your legs straight as you do so."],["قف وانحنِ وضع اليدين على الأرض أمام القدمين.","تقدّم باليدين حتى وضع الضغط ثم قرّب القدمين من اليدين.","انتصب. إحماء كامل للجسم."]],"Torso_Rotation":[["Debout, pieds écartés, bras fléchis devant la poitrine.","Tourne le buste d'un côté puis de l'autre, hanches stables.","Fais 10 à 15 rotations lentes. Mobilité de la colonne."],["Stand upright holding an exercise ball with both hands. Extend your arms so the ball is straight out in front of you. This will be your starting position.","Rotate your torso to one side, keeping your eyes on the ball as you move. Now, rotate back to the opposite direction. Repeat for 10-20 repetitions."],["قف والقدمان متباعدتان والذراعان مثنيتان أمام الصدر.","أدر الجذع لجهة ثم للأخرى والوركان ثابتان.","10 إلى 15 دورة بطيئة. مرونة العمود الفقري."]],"Bicycling_Stationary":[["Règle la selle à hauteur de hanche, pieds bien calés sur les pédales.","Pédale à allure facile (conversation possible), cadence 80 à 90 tours/min.","20 à 45 min. Excellent remplacement de la course sans impact."],["To begin, seat yourself on the bike and adjust the seat to your height.","Select the desired option from the menu. You may have to start pedaling to turn it on. You can use the manual setting, or you can select a program to use. Typically, you can enter your age and weight to estimate the amount of calories burned during exercise. The level of resistance can be changed throughout the workout. The handles can be used to monitor your heart rate to help you stay at an appropriate intensity."],["اضبط المقعد بمستوى الورك والقدمان ثابتتان على الدواستين.","ادفع بسهولة (يمكنك الكلام) بإيقاع 80 إلى 90 دورة في الدقيقة.","20 إلى 45 دقيقة. بديل ممتاز للجري دون صدمات."]],"Recumbent_Bike":[["Assieds-toi dos calé, règle la distance des pédales jambes presque tendues.","Pédale à allure facile avec une résistance légère à modérée.","20 à 45 min. Très doux pour le dos et les genoux."],["To begin, seat yourself on the bike and adjust the seat to your height.","Select the desired option from the menu. You may have to start pedaling to turn it on. You can use the manual setting, or you can select a program to use. Typically, you can enter your age and weight to estimate the amount of calories burned during exercise. The level of resistance can be changed throughout the workout. The handles can be used to monitor your heart rate to help you stay at an appropriate intensity.","Recumbent bikes offer convenience, cardiovascular benefits, and have less impact than other activities. A 150 lb person will burn about 230 calories cycling at a moderate rate for 30 minutes, compared to 450 calories or more running."],["اجلس بظهر مسنود واضبط المسافة لتكون الساقان شبه ممدودتين.","ادفع بسهولة بمقاومة خفيفة إلى معتدلة.","20 إلى 45 دقيقة. لطيفة جداً على الظهر والركبتين."]],"Elliptical_Trainer":[["Monte sur les pédales, tiens-toi aux poignées, buste droit.","Pédale en mouvement fluide, allure facile à modérée.","20 à 40 min. Imite la foulée sans impact."],["To begin, step onto the elliptical and select the desired option from the menu. Most ellipticals have a manual setting, or you can select a program to run. Typically, you can enter your age and weight to estimate the amount of calories burned during exercise. Elevation can be adjusted to change the intensity of the workout.","The handles can be used to monitor your heart rate to help you stay at an appropriate intensity."],["اصعد على الدواستين وأمسك المقبضين والجذع مستقيم.","ادفع بحركة سلسة وبإيقاع سهل إلى معتدل.","20 إلى 40 دقيقة. يحاكي الخطوة دون صدمات."]],"Rowing_Stationary":[["Assis, pieds sanglés, dos droit, poignée en main.","Pousse sur les jambes, puis tire la poignée vers le bas des côtes en reculant le buste.","Reviens en ordre inverse : bras, buste, jambes. 15 à 30 min à allure facile."],["To begin, seat yourself on the rower. Make sure that your heels are resting comfortably against the base of the foot pedals and that the straps are secured. Select the program that you wish to use, if applicable. Sit up straight and bend forward at the hips.","There are three phases of movement when using a rower. The first phase is when you come forward on the rower. Your knees are bent and against your chest. Your upper body is leaning slightly forward while still maintaining good posture. Next, push against the foot pedals and extend your legs while bringing your hands to your upper abdominal area, squeezing your shoulders back as you do so. To avoid straining your back, use primarily your leg and hip muscles.","The recovery phase simply involves straightening your arms, bending the knees, and bringing your body forward again as you transition back into the first phase."],["اجلس والقدمان مشدودتان والظهر مستقيم والمقبض بيدك.","ادفع بالساقين ثم اسحب المقبض نحو أسفل الأضلاع مع إمالة الجذع للخلف.","ارجع بالترتيب العكسي: الذراعان ثم الجذع ثم الساقان. 15 إلى 30 دقيقة بإيقاع سهل."]],"Front_Box_Jump":[["Debout face à un box stable, pieds largeur d'épaules.","Fléchis les hanches, balance les bras et saute en réception sur tout le pied.","Redescends en marchant (pas en sautant). 3 à 5 répétitions de qualité."],["Begin with a box of an appropriate height 1-2 feet in front of you. Stand with your feet should width apart. This will be your starting position.","Perform a short squat in preparation for jumping, swinging your arms behind you.","Rebound out of this position, extending through the hips, knees, and ankles to jump as high as possible. Swing your arms forward and up.","Land on the box with the knees bent, absorbing the impact through the legs. You can jump from the box back to the ground, or preferably step down one leg at a time."],["قف أمام صندوق ثابت والقدمان بعرض الكتفين.","ثنِ الوركين وأرجح الذراعين واقفز لتهبط على كامل القدم.","انزل مشياً لا قفزاً. 3 إلى 5 تكرارات بجودة."]],"Split_Jump":[["Position fendue, buste droit, mains aux hanches.","Saute et change de jambe en l'air, réception souple.","Enchaîne en gardant le contrôle. Pliométrie : jamais fatigué ni douloureux."],["Assume a lunge stance position with one foot forward with the knee bent, and the rear knee nearly touching the ground.","Ensure that the front knee is over the midline of the foot.","Extending through both legs, jump as high as possible, swinging your arms to gain lift.","As you jump, bring your feet together, and move them back to their initial positions as you land.","Absorb the impact by reverting back to the starting position."],["وضع الاندفاع والجذع مستقيم واليدان على الوركين.","اقفز وبدّل الساقين في الهواء مع هبوط مرن.","تابع بتحكم. تمرين انفجاري: ليس عند التعب أو الألم."]],"Lateral_Bound":[["Debout sur une jambe, genou légèrement fléchi.","Saute sur le côté pour atterrir sur l'autre jambe, stabilise 1 s.","Retourne de l'autre côté. Renforce la stabilité de cheville et genou."],["Assume a half squat position facing 90 degrees from your direction of travel. This will be your starting position.","Allow your lead leg to do a countermovement inward as you shift your weight to the outside leg.","Immediately push off and extend, attempting to bound to the side as far as possible.","Upon landing, immediately push off in the opposite direction, returning to your original start position.","Continue back and forth for several repetitions."],["قف على ساق واحدة والركبة مثنية قليلاً.","اقفز جانباً لتهبط على الساق الأخرى وثبّت ثانية.","ارجع للجهة الأخرى. يقوّي ثبات الكاحل والركبة."]],"Fast_Skipping":[["Debout, buste droit, bras fléchis comme à la course.","Monte les genoux à hauteur de hanche rapidement, en pose du pied sous le bassin.","Fais 10 à 20 m par série. Excellent travail de cadence."],["Start in a relaxed position with one leg slightly forward. This will be your starting position.","Skip by executing a step-hop pattern of right-right-step to left-left-step, and so on, alternating back and forth.","Perform fast skips by maintaining close contact with the ground and reduce air time, moving as quickly as possible."],["قف والجذع مستقيم والذراعان مثنيتان كما في الجري.","ارفع الركبتين بسرعة إلى مستوى الورك مع وضع القدم تحت الحوض.","10 إلى 20 متراً في كل مجموعة. تدريب ممتاز للإيقاع."]],"Single-Leg_Hop_Progression":[["Debout sur une jambe, genou légèrement fléchi.","Saute vers l'avant sur la même jambe et stabilise la réception 1 s.","Commence par de petits sauts. Travaille l'absorption des chocs."],["Arrange a line of cones in front of you. Assume a relaxed standing position, balanced on one leg. Raise the knee of your opposite leg. This will be your starting position.","Hop forward, jumping and landing with the same leg over the cone.","Use a countermovement jump to hop from cone to cone.","At the end, turn around and go back on the other leg."],["قف على ساق واحدة والركبة مثنية قليلاً.","اقفز للأمام على نفس الساق وثبّت الهبوط ثانية.","ابدأ بقفزات صغيرة. يدرّب امتصاص الصدمات."]],"Standing_Long_Jump":[["Debout, pieds largeur d'épaules, bras en arrière.","Balance les bras vers l'avant et saute le plus loin possible.","Réceptionne genoux fléchis, stabilise 2 s. 3 à 5 sauts."],["This drill is best done in sand or other soft landing surface. Ensure that you are able to measure distance. Stand in a partial squat stance with feet shoulder width apart.","Utilizing a big arm swing and a countermovement of the legs, jump forward as far as you can.","Attempt to land with your feet out in front you, reaching as far as possible with your legs.","Measure the distance from your landing point to the starting point and track results."],["قف والقدمان بعرض الكتفين والذراعان للخلف.","أرجح الذراعين للأمام واقفز لأبعد مسافة.","اهبط والركبتان مثنيتان وثبّت ثانيتين. 3 إلى 5 قفزات."]],"rh_calf_iso":[["Debout, mains sur un mur, monte sur la pointe des deux pieds à mi-hauteur.","Maintiens la position 30 à 45 s en respirant, sans rebond.","Redescends lentement. Soulage souvent la douleur du tendon. Pas de douleur au-delà de 3/10."],["Stand with hands on a wall and rise halfway onto the balls of both feet.","Hold 30 to 45 seconds while breathing, no bouncing.","Lower slowly. Often eases tendon pain. Keep pain at or below 3/10."],["قف واليدان على الحائط وارتفع إلى منتصف الطريق على مقدمة القدمين.","اثبت 30 إلى 45 ثانية مع التنفس دون نطّ.","انزل ببطء. يخفف غالباً ألم الوتر. لا يتجاوز الألم 3/10."]],"rh_heel_drop":[["Debout sur le sol (ou le bord d'une marche si tendon non insertionnel), monte sur les deux pointes.","Passe le poids sur la jambe à soigner et descends le talon en 3 s.","Remonte avec les deux jambes. 3 séries, 1 à 2 fois par jour. Douleur tolérée jusqu'à 4/10, calmée sous 24 h."],["Stand on the floor (or a step edge if the tendon pain is not at the heel bone) and rise on both toes.","Shift your weight to the injured leg and lower the heel over 3 seconds.","Rise using both legs. 3 sets, 1 to 2 times a day. Pain up to 4/10 is acceptable if it settles within 24 hours."],["قف على الأرض (أو حافة درجة إن لم يكن الألم عند عظم الكعب) وارتفع على الأصابع.","انقل الوزن إلى الساق المصابة وأنزل الكعب خلال 3 ثوانٍ.","اصعد بالساقين معاً. 3 مجموعات مرة إلى مرتين يومياً. الألم حتى 4/10 مقبول إن هدأ خلال 24 ساعة."]],"rh_soleus_raise":[["Debout, mains sur un mur, fléchis légèrement les genoux et garde-les fléchis.","Monte sur la pointe des pieds en poussant sur le gros orteil.","Redescends en 3 s. 3 séries de 15, ajoute un sac à dos pour progresser."],["Stand with hands on a wall, bend your knees slightly and keep them bent.","Rise onto your toes, pushing through the big toe.","Lower over 3 seconds. 3 sets of 15; add a backpack to progress."],["قف واليدان على الحائط وثنِ الركبتين قليلاً وأبقهما مثنيتين.","ارتفع على أصابع القدمين بالدفع عبر الإبهام.","انزل خلال 3 ثوانٍ. 3 مجموعات من 15، أضف حقيبة ظهر للتدرج."]],"rh_tib_raise":[["Dos contre un mur, talons à 30 cm du mur, jambes tendues.","Lève les pointes de pieds vers les tibias, talons au sol.","Redescends lentement. 3 séries de 15. Une sensation de brûlure musculaire est normale."],["Lean back against a wall with heels about 30 cm from it, legs straight.","Lift the toes toward your shins, heels staying down.","Lower slowly. 3 sets of 15. A muscular burning feeling is normal."],["استند بظهرك إلى الحائط والكعبان على بعد 30 سم والساقان ممدودتان.","ارفع أصابع القدمين نحو الساقين والكعبان على الأرض.","انزل ببطء. 3 مجموعات من 15. الإحساس بحرقة عضلية طبيعي."]],"rh_short_foot":[["Assis, pied à plat. Sans plier les orteils, rapproche l'avant du pied du talon pour « creuser » la voûte.","Maintiens 5 s en gardant orteils et talon au sol.","Relâche. 10 répétitions par pied, puis fais-le debout."],["Sit with your foot flat. Without curling your toes, draw the ball of the foot toward the heel to \"dome\" the arch.","Hold 5 seconds keeping toes and heel on the floor.","Release. 10 repetitions per foot, then try it standing."],["اجلس والقدم مسطحة. دون ثني الأصابع قرّب مقدمة القدم من الكعب لتقوّس القوس.","اثبت 5 ثوانٍ مع بقاء الأصابع والكعب على الأرض.","أرخِ. 10 تكرارات لكل قدم ثم جرّبه واقفاً."]],"rh_towel_scrunch":[["Assis, pied à plat sur une serviette posée au sol.","Plie les orteils pour rapprocher la serviette vers toi.","Défroisse puis recommence. 3 séries de 15 par pied."],["Sit with your foot flat on a towel on the floor.","Curl your toes to pull the towel toward you.","Smooth it out and repeat. 3 sets of 15 per foot."],["اجلس والقدم مسطحة على منشفة على الأرض.","اثن الأصابع لسحب المنشفة نحوك.","افردها وكرّر. 3 مجموعات من 15 لكل قدم."]],"rh_plantar_raise":[["Debout, orteils posés sur une serviette roulée contre le mur, talons au sol.","Monte les talons en 3 s, tiens 2 s en haut.","Redescends en 3 s. 3 séries de 12, un jour sur deux. Douleur tolérée ≤ 4/10."],["Stand with toes resting on a rolled towel against a wall, heels on the floor.","Raise the heels over 3 seconds and hold 2 seconds at the top.","Lower over 3 seconds. 3 sets of 12, every other day. Pain ≤ 4/10 is acceptable."],["قف وأصابع القدمين على منشفة ملفوفة عند الحائط والكعبان على الأرض.","ارفع الكعبين خلال 3 ثوانٍ وثبّت ثانيتين في الأعلى.","انزل خلال 3 ثوانٍ. 3 مجموعات من 12 يوماً بعد يوم. الألم ≤ 4/10 مقبول."]],"rh_clamshell":[["Allongé sur le côté, genoux fléchis à 90°, pieds joints, bassin stable.","Ouvre le genou du dessus sans faire basculer le bassin.","Redescends lentement. 3 séries de 15 par côté. Ajoute un élastique pour progresser."],["Lie on your side, knees bent to 90°, feet together, pelvis steady.","Open the top knee without rolling the pelvis back.","Lower slowly. 3 sets of 15 per side. Add a band to progress."],["استلقِ على جنبك والركبتان مثنيتان 90° والقدمان متلاصقتان والحوض ثابت.","افتح الركبة العليا دون أن يميل الحوض للخلف.","انزل ببطء. 3 مجموعات من 15 لكل جهة. أضف شريطاً للتدرج."]],"rh_side_leg_raise":[["Allongé sur le côté, jambe du bas fléchie, jambe du dessus tendue dans l'axe du corps.","Lève la jambe du dessus de 30 à 40 cm, orteils vers l'avant.","Redescends lentement. 3 séries de 12 par côté."],["Lie on your side, bottom leg bent, top leg straight in line with the body.","Lift the top leg 30 to 40 cm with toes pointing forward.","Lower slowly. 3 sets of 12 per side."],["استلقِ على جنبك والساق السفلى مثنية والعليا ممدودة بمحاذاة الجسم.","ارفع الساق العليا 30 إلى 40 سم والأصابع للأمام.","انزل ببطء. 3 مجموعات من 12 لكل جهة."]],"rh_adductor_squeeze":[["Allongé sur le dos, genoux fléchis, un ballon ou un coussin entre les genoux.","Serre doucement le ballon pendant 5 s, sans douleur à l'aine.","Relâche. 10 répétitions, 2 à 3 séries."],["Lie on your back, knees bent, a ball or cushion between the knees.","Squeeze gently for 5 seconds with no groin pain.","Release. 10 repetitions, 2 to 3 sets."],["استلقِ على ظهرك والركبتان مثنيتان وكرة أو وسادة بينهما.","اضغط برفق 5 ثوانٍ دون ألم في الأربية.","أرخِ. 10 تكرارات و2 إلى 3 مجموعات."]],"rh_quad_iso":[["Assis jambe tendue, serviette roulée sous le genou.","Écrase la serviette en contractant le quadriceps, orteils vers toi.","Maintiens 10 s, relâche. 10 répétitions, 2 à 4 séries par jour."],["Sit with the leg straight and a rolled towel under the knee.","Press the knee into the towel by tightening the quadriceps, toes toward you.","Hold 10 seconds, release. 10 repetitions, 2 to 4 sets a day."],["اجلس والساق ممدودة ومنشفة ملفوفة تحت الركبة.","اضغط المنشفة بشدّ الرباعية والأصابع نحوك.","اثبت 10 ثوانٍ وأرخِ. 10 تكرارات و2 إلى 4 مجموعات يومياً."]],"rh_tke":[["Élastique fixé derrière le genou, debout, genou légèrement fléchi.","Tends le genou complètement en contractant le quadriceps.","Reviens lentement. 3 séries de 15 par jambe."],["Band anchored behind the knee, standing with the knee slightly bent.","Straighten the knee fully by tightening the quadriceps.","Return slowly. 3 sets of 15 per leg."],["شريط مثبت خلف الركبة وأنت واقف والركبة مثنية قليلاً.","مدّ الركبة كاملاً بشدّ الرباعية.","ارجع ببطء. 3 مجموعات من 15 لكل ساق."]],"rh_spanish_squat":[["Élastique solide fixé derrière les genoux, tibias verticaux, buste droit.","Descends à environ 60° de flexion en laissant l'élastique porter le poids vers l'arrière.","Tiens 30 à 45 s. 4 séries. Très efficace contre la douleur du tendon rotulien."],["Strong band anchored behind the knees, shins vertical, torso upright.","Lower to about 60° of knee bend, letting the band take your weight backward.","Hold 30 to 45 seconds. 4 sets. Very effective for patellar tendon pain."],["شريط قوي مثبت خلف الركبتين والساقان عموديتان والجذع مستقيم.","انزل إلى نحو 60° من ثني الركبة مع تحمّل الشريط للوزن للخلف.","اثبت 30 إلى 45 ثانية. 4 مجموعات. فعّال جداً لألم وتر الرضفة."]],"rh_step_down":[["Debout sur une marche, une jambe sur le bord, l'autre dans le vide.","Fléchis lentement la jambe d'appui en gardant le genou aligné sur le pied, talon libre touche le sol.","Remonte sans élan. 3 séries de 10 par jambe, marche basse puis plus haute."],["Stand on a step with one leg at the edge and the other hanging.","Slowly bend the standing leg, keeping the knee over the foot, until the free heel touches the floor.","Rise without momentum. 3 sets of 10 per leg, low step first then higher."],["قف على درجة وساق عند الحافة والأخرى معلقة.","ثنِ ساق الارتكاز ببطء مع محاذاة الركبة للقدم حتى يلامس الكعب الحر الأرض.","اصعد دون زخم. 3 مجموعات من 10 لكل ساق بدرجة منخفضة ثم أعلى."]],"rh_ham_iso_bridge":[["Allongé sur le dos, talons posés au sol genoux fléchis à ~60°.","Monte le bassin en poussant dans les talons et maintiens.","Tiens 30 s sans douleur vive, 4 séries."],["Lie on your back with heels on the floor and knees bent to about 60°.","Lift the hips by pressing through the heels and hold.","Hold 30 seconds without sharp pain, 4 sets."],["استلقِ على ظهرك والكعبان على الأرض والركبتان بزاوية نحو 60°.","ارفع الحوض بالدفع عبر الكعبين وثبّت.","اثبت 30 ثانية دون ألم حاد، 4 مجموعات."]],"rh_ham_slide":[["Allongé, talons sur une serviette ou des chaussettes sur sol lisse, bassin monté.","Fais glisser les talons loin de toi en gardant le bassin haut.","Ramène les talons lentement. 3 séries de 8, lentement."],["Lie with heels on a towel or socks on a smooth floor, hips lifted.","Slide the heels away while keeping the hips high.","Pull the heels back slowly. 3 sets of 8, slowly."],["استلقِ والكعبان على منشفة أو جوارب على أرض ملساء والحوض مرفوع.","اسحب الكعبين بعيداً مع إبقاء الحوض مرتفعاً.","أعد الكعبين ببطء. 3 مجموعات من 8 ببطء."]],"rh_balance":[["Debout sur une jambe près d'un appui, genou légèrement fléchi.","Garde le bassin de niveau et la voûte plantaire active pendant 30 à 45 s.","Progresse : yeux fermés, puis sur un coussin. 3 essais par jambe."],["Stand on one leg near a support, knee slightly bent.","Keep the pelvis level and the arch active for 30 to 45 seconds.","Progress: eyes closed, then on a cushion. 3 trials per leg."],["قف على ساق واحدة قرب دعامة والركبة مثنية قليلاً.","أبقِ الحوض مستوياً وقوس القدم نشطاً 30 إلى 45 ثانية.","تدرّج: عينان مغمضتان ثم على وسادة. 3 محاولات لكل ساق."]],"rh_band_eversion":[["Assis, jambe tendue, élastique autour de l'avant du pied fixé à l'intérieur.","Tourne le pied vers l'extérieur sans bouger la jambe.","Reviens lentement. 3 séries de 15 par pied."],["Sit with the leg straight, band around the forefoot anchored on the inside.","Turn the foot outward without moving the leg.","Return slowly. 3 sets of 15 per foot."],["اجلس والساق ممدودة والشريط حول مقدمة القدم مثبت من الداخل.","أدر القدم للخارج دون تحريك الساق.","ارجع ببطء. 3 مجموعات من 15 لكل قدم."]],"rh_ankle_alphabet":[["Assis, jambe tendue, pied dans le vide.","Écris les lettres de l'alphabet avec le gros orteil, mouvement venant de la cheville.","Fais-le 2 à 3 fois par jour, sans douleur vive. Idéal les premiers jours après une entorse."],["Sit with the leg straight, foot off the floor.","Trace the alphabet with the big toe, moving from the ankle.","Do it 2 to 3 times a day without sharp pain. Ideal in the first days after a sprain."],["اجلس والساق ممدودة والقدم في الهواء.","اكتب حروف الأبجدية بالإبهام والحركة من الكاحل.","كرّره 2 إلى 3 مرات يومياً دون ألم حاد. مثالي في الأيام الأولى بعد الالتواء."]],"rh_heel_walk":[["Debout, relève les pointes de pieds et marche sur les talons.","Garde le buste droit et de petits pas contrôlés.","20 m, 3 allers. Renforce le tibial antérieur."],["Stand, lift the toes and walk on your heels.","Keep the torso upright with small controlled steps.","20 m, 3 passes. Strengthens the tibialis anterior."],["قف وارفع أصابع القدمين وامشِ على الكعبين.","أبقِ الجذع مستقيماً بخطوات صغيرة متحكَّمة.","20 متراً و3 ذهابات. يقوّي الظنبوبية الأمامية."]],"rh_bird_dog":[["À quatre pattes, dos neutre, mains sous les épaules.","Tends un bras et la jambe opposée sans bouger le bassin ni creuser le dos.","Tiens 5 s, reviens et change de côté. 3 séries de 8."],["On all fours, spine neutral, hands under the shoulders.","Extend one arm and the opposite leg without rotating the pelvis or arching the back.","Hold 5 seconds, return and switch. 3 sets of 8."],["على أربع بظهر محايد واليدان تحت الكتفين.","مدّ ذراعاً والساق المعاكسة دون تدوير الحوض أو تقعير الظهر.","اثبت 5 ثوانٍ وارجع وبدّل. 3 مجموعات من 8."]],"rh_curl_up":[["Allongé, une jambe fléchie, l'autre tendue, mains sous le creux des lombaires.","Soulève légèrement la tête et les épaules en gardant le dos immobile.","Tiens 8 s, redescends. 3 séries de 8, en changeant la jambe fléchie."],["Lie with one leg bent and one straight, hands under the small of the back.","Lift the head and shoulders slightly while keeping the back still.","Hold 8 seconds, lower. 3 sets of 8, switching the bent leg."],["استلقِ وساق مثنية والأخرى ممدودة واليدان تحت تقعير أسفل الظهر.","ارفع الرأس والكتفين قليلاً مع ثبات الظهر.","اثبت 8 ثوانٍ وانزل. 3 مجموعات من 8 مع تبديل الساق المثنية."]],"rh_hip_hinge":[["Dos à 15 cm d'un mur, pieds largeur de hanches, genoux souples.","Recule le bassin pour toucher le mur en gardant le dos plat.","Reviens en poussant les hanches vers l'avant. 3 séries de 10."],["Stand 15 cm from a wall facing away, feet hip-width, knees soft.","Push the hips back to touch the wall keeping the back flat.","Return by driving the hips forward. 3 sets of 10."],["قف على بعد 15 سم من الحائط وظهرك له والقدمان بعرض الوركين والركبتان مرنتان.","ادفع الحوض للخلف ليلامس الحائط مع ظهر مستوٍ.","ارجع بدفع الوركين للأمام. 3 مجموعات من 10."]],"rh_side_plank_knees":[["Sur le côté, genoux fléchis, avant-bras au sol sous l'épaule.","Soulève le bassin pour aligner épaule, hanche et genou.","Tiens 20 s sans t'affaisser, 3 fois par côté."],["On your side, knees bent, forearm on the floor under the shoulder.","Lift the hips to line up shoulder, hip and knee.","Hold 20 seconds without sagging, 3 times per side."],["على جنبك والركبتان مثنيتان والساعد على الأرض تحت الكتف.","ارفع الحوض ليصطف الكتف والورك والركبة.","اثبت 20 ثانية دون هبوط، 3 مرات لكل جهة."]],"rh_single_rdl":[["Debout sur une jambe, genou légèrement fléchi, mains devant toi.","Penche le buste en envoyant l'autre jambe vers l'arrière, dos plat.","Reviens en contractant le fessier. 3 séries de 8 par jambe, sans charge d'abord."],["Stand on one leg with a slightly bent knee, hands in front.","Hinge forward sending the other leg back, back flat.","Return by squeezing the glute. 3 sets of 8 per leg, bodyweight first."],["قف على ساق واحدة والركبة مثنية قليلاً واليدان أمامك.","أمِل الجذع للأمام مع إرسال الساق الأخرى للخلف والظهر مستوٍ.","ارجع بشدّ الأرداف. 3 مجموعات من 8 لكل ساق بوزن الجسم أولاً."]],"rh_march_run":[["Sur terrain plat et souple, marche 5 min pour t'échauffer.","Alterne 1 min de petite foulée facile et 2 min de marche, 6 à 8 fois.","Si la douleur reste ≤ 2/10 et disparaît dans les 24 h, passe à 2 min de course / 1 min de marche la fois suivante."],["On flat, soft ground, walk 5 minutes to warm up.","Alternate 1 minute of easy short strides and 2 minutes of walking, 6 to 8 times.","If pain stays ≤ 2/10 and settles within 24 hours, move to 2 minutes run / 1 minute walk next time."],["على أرض مستوية ولينة امشِ 5 دقائق للإحماء.","بدّل دقيقة جري بخطوات صغيرة سهلة مع دقيقتي مشي، 6 إلى 8 مرات.","إن بقي الألم ≤ 2/10 وزال خلال 24 ساعة فانتقل إلى دقيقتي جري / دقيقة مشي في المرة التالية."]]};
window.EXD_REHAB={"zones":{"hip":{"phases":[["rh_clamshell","rh_adductor_squeeze","Lying_Glute"],["rh_side_leg_raise","rh_step_down","Kneeling_Hip_Flexor"],["rh_single_rdl","rh_march_run"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur de hanche ou d'aine : souvent surcharge des muscles stabilisateurs (fessiers, adducteurs, fléchisseurs).","en":"Hip or groin pain: usually overload of the stabilising muscles (glutes, adductors, hip flexors).","ar":"ألم الورك أو الأربية: غالباً إجهاد للعضلات المثبّتة (الأرداف، المقرّبات، ثانيات الورك)."},"advice":{"fr":["Renforce les fessiers 3 fois par semaine : ils déchargent la hanche.","Évite de rester assis longtemps sans bouger.","Reprends la course en alternant marche et course."],"en":["Strengthen the glutes 3 times a week: they offload the hip.","Avoid sitting for long periods without moving.","Return to running by alternating walking and running."],"ar":["قوِّ الأرداف 3 مرات أسبوعياً فهي تخفف الحمل عن الورك.","تجنب الجلوس طويلاً دون حركة.","عد إلى الجري بالتناوب بين المشي والجري."]},"avoid":{"fr":["Les côtes, descentes et fentes profondes tant que la douleur dépasse 3/10.","Les étirements forcés de l'aine."],"en":["Hills, downhills and deep lunges while pain is above 3/10.","Forced groin stretching."],"ar":["المرتفعات والمنحدرات والاندفاع العميق ما دام الألم فوق 3/10.","التمدد القسري للأربية."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo, natation (sans brasse), elliptique","en":"Cycling, swimming (no breaststroke), elliptical","ar":"الدراجة، السباحة (دون سباحة الضفدع)، الإهليلجي"}},"thighF":{"phases":[["rh_quad_iso","Quad_Stretch"],["rh_tke","rh_spanish_squat","Kneeling_Hip_Flexor"],["rh_step_down","rh_march_run"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur à l'avant de la cuisse : surcharge du quadriceps ou des fléchisseurs de hanche.","en":"Pain at the front of the thigh: quadriceps or hip flexor overload.","ar":"ألم أمام الفخذ: إجهاد للعضلة الرباعية أو ثانيات الورك."},"advice":{"fr":["Renforce le quadriceps en isométrie puis en excentrique lent.","Fais un échauffement progressif avant chaque séance.","Masse doucement, sans appuyer sur la zone douloureuse."],"en":["Strengthen the quadriceps isometrically, then with slow eccentrics.","Warm up progressively before each session.","Massage gently, never press on the sore spot."],"ar":["قوِّ الرباعية بالانقباض الثابت ثم بالحركة البطيئة.","سخّن تدريجياً قبل كل حصة.","دلّك بلطف دون الضغط على موضع الألم."]},"avoid":{"fr":["Les descentes et la vitesse tant que la douleur persiste.","Les étirements violents sur un muscle douloureux."],"en":["Downhills and speed work while pain lasts.","Aggressive stretching on a sore muscle."],"ar":["المنحدرات والسرعة ما دام الألم موجوداً.","التمدد العنيف على عضلة متألمة."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo léger, natation, aquajogging","en":"Easy cycling, swimming, aqua-jogging","ar":"دراجة خفيفة، سباحة، جري في الماء"}},"knee":{"phases":[["rh_quad_iso","rh_clamshell","rh_balance"],["rh_tke","rh_spanish_squat","rh_step_down"],["rh_march_run","Iliotibial_Tract-SMR"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur au genou : syndrome fémoro-patellaire ou bandelette ilio-tibiale le plus souvent chez le coureur.","en":"Knee pain: in runners most often patellofemoral pain or iliotibial band syndrome.","ar":"ألم الركبة: عند العدّائين غالباً متلازمة الرضفة أو الشريط الحرقفي الظنبوبي."},"advice":{"fr":["Renforce quadriceps et fessiers : c'est le traitement de référence.","Raccourcis la foulée et augmente la cadence de 5 %.","Privilégie les terrains plats et souples."],"en":["Strengthen quads and glutes: this is the reference treatment.","Shorten your stride and raise cadence by 5%.","Prefer flat, soft surfaces."],"ar":["قوِّ الرباعية والأرداف فهذا هو العلاج المرجعي.","اقصّر الخطوة وارفع الوتيرة 5٪.","فضّل الأرض المسطحة واللينة."]},"avoid":{"fr":["Les descentes, escaliers et squats profonds tant que ça fait mal.","Courir en boitant : tu aggraverais la compensation."],"en":["Downhills, stairs and deep squats while it hurts.","Running with a limp: it worsens compensation."],"ar":["المنحدرات والدرج والقرفصاء العميق ما دام مؤلماً.","الجري مع العرج فهو يزيد التعويض."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo (selle haute), natation, elliptique","en":"Cycling (high saddle), swimming, elliptical","ar":"دراجة (مقعد مرتفع)، سباحة، إهليلجي"}},"shin":{"phases":[["rh_tib_raise","Anterior_Tibialis-SMR"],["rh_heel_walk","rh_band_eversion","rh_soleus_raise"],["rh_march_run","Calves-SMR"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur au tibia : périostite tibiale, très fréquente quand on augmente trop vite le volume.","en":"Shin pain: medial tibial stress syndrome, common after raising volume too quickly.","ar":"ألم الساق الأمامية: التهاب السمحاق، شائع عند زيادة الحجم بسرعة."},"advice":{"fr":["Réduis le volume de 30 à 50 % et supprime les côtes.","Change de chaussures si elles ont plus de 700 km.","Reprends sur terrain souple, par petites étapes."],"en":["Cut volume by 30 to 50% and drop hills.","Replace shoes older than 700 km.","Return on soft ground in small steps."],"ar":["اخفض الحجم 30 إلى 50٪ وأوقف المرتفعات.","بدّل الحذاء إذا تجاوز 700 كم.","عد على أرض لينة بخطوات صغيرة."]},"avoid":{"fr":["La vitesse, le bitume et les sauts tant que la zone est sensible.","Courir à travers la douleur."],"en":["Speed, tarmac and jumping while the area is tender.","Running through the pain."],"ar":["السرعة والأسفلت والقفز ما دامت المنطقة حساسة.","الجري رغم الألم."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo, natation, aquajogging","en":"Cycling, swimming, aqua-jogging","ar":"دراجة، سباحة، جري في الماء"}},"ankle":{"phases":[["rh_ankle_alphabet","rh_short_foot","rh_balance"],["rh_band_eversion","rh_soleus_raise","Peroneals_Stretch"],["rh_single_rdl","rh_march_run"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur à la cheville : entorse ancienne ou tendons péroniers fatigués.","en":"Ankle pain: an old sprain or tired peroneal tendons.","ar":"ألم الكاحل: التواء قديم أو إجهاد أوتار الشظية."},"advice":{"fr":["Retrouve d'abord la mobilité puis l'équilibre sur une jambe.","Travaille pieds nus à la maison pour réveiller les petits muscles.","Évite les sols irréguliers au début."],"en":["Restore mobility first, then single-leg balance.","Train barefoot at home to wake the small muscles.","Avoid uneven ground at first."],"ar":["استعد الحركة أولاً ثم التوازن على ساق واحدة.","تمرّن حافي القدمين في المنزل لإيقاظ العضلات الصغيرة.","تجنب الأرض غير المستوية في البداية."]},"avoid":{"fr":["Les sentiers techniques et les appuis latéraux brusques.","Un bandage permanent : il affaiblit la cheville."],"en":["Technical trails and sharp side-steps.","A permanent brace: it weakens the ankle."],"ar":["المسارات الوعرة والحركات الجانبية المفاجئة.","الرباط الدائم فهو يضعف الكاحل."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo, natation","en":"Cycling, swimming","ar":"دراجة، سباحة"}},"foot":{"phases":[["rh_towel_scrunch","rh_short_foot","Foot-SMR"],["rh_plantar_raise","rh_balance","Calf_Stretch_Hands_Against_Wall"],["rh_march_run"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur au pied : fasciite plantaire ou fatigue de la voûte, surtout au premier pas le matin.","en":"Foot pain: plantar fasciitis or arch fatigue, worst with the first steps in the morning.","ar":"ألم القدم: التهاب اللفافة الأخمصية أو إجهاد قوس القدم، خاصة عند أول خطوات الصباح."},"advice":{"fr":["Roule la voûte sur une balle 2 minutes par jour.","Étire les mollets : ils tirent sur la plante.","Évite de marcher pieds nus sur sol dur."],"en":["Roll the arch over a ball 2 minutes a day.","Stretch the calves: they pull on the sole.","Avoid walking barefoot on hard floors."],"ar":["دحرج القوس على كرة دقيقتين يومياً.","مدّد السمانة فهي تشدّ باطن القدم.","تجنب المشي حافياً على أرض صلبة."]},"avoid":{"fr":["Les chaussures trop plates ou usées.","La vitesse et les sprints tant que la plante est douloureuse."],"en":["Flat or worn-out shoes.","Speed and sprints while the sole is sore."],"ar":["الأحذية المسطحة أو البالية.","السرعة والعدو ما دام باطن القدم مؤلماً."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo, natation, aquajogging","en":"Cycling, swimming, aqua-jogging","ar":"دراجة، سباحة، جري في الماء"}},"lowBack":{"phases":[["rh_bird_dog","rh_curl_up","Cat_Stretch"],["rh_side_plank_knees","rh_hip_hinge","Childs_Pose"],["rh_single_rdl","rh_march_run"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur lombaire : le plus souvent une fatigue musculaire du tronc, sans gravité si elle reste locale.","en":"Low back pain: usually trunk muscle fatigue, harmless when it stays local.","ar":"ألم أسفل الظهر: غالباً إجهاد عضلات الجذع، وهو غير خطير إن بقي موضعياً."},"advice":{"fr":["Reste actif : marcher aide plus que le repos complet.","Renforce le tronc (gainage doux) chaque jour.","Bouge toutes les 45 minutes si tu es assis."],"en":["Stay active: walking helps more than complete rest.","Strengthen the trunk (gentle bracing) daily.","Move every 45 minutes if you sit a lot."],"ar":["ابقَ نشيطاً فالمشي أفضل من الراحة التامة.","قوِّ الجذع بتمارين ثبات لطيفة يومياً.","تحرّك كل 45 دقيقة إن كنت تجلس كثيراً."]},"avoid":{"fr":["Les charges lourdes (soulevé de terre, squat) tant que ça tire.","Flexions complètes du buste avec les jambes tendues."],"en":["Heavy loads (deadlift, squat) while it pulls.","Full trunk bends with straight legs."],"ar":["الأحمال الثقيلة (الرفعة الميتة، القرفصاء) ما دام الشدّ موجوداً.","ثني الجذع الكامل بساقين مستقيمتين."]},"cross":{"fr":"Marche, natation sur le dos, vélo droit","en":"Walking, backstroke, upright cycling","ar":"المشي، السباحة على الظهر، دراجة بوضعية منتصبة"}},"thighB":{"phases":[["rh_ham_iso_bridge","Hamstring-SMR"],["rh_ham_slide","rh_hip_hinge","Lying_Hamstring"],["rh_single_rdl","rh_march_run"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur à l'arrière de la cuisse : ischio-jambiers, souvent à la reprise de la vitesse.","en":"Pain at the back of the thigh: hamstrings, often when speed work resumes.","ar":"ألم خلف الفخذ: أوتار الركبة، غالباً عند العودة للسرعة."},"advice":{"fr":["Isométrie d'abord, puis charge progressive en excentrique.","Reprends la vitesse en dernier, après 2 semaines sans douleur.","Échauffe-toi longtemps avant les fractionnés."],"en":["Isometrics first, then progressive eccentric load.","Add speed last, after 2 pain-free weeks.","Warm up for longer before intervals."],"ar":["الانقباض الثابت أولاً ثم حمل تدريجي بالحركة السلبية.","أضف السرعة في النهاية بعد أسبوعين بلا ألم.","سخّن مدة أطول قبل التقطيع."]},"avoid":{"fr":["Les sprints et les fractionnés tant qu'une gêne subsiste.","Les étirements forcés : le muscle est déjà tendu."],"en":["Sprints and intervals while any discomfort remains.","Forced stretching: the muscle is already tight."],"ar":["العدو والتقطيع ما دام أي انزعاج قائماً.","التمدد القسري فالعضلة مشدودة أصلاً."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo, natation, aquajogging","en":"Cycling, swimming, aqua-jogging","ar":"دراجة، سباحة، جري في الماء"}},"calf":{"phases":[["rh_calf_iso","Calves-SMR"],["rh_soleus_raise","rh_heel_drop","Standing_Soleus_And_Achilles_Stretch"],["rh_single_rdl","rh_march_run"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur au mollet : fatigue ou petite lésion du gastrocnémien ou du soléaire.","en":"Calf pain: fatigue or a minor strain of the gastrocnemius or soleus.","ar":"ألم السمانة: إجهاد أو تمزق صغير في التوأم أو النعلية."},"advice":{"fr":["Hydrate-toi et vérifie ton apport en magnésium.","Reprends par la marche rapide avant la course.","Monte progressivement la charge sur les pointes de pied."],"en":["Stay hydrated and check your magnesium intake.","Start with brisk walking before running.","Progressively load calf raises."],"ar":["اشرب بما يكفي وراجع تناولك للمغنيزيوم.","ابدأ بالمشي السريع قبل الجري.","زد الحمل تدريجياً على رفع الكعبين."]},"avoid":{"fr":["Les sprints et les côtes tant que la pointe de pied fait mal.","Les massages profonds en phase aiguë."],"en":["Sprints and hills while calf raises hurt.","Deep massage in the acute phase."],"ar":["العدو والمرتفعات ما دام رفع الكعب مؤلماً.","التدليك العميق في المرحلة الحادة."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo léger, natation","en":"Easy cycling, swimming","ar":"دراجة خفيفة، سباحة"}},"achilles":{"phases":[["rh_calf_iso","Calves-SMR"],["rh_heel_drop","rh_soleus_raise","Calf_Stretch_Hands_Against_Wall"],["rh_single_rdl","rh_march_run"]],"what":{"fr":"Douleur au tendon d'Achille : tendinopathie, qui guérit par charge progressive et non par repos total.","en":"Achilles pain: tendinopathy, which heals with progressive loading rather than complete rest.","ar":"ألم وتر أخيل: اعتلال وتري، يشفى بالحمل التدريجي لا بالراحة التامة."},"advice":{"fr":["Isométrie 4 × 30 s : elle calme la douleur.","Excentriques lents (talon) une fois par jour, 3 à 6 semaines.","Surélève légèrement le talon de tes chaussures au début."],"en":["Isometrics 4 x 30 s: they calm the pain.","Slow heel-drop eccentrics once a day for 3 to 6 weeks.","Slightly raise the heel of your shoes at first."],"ar":["انقباض ثابت 4 × 30 ث فهو يهدّئ الألم.","نزول الكعب البطيء مرة يومياً لمدة 3 إلى 6 أسابيع.","ارفع كعب حذائك قليلاً في البداية."]},"avoid":{"fr":["La vitesse, les côtes et les sauts.","Les étirements violents du tendon et les infiltrations sans avis médical."],"en":["Speed, hills and jumping.","Aggressive tendon stretching."],"ar":["السرعة والمرتفعات والقفز.","التمدد العنيف للوتر."]},"cross":{"fr":"Vélo, natation, aquajogging","en":"Cycling, swimming, aqua-jogging","ar":"دراجة، سباحة، جري في الماء"}}},"common":{"red":{"fr":["Impossible d'appuyer sur la jambe ou de marcher normalement.","Gonflement important, chaleur, rougeur ou déformation.","Douleur la nuit ou au repos qui ne s'apaise pas.","Engourdissement, fourmillements ou perte de force."],"en":["You cannot bear weight or walk normally.","Major swelling, heat, redness or deformity.","Night or rest pain that does not ease.","Numbness, tingling or loss of strength."],"ar":["عدم القدرة على الاستناد على الساق أو المشي بشكل طبيعي.","تورم كبير أو حرارة أو احمرار أو تشوه.","ألم ليلي أو أثناء الراحة لا يهدأ.","خدر أو تنميل أو فقدان القوة."]},"ret":{"fr":["Marche sans douleur 30 minutes","Montée d'escalier et squat sans douleur","Test de saut léger sans douleur","Pas de douleur le lendemain de l'effort"],"en":["Pain-free 30-minute walk","Pain-free stairs and squat","Pain-free light hopping","No pain the day after effort"],"ar":["مشي 30 دقيقة دون ألم","صعود الدرج والقرفصاء دون ألم","قفز خفيف دون ألم","لا ألم في اليوم التالي للجهد"]},"disc":{"fr":"Ces conseils sont généraux et ne remplacent pas un avis médical. Si la douleur persiste, consulte un médecin ou un kiné.","en":"This is general guidance and does not replace medical advice. If pain persists, see a doctor or physiotherapist.","ar":"هذه نصائح عامة ولا تغني عن الاستشارة الطبية. إذا استمر الألم فاستشر طبيباً أو أخصائي علاج طبيعي."}}};
